(3215772, 451444, 48890, '<td valign="top">I''m getting tired of seeing the same picture over and over again.  In my opinion, from the photography''s standpoint, this portrait is just like many others; most of the impact of this portrait comes from the choice of the model.  Granted, spotting a subject/model also takes skill, but I believe a true photographer should strive to remove his dependency on the subject, whereas pictures like this demonstrate how strongly some well-regarded photographers depend on their subjects. 4</td>', 'I''m getting tired of seeing the same picture over and over again.  In my opinion, from the photography''s standpoint, this portrait is just like many others; most of the impact of this portrait comes from the choice of the model.  Granted, spotting a subject/model also takes skill, but I believe a true photographer should strive to remove his dependency on the subject, whereas pictures like this demonstrate how strongly some well-regarded photographers depend on their subjects. 4', '2007-01-12 00:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
