(3218046, 447638, 7628, '<td valign="top">NIce sunset glow of light  - so real you can smell the salt air. I particularly like the light on the rocks in the foreground. I like the deep blue of the sky - but there seems to be a good bit of noise in the thin clouds at the very top of the frame - probably from boosting the saturation. I wish the red on the lighthouse wasn''t so neon bright.  The horizon is not quite straight - when I line it up with the edge of the window it is only slightly off, but for some reason it seems more tilted - perhaps the distortion from the lens is adding to the illutsion?</td>', 'NIce sunset glow of light  - so real you can smell the salt air. I particularly like the light on the rocks in the foreground. I like the deep blue of the sky - but there seems to be a good bit of noise in the thin clouds at the very top of the frame - probably from boosting the saturation. I wish the red on the lighthouse wasn''t so neon bright.  The horizon is not quite straight - when I line it up with the edge of the window it is only slightly off, but for some reason it seems more tilted - perhaps the distortion from the lens is adding to the illutsion?', '2007-01-12 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
