(3218166, 447517, 27562, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a lot of Galen Rowell''s work (who happens to be my favorite photographer).  Great color saturation &amp; excellent symmetry. My only slight criticism who be that since the climber is in silhouette (which I really like) it would have been better if he (she?) were looking out over the over look, and thus getting their facial features in silhouette.  Great image ~ 8.</td>', 'Reminds me a lot of Galen Rowell''s work (who happens to be my favorite photographer).  Great color saturation & excellent symmetry. My only slight criticism who be that since the climber is in silhouette (which I really like) it would have been better if he (she?) were looking out over the over look, and thus getting their facial features in silhouette.  Great image ~ 8.', '2007-01-12 10:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218168, 451889, 7628, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition - I like the reflection and the detail in the bushes and tree.  The composition works well with the tree on the thrids line.  I''d brighten things up a bit - there is some nice color in the shadows.  You can keep the details in the sky by using shadow/highlights and a bit of judicious burning.<br/>I like this better:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=452133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/452133.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/452133.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/452133.jpg"/></a> <br/>dunno what you think.</td>', 'Beautiful composition - I like the reflection and the detail in the bushes and tree.  The composition works well with the tree on the thrids line.  I''d brighten things up a bit - there is some nice color in the shadows.  You can keep the details in the sky by using shadow/highlights and a bit of judicious burning.I like this better: dunno what you think.', '2007-01-12 10:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218169, 451844, 55956, '<td valign="top">the cut on the fishing rod and the boy on the lower side aren''t beatiful....</td>', 'the cut on the fishing rod and the boy on the lower side aren''t beatiful....', '2007-01-12 10:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218171, 449939, 55956, '<td valign="top">great perspective</td>', 'great perspective', '2007-01-12 10:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218173, 448121, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, can you please tell me where this is?</td>', 'This is lovely, can you please tell me where this is?', '2007-01-12 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218181, 449543, 13207, '<td valign="top">Could be good but too much post processing for me - especially evident in her hair.</td>', 'Could be good but too much post processing for me - especially evident in her hair.', '2007-01-12 10:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218185, 449878, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice macro, good lighting, clever title</td>', 'nice macro, good lighting, clever title', '2007-01-12 10:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218187, 451111, 13207, '<td valign="top">Adorable, but I wish the eye color hadn''t been adjusted - I think I would have preferred it without this.</td>', 'Adorable, but I wish the eye color hadn''t been adjusted - I think I would have preferred it without this.', '2007-01-12 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218188, 448410, 2764, '<td valign="top">A sunset is like a joke - sometimes you just had to be there.  They don''t translate well into photos.  An interesting foreground helps.  This is a lovely sunset and it must have been specatular in real life.  I like how the colors are richer in the water than the sky. I like the perfect mirror image.  The branches on the right, do the add? detract?  I think the image is better with the branches but would have been even better if there was, say, an interesting silouette of a tree.  I know, as photographers we take what we get.</td>', 'A sunset is like a joke - sometimes you just had to be there.  They don''t translate well into photos.  An interesting foreground helps.  This is a lovely sunset and it must have been specatular in real life.  I like how the colors are richer in the water than the sky. I like the perfect mirror image.  The branches on the right, do the add? detract?  I think the image is better with the branches but would have been even better if there was, say, an interesting silouette of a tree.  I know, as photographers we take what we get.', '2007-01-12 10:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218189, 447568, 16241, '<td valign="top">awwwwwwwwwwww, sweet shot.</td>', 'awwwwwwwwwwww, sweet shot.', '2007-01-12 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218191, 450206, 16241, '<td valign="top">looks like a great place to visit.</td>', 'looks like a great place to visit.', '2007-01-12 10:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218195, 447982, 2764, '<td valign="top">hey, he''s cute.  I especially like how his colors match yet are slightly brighter than his background.  The splotch of yellow really stands out.</td>', 'hey, he''s cute.  I especially like how his colors match yet are slightly brighter than his background.  The splotch of yellow really stands out.', '2007-01-12 10:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218200, 448129, 15711, '<td valign="top">Darling portrait. The line created by the hat is good, but since it''s blurred because of the DOF&lt; it almost distracts my eye a bit. Lovely face and eyes. 7</td>', 'Darling portrait. The line created by the hat is good, but since it''s blurred because of the DOF< it almost distracts my eye a bit. Lovely face and eyes. 7', '2007-01-12 10:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218205, 449457, 21714, '<td valign="top">Delighted to see this one.</td>', 'Delighted to see this one.', '2007-01-12 10:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218206, 449171, 15711, '<td valign="top">You never think of swans flying? Aren''t those geese?  Love the line and the high contrast. 7</td>', 'You never think of swans flying? Aren''t those geese?  Love the line and the high contrast. 7', '2007-01-12 10:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218209, 451808, 3459, '<td valign="top">10!</td>', '10!', '2007-01-12 10:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218210, 447620, 66353, '<td valign="top">Cute :)</td>', 'Cute :)', '2007-01-12 10:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218211, 451430, 2764, '<td valign="top">oh my.  this is a frightening image.  Have I seen this in a bad dream? that is a huge fire!  It is well composed too.  The dark verticals are so strong and straight while the reds and yellows are all swirly and irregular.  The chaos is going to win over the order.  or is it?  will the strong beams remain after the firestorm?</td>', 'oh my.  this is a frightening image.  Have I seen this in a bad dream? that is a huge fire!  It is well composed too.  The dark verticals are so strong and straight while the reds and yellows are all swirly and irregular.  The chaos is going to win over the order.  or is it?  will the strong beams remain after the firestorm?', '2007-01-12 10:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218213, 449055, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the shooting star. WOW - no grain.  That''s spectacular.</td>', 'Love the shooting star. WOW - no grain.  That''s spectacular.', '2007-01-12 10:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218217, 449365, 64352, '<td valign="top">I only wish the light from the strobe was a bit warmer in this image...</td>', 'I only wish the light from the strobe was a bit warmer in this image...', '2007-01-12 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218218, 451788, 16241, '<td valign="top">schweet!</td>', 'schweet!', '2007-01-12 10:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218219, 451063, 38407, '<td valign="top">very sweet! added to my favorites!</td>', 'very sweet! added to my favorites!', '2007-01-12 10:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218220, 451788, 15711, '<td valign="top">Man, that is GREAT. I love the whole story it tells. Perfect contrast and variation of tone.  The bike wheel really makes it for me.</td>', 'Man, that is GREAT. I love the whole story it tells. Perfect contrast and variation of tone.  The bike wheel really makes it for me.', '2007-01-12 10:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218224, 451173, 3459, '<td valign="top">10!</td>', '10!', '2007-01-12 10:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218226, 450989, 15711, '<td valign="top">Spectacular.  Wonderful color, movement and so artfully presented.  Terrific.  I hope it does well for you. 9</td>', 'Spectacular.  Wonderful color, movement and so artfully presented.  Terrific.  I hope it does well for you. 9', '2007-01-12 10:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218227, 451566, 49109, '<td valign="top">great image.</td>', 'great image.', '2007-01-12 10:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218228, 449035, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Just like a French postcard.</td>', 'Very nice.  Just like a French postcard.', '2007-01-12 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218230, 451537, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ah!  I love this processing.  I hope there are details in the image description.  It makes everything look like a fairy land at dusk. Surely there is an enchanted ball being held in the building on the right and all the lovley  ladies arrived in that boat.  Soon they will all stroll out onto the bridge.  Thanks for the fantasy!</td>', 'Ah!  I love this processing.  I hope there are details in the image description.  It makes everything look like a fairy land at dusk. Surely there is an enchanted ball being held in the building on the right and all the lovley  ladies arrived in that boat.  Soon they will all stroll out onto the bridge.  Thanks for the fantasy!', '2007-01-12 10:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218234, 448158, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW!!</td>', 'WOW!!', '2007-01-12 10:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218236, 451955, 15711, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous tones and contrasts.  8</td>', 'Gorgeous tones and contrasts.  8', '2007-01-12 10:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218237, 447829, 49109, '<td valign="top">overall a bit too dark</td>', 'overall a bit too dark', '2007-01-12 10:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218238, 451750, 2764, '<td valign="top">Speed conveyed by this image.  Whats the rush, where is everyone going so fast?  The downside of our modern life.  PS..  I like the stars.</td>', 'Speed conveyed by this image.  Whats the rush, where is everyone going so fast?  The downside of our modern life.  PS..  I like the stars.', '2007-01-12 10:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218239, 451824, 30608, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2007-01-12 10:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218240, 450003, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular. I remember her. Such a wonderful face for such a small child.  More than cutesy.  Intricate and wise like an old soul.  Brilliant. 9</td>', 'This is spectacular. I remember her. Such a wonderful face for such a small child.  More than cutesy.  Intricate and wise like an old soul.  Brilliant. 9', '2007-01-12 10:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218241, 449779, 15711, '<td valign="top">DUDE - this is excellent. Love the comp. and light.  Great tonal quality throughout.  8</td>', 'DUDE - this is excellent. Love the comp. and light.  Great tonal quality throughout.  8', '2007-01-12 10:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218247, 447767, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is nice.  Reminds me of the setting of the winning autumn cat shot.  Love the bird, although he seems slightly out of focus to me.</td>', 'Oh this is nice.  Reminds me of the setting of the winning autumn cat shot.  Love the bird, although he seems slightly out of focus to me.', '2007-01-12 10:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218252, 449472, 1, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective.  I like it.</td>', 'Simple, effective.  I like it.', '2007-01-12 10:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218253, 449349, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the guy on the left with his arms up. 7</td>', 'I like the guy on the left with his arms up. 7', '2007-01-12 10:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218255, 451741, 30608, '<td valign="top">Sure wish this was sized to the maximum permitted size to see the real beauty of this shot.</td>', 'Sure wish this was sized to the maximum permitted size to see the real beauty of this shot.', '2007-01-12 10:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218256, 450993, 15711, '<td valign="top">oooh - Yummy tones. 8</td>', 'oooh - Yummy tones. 8', '2007-01-12 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218261, 449035, 1, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the white border helps the sepia-toned shot.  Additionally, the glow around the two people in the foreground and buildings (esp. top left) suggests poor editing.</td>', 'I don''t think the white border helps the sepia-toned shot.  Additionally, the glow around the two people in the foreground and buildings (esp. top left) suggests poor editing.', '2007-01-12 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218262, 451444, 64352, '<td valign="top">Wow... Friggin WOW!</td>', 'Wow... Friggin WOW!', '2007-01-12 10:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218265, 451151, 13207, '<td valign="top">I think a little more focus/less blur would have helped this shot.  I like the selective de-sat.</td>', 'I think a little more focus/less blur would have helped this shot.  I like the selective de-sat.', '2007-01-12 10:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218266, 447509, 28710, '<td valign="top">Striking and very well pulled off. I like that the light is slightly off-center.</td>', 'Striking and very well pulled off. I like that the light is slightly off-center.', '2007-01-12 10:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218271, 451719, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow, spectacular.  The dark/drab colors really fit the subject.  The framing and composure are perfect.</td>', 'Wow, spectacular.  The dark/drab colors really fit the subject.  The framing and composure are perfect.', '2007-01-12 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218278, 447492, 28710, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. Personally I would have cropped a bit higher to slice off some of the engine... probably would have brought the width in a bit too just to get the height back up there too... Maybe just to where the line of rivets end. The border color is less thanideal imho. neat how it has its own gradients though.</td>', 'Pretty cool. Personally I would have cropped a bit higher to slice off some of the engine... probably would have brought the width in a bit too just to get the height back up there too... Maybe just to where the line of rivets end. The border color is less thanideal imho. neat how it has its own gradients though.', '2007-01-12 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218279, 451491, 45115, '<td valign="top">Danica????</td>', 'Danica????', '2007-01-12 10:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218286, 447982, 9765, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Shame about the twigs but, that''s nature.</td>', 'Nice shot! Shame about the twigs but, that''s nature.', '2007-01-12 10:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218290, 450682, 3942, '<td valign="top">Usually I do not like all the shots of house cats very much. But yours is the first exeption! The cat is really beautiful and you where able, to show that beauty in your photo. Thanks für sharing and good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'Usually I do not like all the shots of house cats very much. But yours is the first exeption! The cat is really beautiful and you where able, to show that beauty in your photo. Thanks für sharing and good luck for the challenge!', '2007-01-12 10:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218298, 451302, 29293, '<td valign="top">this is so nice i would love to have a print of it!</td>', 'this is so nice i would love to have a print of it!', '2007-01-12 10:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218301, 449364, 29293, '<td valign="top">great color and contrast</td>', 'great color and contrast', '2007-01-12 10:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218302, 447683, 15711, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fabulous. Perfect comp and coloration.  Man this is brilliant. 10</td>', 'Absolutely fabulous. Perfect comp and coloration.  Man this is brilliant. 10', '2007-01-12 10:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218303, 451221, 28710, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Could probably use just a smidgen off the right and bottom. I would have gone typical thirds with this one with the boarder on the right third and the carve on the left third. the negative space isn''t really adding much imho. It looks tack sharp and I bet that the pic would indeed look better with those elements enlarged via the cropping of excess.</td>', 'Cool shot. Could probably use just a smidgen off the right and bottom. I would have gone typical thirds with this one with the boarder on the right third and the carve on the left third. the negative space isn''t really adding much imho. It looks tack sharp and I bet that the pic would indeed look better with those elements enlarged via the cropping of excess.', '2007-01-12 10:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218304, 451939, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the dark background works with this, everything seems to blend together. Good set up/props though</td>', 'I''m not sure the dark background works with this, everything seems to blend together. Good set up/props though', '2007-01-12 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218306, 447984, 29293, '<td valign="top">lovely color</td>', 'lovely color', '2007-01-12 10:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218308, 451947, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image could be a bit sharper. Good candid photo, a bit busy</td>', 'Image could be a bit sharper. Good candid photo, a bit busy', '2007-01-12 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3218310, 447864, 27087, '<td valign="top">The colors &amp; clarity in this image is why digital was created, very nice-8</td>', 'The colors & clarity in this image is why digital was created, very nice-8', '2007-01-12 10:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218311, 449581, 2764, '<td valign="top">Doesnt this have to be a 10?  The lines, the angle of his head, the worn T shirt, the colors the 5:00 shadow, the expression, movement implied by the weight of the head.  Will he fall asleep standing?  or will his head roll gently around?  Yup, has to be a 10.</td>', 'Doesnt this have to be a 10?  The lines, the angle of his head, the worn T shirt, the colors the 5:00 shadow, the expression, movement implied by the weight of the head.  Will he fall asleep standing?  or will his head roll gently around?  Yup, has to be a 10.', '2007-01-12 10:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218319, 451715, 43774, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look appealing. Looks like you used a flash, light from that is harsh.</td>', 'This doesn''t look appealing. Looks like you used a flash, light from that is harsh.', '2007-01-12 10:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218321, 451748, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good macro, I like the blue tones. I do not like the clumping mascara, very distracting. I think a natural look would be better.</td>', 'Good macro, I like the blue tones. I do not like the clumping mascara, very distracting. I think a natural look would be better.', '2007-01-12 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218322, 448260, 64352, '<td valign="top">Eyes seem a little over processed.</td>', 'Eyes seem a little over processed.', '2007-01-12 10:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218325, 451545, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''d crop out a bit more of the sky. I like the house and the fence</td>', 'I''d crop out a bit more of the sky. I like the house and the fence', '2007-01-12 10:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218326, 451964, 27087, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, nice work-8</td>', 'Cool photo, nice work-8', '2007-01-12 10:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218327, 450931, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the flower. Could use a bit more DOF maybe. Not fond of the overexposed background.</td>', 'Nice colours in the flower. Could use a bit more DOF maybe. Not fond of the overexposed background.', '2007-01-12 10:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218330, 451881, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice light vs dark there. Too bad the center is off-center... the bottom seems straight, so not much you can do about it. Architectural  shots are tricky. Also, watch for blown highlights in the clouds. Maybe a bit of HDR type layering with a tiny bit of burn might have helped a bit in the early stages of processing.</td>', 'Nice light vs dark there. Too bad the center is off-center... the bottom seems straight, so not much you can do about it. Architectural  shots are tricky. Also, watch for blown highlights in the clouds. Maybe a bit of HDR type layering with a tiny bit of burn might have helped a bit in the early stages of processing.', '2007-01-12 10:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218333, 448237, 27087, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition, love it.-8</td>', 'wonderful composition, love it.-8', '2007-01-12 10:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218335, 451696, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image looks slightly tilted. I am not a fan of shots directly into the sun. Foreground is too dark for my tastes.</td>', 'Image looks slightly tilted. I am not a fan of shots directly into the sun. Foreground is too dark for my tastes.', '2007-01-12 10:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218337, 447854, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image could be sharper. She is a bit too centered. Purple tones are nice.</td>', 'Image could be sharper. She is a bit too centered. Purple tones are nice.', '2007-01-12 10:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218339, 447620, 13207, '<td valign="top">Adorable.</td>', 'Adorable.', '2007-01-12 10:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218340, 451441, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat capture. Image could use either some brightening up, more contrast or a bit of saturation to bring out the colours in the sky.</td>', 'Neat capture. Image could use either some brightening up, more contrast or a bit of saturation to bring out the colours in the sky.', '2007-01-12 10:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218341, 448785, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid photo</td>', 'Very nice candid photo', '2007-01-12 10:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218342, 449226, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great image, excellent title (I would have gone for House Harkonen, but that''s just me), 10!</td>', 'Great image, excellent title (I would have gone for House Harkonen, but that''s just me), 10!', '2007-01-12 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218343, 447673, 28710, '<td valign="top">Everything leads to the primary subject - the lock - which is not in focus. The impact of the photo is lacking as a results. Things that might help could include a bit of a contrast boost in that area...</td>', 'Everything leads to the primary subject - the lock - which is not in focus. The impact of the photo is lacking as a results. Things that might help could include a bit of a contrast boost in that area...', '2007-01-12 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218344, 449785, 2764, '<td valign="top">The lighting is harsh, a flash is too much for such a tiny baby.  But who cares?  This image is pure emotion, the tiny nose, the tiny fist, the giant jacket, the implied separation as Dad goes back to war.  That''s what makes this picture wonderful.  My son is a Marine with (so far) two tours in Afghanistan at 21 years.  No baby yet but yes, the difficulty of him being gone, the contradiction of feeling so proud of him and so distressed by this war.  So ignore the comments about the light, you have a spectacular photo here.</td>', 'The lighting is harsh, a flash is too much for such a tiny baby.  But who cares?  This image is pure emotion, the tiny nose, the tiny fist, the giant jacket, the implied separation as Dad goes back to war.  That''s what makes this picture wonderful.  My son is a Marine with (so far) two tours in Afghanistan at 21 years.  No baby yet but yes, the difficulty of him being gone, the contradiction of feeling so proud of him and so distressed by this war.  So ignore the comments about the light, you have a spectacular photo here.', '2007-01-12 10:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218347, 448822, 29293, '<td valign="top">great tones</td>', 'great tones', '2007-01-12 10:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218348, 449975, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great capture but I think you ruined it with your processing, all I can focus on is the halo around the girl, it looks like she was pasted on (I know she wasn''t but that halo ruins it for me).</td>', 'Great capture but I think you ruined it with your processing, all I can focus on is the halo around the girl, it looks like she was pasted on (I know she wasn''t but that halo ruins it for me).', '2007-01-12 10:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218349, 451319, 27087, '<td valign="top">Looks like it should be a Timex Ad or That''s Dad just before he gets the Bar tab, nice work -8</td>', 'Looks like it should be a Timex Ad or That''s Dad just before he gets the Bar tab, nice work -8', '2007-01-12 10:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218351, 447865, 28710, '<td valign="top">I really like how you did this. I''m not sure if the mist is all natural, but it certainly feels like there is some processing at work here. A bit of extra dodging on that path would really give this a magical zing.</td>', 'I really like how you did this. I''m not sure if the mist is all natural, but it certainly feels like there is some processing at work here. A bit of extra dodging on that path would really give this a magical zing.', '2007-01-12 10:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218354, 448658, 3459, '<td valign="top">Perfect! 10! (I used to live in NYC for many years, this is great!)</td>', 'Perfect! 10! (I used to live in NYC for many years, this is great!)', '2007-01-12 10:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218355, 451228, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Image could be a bit sharper.', '2007-01-12 10:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3218356, 449039, 22689, '<td valign="top">Vivid colors , crisp focus , excellent timing ! Really nice !</td>', 'Vivid colors , crisp focus , excellent timing ! Really nice !', '2007-01-12 10:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
