(3218589, 447600, 28710, '<td valign="top">Man, this is great... Right down to the brown speckling on the stem indicating that the flower is not in the best of conditions...<br/> <br/>Only one real disappointment is that your reds channel is badly suffering from oversaturation. Please check your histogram before and after post processing. The pistils suffer badly here, but the edges of the petals are also affected. Nonetheless, for later, you could easily fix that, so I''ll just pull it down a bit on technical merit.</td>', 'Man, this is great... Right down to the brown speckling on the stem indicating that the flower is not in the best of conditions... Only one real disappointment is that your reds channel is badly suffering from oversaturation. Please check your histogram before and after post processing. The pistils suffer badly here, but the edges of the petals are also affected. Nonetheless, for later, you could easily fix that, so I''ll just pull it down a bit on technical merit.', '2007-01-12 11:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
