(3219371, 449457, 25397, '<td valign="top">As far as true photography goes, this is what it''s all about. When I look at this I get a sense of timelessness. What''s rare about this wedding photo is that it has a captured moment that both the bride and advanced photographic eyes can appreciate and cherish. It''s a nice piece of commerical work and art. It''s a brave move to enter something like this in a community like DPC. It''s contrasty, grainy, her heads chopped off and most of all- fucking awesome. Keep it real and take the powah back. 10</td>', 'As far as true photography goes, this is what it''s all about. When I look at this I get a sense of timelessness. What''s rare about this wedding photo is that it has a captured moment that both the bride and advanced photographic eyes can appreciate and cherish. It''s a nice piece of commerical work and art. It''s a brave move to enter something like this in a community like DPC. It''s contrasty, grainy, her heads chopped off and most of all- fucking awesome. Keep it real and take the powah back. 10', '2007-01-12 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
