(3220661, 447584, 22537, '<td valign="top">beautiful and sharp image of the bird.  I''m not really sure if I like how tight it was cropped as the image seems too restricted and makes me focus too much on the imperfections of the subject. Either way, cool submission!  Good luck.</td>', 'beautiful and sharp image of the bird.  I''m not really sure if I like how tight it was cropped as the image seems too restricted and makes me focus too much on the imperfections of the subject. Either way, cool submission!  Good luck.', '2007-01-12 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
