(3220827, 448934, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is quite lovely. I think it suffers from a bit of what I''m going to call "under-effect" that I suspect is probably the result of somewhat less-than-striking composition. The colors of the water and the mud on the shore being essentially the same has a lot to do with this, I suspect. If I were you, I would draw greater attention to the leopard''s (is that what atht is?) colors by experimenting with greater saturation of the subject and some selective desaturation of the surrounding environment. That, I suspect, could take this lovely composition and turn it into something truly fabulous. 6 from me.</td>', 'This is quite lovely. I think it suffers from a bit of what I''m going to call "under-effect" that I suspect is probably the result of somewhat less-than-striking composition. The colors of the water and the mud on the shore being essentially the same has a lot to do with this, I suspect. If I were you, I would draw greater attention to the leopard''s (is that what atht is?) colors by experimenting with greater saturation of the subject and some selective desaturation of the surrounding environment. That, I suspect, could take this lovely composition and turn it into something truly fabulous. 6 from me.', '2007-01-12 16:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3220828, 451924, 13207, '<td valign="top">Baby''s cute but the shot isn''t so great.  Lighting looks to me to be a little harsh and the whites have a bluish tinge, especially in his/her eyes.</td>', 'Baby''s cute but the shot isn''t so great.  Lighting looks to me to be a little harsh and the whites have a bluish tinge, especially in his/her eyes.', '2007-01-12 16:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
