(3220961, 447804, 12200, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and vantage, the softness of the skin, and the lighting. But I loathe the "posed" look of the subject...as though she''s waiting for someone off the screen to take the "real" picture, and this one was just caught from someone else in the room, perhaps standing on the bed looking down at her during her photo shoot. That''s not a criticism of the shot''s execution...just something that for me weakens the artistic persuasiveness of its content.</td>', 'I love the angle and vantage, the softness of the skin, and the lighting. But I loathe the "posed" look of the subject...as though she''s waiting for someone off the screen to take the "real" picture, and this one was just caught from someone else in the room, perhaps standing on the bed looking down at her during her photo shoot. That''s not a criticism of the shot''s execution...just something that for me weakens the artistic persuasiveness of its content.', '2007-01-12 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
