(3220978, 451954, 12200, '<td valign="top">Lovely. There''s something about the bottom left corner that makes me feel like my eyes aren''t focusing right, though. I have no idea what it is...maybe something slightly obscuring the lens there? Maybe I''m the anomaly, but if others are mentioning this too, then you might consider sharpening the focus of this composition by cropping from the left and bottom to get the center part of the flower in the lower right corner instead. I think that wouldn''t compromise the composition, even if it would mean losing a substantial portion of the rest of the flower. 6 from me.</td>', 'Lovely. There''s something about the bottom left corner that makes me feel like my eyes aren''t focusing right, though. I have no idea what it is...maybe something slightly obscuring the lens there? Maybe I''m the anomaly, but if others are mentioning this too, then you might consider sharpening the focus of this composition by cropping from the left and bottom to get the center part of the flower in the lower right corner instead. I think that wouldn''t compromise the composition, even if it would mean losing a substantial portion of the rest of the flower. 6 from me.', '2007-01-12 16:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
