(3222878, 448413, 2764, '<td valign="top">First, your model is lovely.  and so is your portrait of her.  Does she like it?  Have you tried the technique where you make a duplicate layer and get the glow perfect, like you have, on the top layer.  Then erase the eyes so they are sharp from the bottom layer.  It might give her eyes a bit more sparkle.  It is nice how you have done it too.</td>', 'First, your model is lovely.  and so is your portrait of her.  Does she like it?  Have you tried the technique where you make a duplicate layer and get the glow perfect, like you have, on the top layer.  Then erase the eyes so they are sharp from the bottom layer.  It might give her eyes a bit more sparkle.  It is nice how you have done it too.', '2007-01-12 21:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
