(3222933, 451441, 2764, '<td valign="top">If this were the middle ages you''d be hailed as a saint or a heretic.  Beyond the cross as a point of interest, however, there is not much else in the picture to hold me here.  The sky is not quite dramatic enough, the ground is too dark.  It is hard to tell what the shite stuff is, snow? water? Wait, that''s a plam tree, it can''t be snow.  An intersting something to sillouette sould make the whole image stronger.</td>', 'If this were the middle ages you''d be hailed as a saint or a heretic.  Beyond the cross as a point of interest, however, there is not much else in the picture to hold me here.  The sky is not quite dramatic enough, the ground is too dark.  It is hard to tell what the shite stuff is, snow? water? Wait, that''s a plam tree, it can''t be snow.  An intersting something to sillouette sould make the whole image stronger.', '2007-01-12 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222934, 451852, 22046, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like high key portraits but this one really works. Love his eyes and his beard.</td>', 'I usually don''t like high key portraits but this one really works. Love his eyes and his beard.', '2007-01-12 22:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
