(3222939, 450961, 22046, '<td valign="top">Perfect depth of field and focus. The eye goes - zing - right to those snails and stays there. Feels like you are looking into the photo. Well done.</td>', 'Perfect depth of field and focus. The eye goes - zing - right to those snails and stays there. Feels like you are looking into the photo. Well done.', '2007-01-12 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
