(3222996, 451754, 2764, '<td valign="top">Where is this?  it looks so interesting.  How big are these things?  This is an almost but not quite image for me.  It is almost stunning but the orbs in the background are poorly arranged, there are too many colors and I don''t think the color of the water or the vertical reflections adds anything.  Now, I suppose you couldn''t get in the water and move the yellow and red ones around so they didnt obscure the onion stem, so my complaints are totally unrealisitic.  I just think your score will reflect the haphazard array of the whatever-they-ares.</td>', 'Where is this?  it looks so interesting.  How big are these things?  This is an almost but not quite image for me.  It is almost stunning but the orbs in the background are poorly arranged, there are too many colors and I don''t think the color of the water or the vertical reflections adds anything.  Now, I suppose you couldn''t get in the water and move the yellow and red ones around so they didnt obscure the onion stem, so my complaints are totally unrealisitic.  I just think your score will reflect the haphazard array of the whatever-they-ares.', '2007-01-12 22:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
