(3223949, 450682, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!   I thought I''d been about as blown away by cat photos as I could possibly get in the Pet challenge -- but this takes "blown away" to a new level.   How did you GET that amazing 3-dimensional effect!  I swear Smithers is in the room with me now!  Wow!   FanTASTIC photography!   I hope the voters are still loving cats because this one deserves top honors!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!   I thought I''d been about as blown away by cat photos as I could possibly get in the Pet challenge -- but this takes "blown away" to a new level.   How did you GET that amazing 3-dimensional effect!  I swear Smithers is in the room with me now!  Wow!   FanTASTIC photography!   I hope the voters are still loving cats because this one deserves top honors!', '2007-01-13 01:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223954, 449428, 24454, '<td valign="top">The texture and detail in this is absolutely stunning!  Beautiful photography!</td>', 'The texture and detail in this is absolutely stunning!  Beautiful photography!', '2007-01-13 02:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223956, 448632, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love this.  Normally, I don''t care for out-of-the-ordinary processing on animals -- or even scenery for that matter, but for some reason, it really works here.  It enhances that old worn-out texture.  And its really hard for me not to love elephant pictures anyway :)  Great job!</td>', 'I really love this.  Normally, I don''t care for out-of-the-ordinary processing on animals -- or even scenery for that matter, but for some reason, it really works here.  It enhances that old worn-out texture.  And its really hard for me not to love elephant pictures anyway :)  Great job!', '2007-01-13 02:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223960, 451908, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so simple and yet so elegant and beautiful.  I love the minimalist look to it -- and that perfect splash of blue from her dress.  Excellent!</td>', 'This is so simple and yet so elegant and beautiful.  I love the minimalist look to it -- and that perfect splash of blue from her dress.  Excellent!', '2007-01-13 02:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
