(3225226, 449788, 2764, '<td valign="top">Phew!  Another lovely 10!  This is lovely and goes to my favorites.  Did you mean for it to be tilted slightly to the right?  My right brain self thinks that swing chains should obey gravity and hang straight.  The light here is a joy to look at, the memories of summer and childhood and my childrens childhood, the wonderful sillouette of the big tree.  Ah, this is the color of the world I grew up in, made all peaceful with all badness and pain removed.  I just LOVE this photo!</td>', 'Phew!  Another lovely 10!  This is lovely and goes to my favorites.  Did you mean for it to be tilted slightly to the right?  My right brain self thinks that swing chains should obey gravity and hang straight.  The light here is a joy to look at, the memories of summer and childhood and my childrens childhood, the wonderful sillouette of the big tree.  Ah, this is the color of the world I grew up in, made all peaceful with all badness and pain removed.  I just LOVE this photo!', '2007-01-13 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
