(3225369, 450086, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. Not so sure I like the faded edges all around though</td>', 'Beautiful sky. Not so sure I like the faded edges all around though', '2007-01-13 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225370, 447500, 43774, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scenery, could use a bit of contrast</td>', 'Gorgeous scenery, could use a bit of contrast', '2007-01-13 11:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225371, 448924, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and mist</td>', 'Beautiful light and mist', '2007-01-13 11:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225372, 450993, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, contrast works well</td>', 'Nice shot, contrast works well', '2007-01-13 11:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225374, 450682, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and light</td>', 'Nice colours and light', '2007-01-13 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225400, 451354, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture - and I like the face peering out of the shadows behind.  Nutcracker performance? To have the ground at the bottom give good reference.  I wish there were more room at the top.  The composition feels a little unbalanced and squished as a result.</td>', 'Nice motion capture - and I like the face peering out of the shadows behind.  Nutcracker performance? To have the ground at the bottom give good reference.  I wish there were more room at the top.  The composition feels a little unbalanced and squished as a result.', '2007-01-13 11:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225403, 451055, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... really artistic... almost abstract... somewhat ethereal... love it.</td>', 'Beautiful... really artistic... almost abstract... somewhat ethereal... love it.', '2007-01-13 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225410, 448601, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful use of light and shadow - the black and white presentation works really well especially as you''ve included the extremes of the tonal range - lots of black and just the right amount of white.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful use of light and shadow - the black and white presentation works really well especially as you''ve included the extremes of the tonal range - lots of black and just the right amount of white.', '2007-01-13 11:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225411, 450962, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the simlplicity of the shot - it is all about horizontal lines of city and cloud.  The orange/peach color of the sky is very peaceful.  I wish there were some more detail - either more tonal range or some one spot for my eyes to focus on.  My eyes tend to swoop in and out on the photo on the horizontal lines, with nothing to stop and rest on.</td>', 'I like the simlplicity of the shot - it is all about horizontal lines of city and cloud.  The orange/peach color of the sky is very peaceful.  I wish there were some more detail - either more tonal range or some one spot for my eyes to focus on.  My eyes tend to swoop in and out on the photo on the horizontal lines, with nothing to stop and rest on.', '2007-01-13 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225419, 449158, 3087, '<td valign="top">Really like the way the wide angle creates such strong leading lines all pullng the eye right into the scene. High contrast black and white works really well to bring out the details. The shadows at the lower left, top left and along the top edge of the frame are a bit heavy for my preferences though.</td>', 'Really like the way the wide angle creates such strong leading lines all pullng the eye right into the scene. High contrast black and white works really well to bring out the details. The shadows at the lower left, top left and along the top edge of the frame are a bit heavy for my preferences though.', '2007-01-13 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225422, 451218, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful composition.   I love silhouette photos and this one is an exceptionally awesome one!</td>', 'Very beautiful composition.   I love silhouette photos and this one is an exceptionally awesome one!', '2007-01-13 11:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225424, 451873, 7628, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF.  With all the bright color and instense expressions it would be hard to kow what to focus on.  The sharpness of the man in the foreground and the decorative pole leading your eye to him makes the shot "pop" - the men in the background serve nicely to reinforce the main characters expression - making you wonder what their situation is - they don''t seem at ease with the situation.  Love that bright orange wall!</td>', 'Good use of DOF.  With all the bright color and instense expressions it would be hard to kow what to focus on.  The sharpness of the man in the foreground and the decorative pole leading your eye to him makes the shot "pop" - the men in the background serve nicely to reinforce the main characters expression - making you wonder what their situation is - they don''t seem at ease with the situation.  Love that bright orange wall!', '2007-01-13 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225435, 451444, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic up-close-and-personal portrait with wonderful sharpness. Do like the high contrast but perhaps it''s a touch too high - the whites seem a little harsh. But perhaps that was the intention.</td>', 'Fantastic up-close-and-personal portrait with wonderful sharpness. Do like the high contrast but perhaps it''s a touch too high - the whites seem a little harsh. But perhaps that was the intention.', '2007-01-13 11:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225440, 447992, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, serene, almost spiritual scene. Composition works so well - inclusion of the birds is just perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful, serene, almost spiritual scene. Composition works so well - inclusion of the birds is just perfect.', '2007-01-13 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225441, 451163, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the idea to bring something more to this kind of image by creating such a striking foreground - also makes more of a story of a night party on the beach!</td>', 'Like the idea to bring something more to this kind of image by creating such a striking foreground - also makes more of a story of a night party on the beach!', '2007-01-13 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225445, 449390, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like the photojournalistic look of this photo.   And it tugs on me emotionally because that impish little face with those freckles reminds me of my own son when he was that age!   Nice job.</td>', 'I like the photojournalistic look of this photo.   And it tugs on me emotionally because that impish little face with those freckles reminds me of my own son when he was that age!   Nice job.', '2007-01-13 11:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225447, 448044, 7628, '<td valign="top">the soft focus and glow work well here - empasizing the elegance dressage. Good composition - the horse and rider on thirds lines, the stong white rail grounding them in back and the simple green foliage behind.  The photo IS dressage - elegant and controlled.</td>', 'the soft focus and glow work well here - empasizing the elegance dressage. Good composition - the horse and rider on thirds lines, the stong white rail grounding them in back and the simple green foliage behind.  The photo IS dressage - elegant and controlled.', '2007-01-13 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225448, 448679, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how I LOVE th Olympic area!  What a beautiful photo!</td>', 'Oh how I LOVE th Olympic area!  What a beautiful photo!', '2007-01-13 11:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225450, 449472, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect composition - those leading lines and clean, clean surfaces are very striking - the assymetry of the lone person draws the eyes in. Works precisely because it''s such an usual, geometric composition using more uncluttered, almost negative space than expected.</td>', 'Absolutely perfect composition - those leading lines and clean, clean surfaces are very striking - the assymetry of the lone person draws the eyes in. Works precisely because it''s such an usual, geometric composition using more uncluttered, almost negative space than expected.', '2007-01-13 11:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225451, 447561, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very striking!  What a majectic looking horse!   The rider is pretty noble looking as well :)   Nice job!</td>', 'This is very striking!  What a majectic looking horse!   The rider is pretty noble looking as well :)   Nice job!', '2007-01-13 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225460, 451175, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an incredible subject - well found/ chosen! The overwhelming mid-tone grey of the image really focuses attention on the shapes and details. Interesting.</td>', 'What an incredible subject - well found/ chosen! The overwhelming mid-tone grey of the image really focuses attention on the shapes and details. Interesting.', '2007-01-13 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225464, 451471, 7628, '<td valign="top">The golden branches frame the sunset nicely.  The soft focus makes it feel like a pleasant memory.  Line the line of trees on the horizon is straight, the line of the water is tilted left - it feels off to me - but maybe it looks more off if you staighten the water and have the trees off.  I guess it is no big deal.  Wish the sun were on the bottom thirds line with more sky to the left and above.</td>', 'The golden branches frame the sunset nicely.  The soft focus makes it feel like a pleasant memory.  Line the line of trees on the horizon is straight, the line of the water is tilted left - it feels off to me - but maybe it looks more off if you staighten the water and have the trees off.  I guess it is no big deal.  Wish the sun were on the bottom thirds line with more sky to the left and above.', '2007-01-13 11:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225466, 447671, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo!  Interesting and perfect composition.  I wish there was a little bit more contrast in the mountains, but nothing takes away too much from the beauty of this crisp, sharp gorgeously lit and colored morning photo!</td>', 'What a beautiful photo!  Interesting and perfect composition.  I wish there was a little bit more contrast in the mountains, but nothing takes away too much from the beauty of this crisp, sharp gorgeously lit and colored morning photo!', '2007-01-13 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225468, 450625, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail to shoot and I love the composition you''ve chosen...</td>', 'Lovely detail to shoot and I love the composition you''ve chosen...', '2007-01-13 11:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225471, 448158, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well, that was a lot of effort to go to just to feature in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Not sure whether this is a photo of a print or TV, etc. (the rule eagles will be getting hot under the collar perhaps) but I do like the sense of the movement. Your framing is strange but it somewhow works - as if widescreen TV.</td>', 'Well, that was a lot of effort to go to just to feature in this challenge. Not sure whether this is a photo of a print or TV, etc. (the rule eagles will be getting hot under the collar perhaps) but I do like the sense of the movement. Your framing is strange but it somewhow works - as if widescreen TV.', '2007-01-13 11:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225474, 449078, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely softness and richness created by your choice of focus.</td>', 'Lovely softness and richness created by your choice of focus.', '2007-01-13 11:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225480, 451149, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Works really well!</td>', 'Very nice! Works really well!', '2007-01-13 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225486, 449833, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting and the composition in this.  Good capture of the lines in the sand/dirt.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting and the composition in this.  Good capture of the lines in the sand/dirt.', '2007-01-13 11:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225487, 448601, 8860, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I like it. The frame is way too strong for me though and I do think the subject is wanting for some other focal point - such as an object highlighted in the rays. Difficult composition too since your subject occupies only a third of the space but it''s sitting off-centre.</td>', 'Interesting - I like it. The frame is way too strong for me though and I do think the subject is wanting for some other focal point - such as an object highlighted in the rays. Difficult composition too since your subject occupies only a third of the space but it''s sitting off-centre.', '2007-01-13 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225490, 449496, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo, technically very well done, good clarity</td>', 'Very cute photo, technically very well done, good clarity', '2007-01-13 11:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
