(3225516, 451755, 43774, '<td valign="top">No so sure I like the yellow sky but I love everything else.</td>', 'No so sure I like the yellow sky but I love everything else.', '2007-01-13 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225518, 448838, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!!</td>', 'Excellent capture!!', '2007-01-13 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225521, 448899, 8860, '<td valign="top">A bit too contrasty and your subject (the ship) seems a little to uninvolved in the scene. I''m sorry to say that really don''t like purple skies like this and it does nothing for your scene. I would probably have made this a black and white to deliver for more evocation of mood.</td>', 'A bit too contrasty and your subject (the ship) seems a little to uninvolved in the scene. I''m sorry to say that really don''t like purple skies like this and it does nothing for your scene. I would probably have made this a black and white to deliver for more evocation of mood.', '2007-01-13 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225522, 447981, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. The detail and colours are amazing. I love that there are more peilcans in the background. Well done!<br/>Back to say I''ve finished voting and this is one of the few 10''s I gave out. Good luck!!</td>', 'Really beautiful. The detail and colours are amazing. I love that there are more peilcans in the background. Well done!Back to say I''ve finished voting and this is one of the few 10''s I gave out. Good luck!!', '2007-01-13 12:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
