(3225607, 451797, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus and I like the contrast between the blues and yellows.  I also think the centered composition works for the shape of the flower.  I really don''t like the grey on the edge of the petals or background, though.</td>', 'Good focus and I like the contrast between the blues and yellows.  I also think the centered composition works for the shape of the flower.  I really don''t like the grey on the edge of the petals or background, though.', '2007-01-13 12:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
