(3225611, 451780, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!  Now this is one that for me has that immediate "heart-tug" emotional impact.  Part of it is that I''m so so inordinately partial to elephants -- but the rest is that you just captured an amazing moment!  I love the texture and tones!  Great job!</td>', 'Oh yes!  Now this is one that for me has that immediate "heart-tug" emotional impact.  Part of it is that I''m so so inordinately partial to elephants -- but the rest is that you just captured an amazing moment!  I love the texture and tones!  Great job!', '2007-01-13 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225614, 448927, 51538, '<td valign="top">Conversion to a high contrast image might have made this work a bit better.  Or perhaps accentuate the sky with processing and then select the ground and runner and elevate the contrast and desaturated to a silhouette.  Has potential.</td>', 'Conversion to a high contrast image might have made this work a bit better.  Or perhaps accentuate the sky with processing and then select the ground and runner and elevate the contrast and desaturated to a silhouette.  Has potential.', '2007-01-13 12:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
