(3225626, 450772, 811, '<td valign="top">That is gorgeous.  The only negative comment I could make is that I think it would be stronger compositionally if the sun and people were either on the left or right, but not so much in the middle.  The eyes tend to go up and down between the two, but there is nothing to attract the eyes to look at the rest of the picture.</td>', 'That is gorgeous.  The only negative comment I could make is that I think it would be stronger compositionally if the sun and people were either on the left or right, but not so much in the middle.  The eyes tend to go up and down between the two, but there is nothing to attract the eyes to look at the rest of the picture.', '2007-01-13 12:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225632, 451691, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think people who have access to the Northern Lights should automatically be given a -2 handicap :)   JUST KIDDING!   This is off-the-chart stunning, and I would kill to have a "Best Of" photo that looked this amazing!</td>', 'I think people who have access to the Northern Lights should automatically be given a -2 handicap :)   JUST KIDDING!   This is off-the-chart stunning, and I would kill to have a "Best Of" photo that looked this amazing!', '2007-01-13 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
