(3225884, 451132, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the large and small in this composition, and the black and white is AWESOME!  The only things that bother me are clouds.  While I understand that you can''t change the cloud structure, the ones one the left almost overpower the primary structure.  The small ones on the right almost look like bad use of a smudge tool.  I am voting as if they are natural, because I have no way of knowing otherwise, but since it is advanced editing, I think I would recommend cloning them (on the right) out, or making them blend with the overall sky better.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the large and small in this composition, and the black and white is AWESOME!  The only things that bother me are clouds.  While I understand that you can''t change the cloud structure, the ones one the left almost overpower the primary structure.  The small ones on the right almost look like bad use of a smudge tool.  I am voting as if they are natural, because I have no way of knowing otherwise, but since it is advanced editing, I think I would recommend cloning them (on the right) out, or making them blend with the overall sky better.', '2007-01-13 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
