(3225953, 451902, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice image...The cropping draws my focus towards the foreground in the shadows rather than the landscape in the background (may have been your intent).  Not sure if it would have been feasible, but would have liked to seen the sunlinght on the flowers to maybe enhance their colour. Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice image...The cropping draws my focus towards the foreground in the shadows rather than the landscape in the background (may have been your intent).  Not sure if it would have been feasible, but would have liked to seen the sunlinght on the flowers to maybe enhance their colour. Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 13:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
