(3225967, 450084, 29477, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous eyes.  Would have preferred the entire image in focus rather then the shallow DOF.  I assume this was done to enhance the eyes, but I think the eyes would have captured any viewer in a completely crisp image.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Gorgeous eyes.  Would have preferred the entire image in focus rather then the shallow DOF.  I assume this was done to enhance the eyes, but I think the eyes would have captured any viewer in a completely crisp image.  Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 13:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225968, 451194, 17330, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Difficult exposure Well done</td>', 'Beautiful. Difficult exposure Well done', '2007-01-13 13:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3225972, 448838, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  If that isn''t the most perfect hummingbird shot I''ve ever seen. . well. .it just is -- period!   I am awestruck first. . .then incredibly jealous!   National Geographic quality for sure!<br/> <br/>WOW!!!  I have to tell you, I am voting extremely tough in this challenge.  Much more than I usually do because these are supposed to be photos that are people''s BEST photo that they took all year, but this photo totally measures up, and in fact is the first 10 I''ve given in 437 votes!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  If that isn''t the most perfect hummingbird shot I''ve ever seen. . well. .it just is -- period!   I am awestruck first. . .then incredibly jealous!   National Geographic quality for sure! WOW!!!  I have to tell you, I am voting extremely tough in this challenge.  Much more than I usually do because these are supposed to be photos that are people''s BEST photo that they took all year, but this photo totally measures up, and in fact is the first 10 I''ve given in 437 votes!', '2007-01-13 13:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
