(3225990, 447819, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very nice vantage point.  The image appears very grainy to me which may not help your score.  A solid clear/crisp image would have placed you quite high in my opinion.  I also find the border to take away from what you captured.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Very nice vantage point.  The image appears very grainy to me which may not help your score.  A solid clear/crisp image would have placed you quite high in my opinion.  I also find the border to take away from what you captured.  Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
