(3226044, 448776, 52439, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t do anything for me, sorry.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t do anything for me, sorry.', '2007-01-13 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226046, 451402, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great pose, nice capture.<br/>Nice focus on the subjects head aswell. Great exposure, could be a little better if you had a highger perspective, though then we would be able to see him a little better.</td>', 'Great pose, nice capture.Nice focus on the subjects head aswell. Great exposure, could be a little better if you had a highger perspective, though then we would be able to see him a little better.', '2007-01-13 14:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226048, 451084, 28882, '<td valign="top">good shot.  kids barefoot and wearing interesting clothing</td>', 'good shot.  kids barefoot and wearing interesting clothing', '2007-01-13 14:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226051, 447956, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great photograph.<br/>It may not be in great focus, it may not be perfectly exposed, and may have the subject right in the centre but it certainly struck a chord with me.<br/> <br/>Very, very well done.<br/>8</td>', 'Wow, what a great photograph.It may not be in great focus, it may not be perfectly exposed, and may have the subject right in the centre but it certainly struck a chord with me. Very, very well done.8', '2007-01-13 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226055, 451605, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice scene</td>', 'nice scene', '2007-01-13 14:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226056, 449878, 28882, '<td valign="top">what is this? nice colors</td>', 'what is this? nice colors', '2007-01-13 14:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226059, 447957, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of your light source to capture my attentio to his right eye.  Assuming that he has baby blues or greens, a colour verison would have impacted me more.  The image appears a little to grainy.  I like the tight off-centred crop.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Very nice use of your light source to capture my attentio to his right eye.  Assuming that he has baby blues or greens, a colour verison would have impacted me more.  The image appears a little to grainy.  I like the tight off-centred crop.  Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226060, 450017, 62637, '<td valign="top">Um, I dont quite know whats going on here.  Either I missed the point, or there is no point.</td>', 'Um, I dont quite know whats going on here.  Either I missed the point, or there is no point.', '2007-01-13 14:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226062, 447652, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.</td>', 'Brilliant.', '2007-01-13 14:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226068, 448399, 28882, '<td valign="top">a little out of focus and noisy, typical of low-light shots.  otherwise i like the candidness and the color tone</td>', 'a little out of focus and noisy, typical of low-light shots.  otherwise i like the candidness and the color tone', '2007-01-13 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226073, 448766, 28882, '<td valign="top">not showing much else makes this look like a real estate ad.  i like the sky though.  this also looks almost like a film shot, which i like btw.</td>', 'not showing much else makes this look like a real estate ad.  i like the sky though.  this also looks almost like a film shot, which i like btw.', '2007-01-13 14:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226079, 451524, 62637, '<td valign="top">This is your best photo from 2006?<br/> <br/>Sure, this would be a hit on facebook, and its funny, but this type of image isn''t going to do well here.  I''m the designated photographer at alot of campus events, and those photos fall under the category "no one cares unless they were there"</td>', 'This is your best photo from 2006? Sure, this would be a hit on facebook, and its funny, but this type of image isn''t going to do well here.  I''m the designated photographer at alot of campus events, and those photos fall under the category "no one cares unless they were there"', '2007-01-13 14:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226080, 451948, 62637, '<td valign="top">You went way overboard on the processing here.  This has been pushed well past the believable limits of an HDR-style photo. 2.</td>', 'You went way overboard on the processing here.  This has been pushed well past the believable limits of an HDR-style photo. 2.', '2007-01-13 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226081, 447907, 28882, '<td valign="top">cool dramatic sky, a little flat in lighting though.</td>', 'cool dramatic sky, a little flat in lighting though.', '2007-01-13 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226083, 449773, 28882, '<td valign="top">out of focus a little</td>', 'out of focus a little', '2007-01-13 14:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226084, 449047, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice eyes, kinda soft for me though</td>', 'nice eyes, kinda soft for me though', '2007-01-13 14:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226089, 449236, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice composure and good light.  i like look on his face. all a little out of focus though.</td>', 'nice composure and good light.  i like look on his face. all a little out of focus though.', '2007-01-13 14:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226092, 448659, 62637, '<td valign="top">An angry child pulling a secret service move on a pile of presents.  Best of ''06?  I''m sure this holds sentimental value to you, but to me, this is no different than the 1000s of photos of my cat, dog, sister or friends that I took last year.  No one but me and them have any interest.</td>', 'An angry child pulling a secret service move on a pile of presents.  Best of ''06?  I''m sure this holds sentimental value to you, but to me, this is no different than the 1000s of photos of my cat, dog, sister or friends that I took last year.  No one but me and them have any interest.', '2007-01-13 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226093, 449171, 17330, '<td valign="top">Lost detail in highlights</td>', 'Lost detail in highlights', '2007-01-13 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226100, 448737, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice.  i think i would''ve cropped out the pole on the right and some of the bottom.  theres too much darkness in btm right. i like the sea colors.</td>', 'nice.  i think i would''ve cropped out the pole on the right and some of the bottom.  theres too much darkness in btm right. i like the sea colors.', '2007-01-13 14:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226105, 450270, 28882, '<td valign="top">i love these kind of shots. this one is a good one.</td>', 'i love these kind of shots. this one is a good one.', '2007-01-13 14:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226107, 451957, 28882, '<td valign="top">great rich colors</td>', 'great rich colors', '2007-01-13 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226114, 451190, 39993, '<td valign="top">A painting, for sure.</td>', 'A painting, for sure.', '2007-01-13 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226115, 451794, 62637, '<td valign="top">See <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=525646" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this thread</a> for an explanation as to why your score is low.</td>', 'See this thread for an explanation as to why your score is low.', '2007-01-13 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226118, 451659, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but there seem to be a lot of artifacts making patterns that really detract from the image.</td>', 'I like the colors, but there seem to be a lot of artifacts making patterns that really detract from the image.', '2007-01-13 14:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226119, 451750, 62637, '<td valign="top">If you had used a tripod, this would have turned out much better.</td>', 'If you had used a tripod, this would have turned out much better.', '2007-01-13 14:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226124, 450975, 17330, '<td valign="top">tighter cropping would be more effective</td>', 'tighter cropping would be more effective', '2007-01-13 14:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226133, 447561, 29477, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. Although your subjects are well captured and nicely focused, your horizon is a mess, which is a shame, as it distracts from how truly great this picture is. Good Luck.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. Although your subjects are well captured and nicely focused, your horizon is a mess, which is a shame, as it distracts from how truly great this picture is. Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226138, 450832, 17330, '<td valign="top">a little more work needed to smooth ou skin blemishes - easily done</td>', 'a little more work needed to smooth ou skin blemishes - easily done', '2007-01-13 14:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226140, 451727, 62637, '<td valign="top">Holy over-processed!  Shadow/highlight (if you used CS2) is your friend; don''t abuse your friends!  I''m guessing the foreground was next to black at first.  You have to be wary when trying to pull details out of the shadows like this, often you will find, as you have, alot of unsightly noise.  Also, you''ve killed the contrast in the mountains.  Otherwise, this is a well composed and very scenic photo.  Don''t worry too much, post processing is something that comes with experience.  6 months ago I was doing this same thing to my photos.  It''ll come.</td>', 'Holy over-processed!  Shadow/highlight (if you used CS2) is your friend; don''t abuse your friends!  I''m guessing the foreground was next to black at first.  You have to be wary when trying to pull details out of the shadows like this, often you will find, as you have, alot of unsightly noise.  Also, you''ve killed the contrast in the mountains.  Otherwise, this is a well composed and very scenic photo.  Don''t worry too much, post processing is something that comes with experience.  6 months ago I was doing this same thing to my photos.  It''ll come.', '2007-01-13 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226141, 450989, 45115, '<td valign="top">one of my top 10 in this challenge! splendid work!</td>', 'one of my top 10 in this challenge! splendid work!', '2007-01-13 14:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226142, 447759, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the bokeh of the fuzzies (not sure what you''d call that part of the plant) in back, but this seems a little oversharpened, particularly around the seeds.  They don''t look natural anymore, which I think detracts from this particular subject.</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the bokeh of the fuzzies (not sure what you''d call that part of the plant) in back, but this seems a little oversharpened, particularly around the seeds.  They don''t look natural anymore, which I think detracts from this particular subject.', '2007-01-13 14:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226155, 451138, 17330, '<td valign="top">wonderful exposure. The main subjects are too central. Crop some from the bottom</td>', 'wonderful exposure. The main subjects are too central. Crop some from the bottom', '2007-01-13 14:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226176, 447867, 7485, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and pose, but wish I could see just a bit more face (at least the whole mouth). Also, the contrast is a little to much, causing banding on her right arm and highlights just about blown.</td>', 'I like the concept and pose, but wish I could see just a bit more face (at least the whole mouth). Also, the contrast is a little to much, causing banding on her right arm and highlights just about blown.', '2007-01-13 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226190, 451719, 70514, '<td valign="top">LOVE it!</td>', 'LOVE it!', '2007-01-13 14:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226191, 450938, 17330, '<td valign="top">no</td>', 'no', '2007-01-13 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226197, 451054, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great mountain scene, only the purple cast to the sky isn''t very natural (and if you look too carefully, you see the the selection outline of the sky)</td>', 'Great mountain scene, only the purple cast to the sky isn''t very natural (and if you look too carefully, you see the the selection outline of the sky)', '2007-01-13 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226201, 451947, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nothing too "stunning" but I sure do LOVE it!</td>', 'Nothing too "stunning" but I sure do LOVE it!', '2007-01-13 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226206, 451449, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! The expression and title match perfectly. But the fur looks very postprocessed, looks more like feathers than fur...</td>', 'Great idea! The expression and title match perfectly. But the fur looks very postprocessed, looks more like feathers than fur...', '2007-01-13 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226212, 451444, 19978, '<td valign="top">Stunning Manny! We gotta finish that interview!</td>', 'Stunning Manny! We gotta finish that interview!', '2007-01-13 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226223, 451747, 7485, '<td valign="top">The matching horizontal layers in the land and the clouds are great. Also the muted colors work very well, many DPCers would have been tempted to boost the saturation. But I don''t like the composition much, in particular how that cloud looks like it''s billowing out of the mountain peak.</td>', 'The matching horizontal layers in the land and the clouds are great. Also the muted colors work very well, many DPCers would have been tempted to boost the saturation. But I don''t like the composition much, in particular how that cloud looks like it''s billowing out of the mountain peak.', '2007-01-13 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226262, 447804, 17330, '<td valign="top">lower perspective</td>', 'lower perspective', '2007-01-13 15:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226263, 449239, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I really like shots like this. Good luck!</td>', 'Great concept.  I really like shots like this. Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226266, 451882, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and balance.  Good luck!</td>', 'Good perspective and balance.  Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226268, 447671, 22537, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous reflection and lighting.  Nice work.  Good luck!</td>', 'Gorgeous reflection and lighting.  Nice work.  Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226269, 450492, 22537, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I''m surprised I did not see this my first pass. I really like the elongated crop.  Good luck!</td>', 'Stunning.  I''m surprised I did not see this my first pass. I really like the elongated crop.  Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226273, 451694, 22537, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is really purdy and I think the DOF really makes the shot.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow!  This is really purdy and I think the DOF really makes the shot.  Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
