(3226278, 450967, 22537, '<td valign="top">This looks like the Johnston Canton in Banff National Park.  Beautiful and rich colors.  Good luck!</td>', 'This looks like the Johnston Canton in Banff National Park.  Beautiful and rich colors.  Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226287, 449980, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is an exquisite image.  The light and tress are superb. The soft focus creates a pristine and fresh feel to this shot. From someone who is in the forest more often than not, all I can say is that you really nailed it.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is an exquisite image.  The light and tress are superb. The soft focus creates a pristine and fresh feel to this shot. From someone who is in the forest more often than not, all I can say is that you really nailed it.  Good luck!', '2007-01-13 15:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
