(3226906, 451566, 67841, '<td valign="top">I recall seeing this in your portfolio &amp; remember really liking it - very appealing composition with a nice pattern of light &amp; shadow.  I can''t think of a better title to bring attention to the plight of the figure here.  The only faults here would be the blooming on the left (center blooming works well for this image, though) and the ever so slight sense that your focus is soft.<br/> <br/>Really like it - very strong image!  &lt;&lt; 9 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'I recall seeing this in your portfolio & remember really liking it - very appealing composition with a nice pattern of light & shadow.  I can''t think of a better title to bring attention to the plight of the figure here.  The only faults here would be the blooming on the left (center blooming works well for this image, though) and the ever so slight sense that your focus is soft. Really like it - very strong image!  << 9 >>', '2007-01-13 17:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
