(3227035, 448658, 2764, '<td valign="top">Okay, I laughed out loud.  This is a winner, obviosly a 10.  The justoposition of the tiny semi naked human in her bright red bikini against all those bricks of varying shades of brown... Her tiny wieght against their ponderous weigh..her frivolous vanity getting a bit of tan in he black bra against the seriousness of the brick.  What could be better.  Sometimes a picture makes me want to quite photography, I think "well, that one says everything, what is there left to say".</td>', 'Okay, I laughed out loud.  This is a winner, obviosly a 10.  The justoposition of the tiny semi naked human in her bright red bikini against all those bricks of varying shades of brown... Her tiny wieght against their ponderous weigh..her frivolous vanity getting a bit of tan in he black bra against the seriousness of the brick.  What could be better.  Sometimes a picture makes me want to quite photography, I think "well, that one says everything, what is there left to say".', '2007-01-13 18:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227040, 451055, 3459, '<td valign="top">10!</td>', '10!', '2007-01-13 18:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
