(3227049, 451788, 67841, '<td valign="top">What a crazy shot!  I thought it was staged at first, but then it has so many authentic elements... Love his pose &amp; most of your post technique - really hot whites are a tad distracting but not terribly so.  &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'What a crazy shot!  I thought it was staged at first, but then it has so many authentic elements... Love his pose & most of your post technique - really hot whites are a tad distracting but not terribly so.  << 8 >>', '2007-01-13 18:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227055, 447977, 2764, '<td valign="top">This could win!  It is an uncontroverisial 10.  Who wouldn''t love it?  Perhaps that baby is already born.  I love how you included the father in the family portrait by making that wedding ring so prominant.</td>', 'This could win!  It is an uncontroverisial 10.  Who wouldn''t love it?  Perhaps that baby is already born.  I love how you included the father in the family portrait by making that wedding ring so prominant.', '2007-01-13 18:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227065, 448766, 2764, '<td valign="top">Something is weird here - are my glasses dirty?  the cross on the church seems out of focus but the clouds seem extra sharp.  the colors of the church, the whites, don''t seem to go with the whites in the clouds. It looks sort of like two photos combined.  I love the composition, the cross and the spire lined up like that, the sun hitting one side and the Happy Hollow sign.  Is there really a place called Happy Hollow?</td>', 'Something is weird here - are my glasses dirty?  the cross on the church seems out of focus but the clouds seem extra sharp.  the colors of the church, the whites, don''t seem to go with the whites in the clouds. It looks sort of like two photos combined.  I love the composition, the cross and the spire lined up like that, the sun hitting one side and the Happy Hollow sign.  Is there really a place called Happy Hollow?', '2007-01-13 18:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227079, 449549, 2764, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you title this with music.  I hear really sistrurbing noises.  Its like looking at clouds, I see all sorts of shapes in theis frightening tree.  All of them are really fierce animals.  A bird-snake with horns, a skelatal dog, a giant rooster, something else with a big nose and more horns.  This is defiantely the stuff of nightmares,</td>', 'Interesting that you title this with music.  I hear really sistrurbing noises.  Its like looking at clouds, I see all sorts of shapes in theis frightening tree.  All of them are really fierce animals.  A bird-snake with horns, a skelatal dog, a giant rooster, something else with a big nose and more horns.  This is defiantely the stuff of nightmares,', '2007-01-13 18:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227080, 451784, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely way to "envision" the wind via photography</td>', 'Lovely way to "envision" the wind via photography', '2007-01-13 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227088, 447759, 20168, '<td valign="top">great macro work and lovely composition</td>', 'great macro work and lovely composition', '2007-01-13 18:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227145, 450181, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great pano!  Love the sky with it''s colors and textures.</td>', 'Great pano!  Love the sky with it''s colors and textures.', '2007-01-13 18:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227192, 449271, 45115, '<td valign="top">brillant!!</td>', 'brillant!!', '2007-01-13 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227246, 448328, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think this idea is great with the background out of focus to create a nice wash of color. I can''t quite pinpoint it, but something about the colors seems a bit off. I''m wondering if the in-camera white balance got tricked by shadows or shade from a passing cloud. I wonder if this shot might look great with selective desaturation.</td>', 'I think this idea is great with the background out of focus to create a nice wash of color. I can''t quite pinpoint it, but something about the colors seems a bit off. I''m wondering if the in-camera white balance got tricked by shadows or shade from a passing cloud. I wonder if this shot might look great with selective desaturation.', '2007-01-13 18:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227266, 448950, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great reflection and bright colors. I think the placement of the church within the shot is good. My only suggestion would be to sharpen the shot a bit more so the details in the buildings and trees comes out.</td>', 'Great reflection and bright colors. I think the placement of the church within the shot is good. My only suggestion would be to sharpen the shot a bit more so the details in the buildings and trees comes out.', '2007-01-13 18:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227282, 449384, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting in this shot is great. The golden evening light is also nice. The clouds in the distance look a little strange to me, and I think it may be an artifact of the processing, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'I think the lighting in this shot is great. The golden evening light is also nice. The clouds in the distance look a little strange to me, and I think it may be an artifact of the processing, but I''m not sure.', '2007-01-13 18:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227289, 451747, 29477, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable vantage point.  Might have tried to "punch" up the colours a bit with some levels, saturation, etc., to try to enhance the beauty of this image.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Unbelievable vantage point.  Might have tried to "punch" up the colours a bit with some levels, saturation, etc., to try to enhance the beauty of this image.  Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 19:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
