(3227296, 449105, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in this shot, and the sun makes a great point of focus. Good contrast range and sharpness over the whole shot.</td>', 'I like the composition in this shot, and the sun makes a great point of focus. Good contrast range and sharpness over the whole shot.', '2007-01-13 19:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
