(3227326, 451694, 29477, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this image a couple of times and I find the shallow DOF to be too distracting with all the others in the background.  Another perspective where you could have framed only one or two flowers (not sure ifthat was  possible) would have been better suited with your title.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this image a couple of times and I find the shallow DOF to be too distracting with all the others in the background.  Another perspective where you could have framed only one or two flowers (not sure ifthat was  possible) would have been better suited with your title.  Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 19:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
