(3227474, 451118, 27767, '<td valign="top">The image could be interesting if the details were more visible. Unfortunately this is too small of an image to bring out detail.</td>', 'The image could be interesting if the details were more visible. Unfortunately this is too small of an image to bring out detail.', '2007-01-13 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227476, 451221, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that this is not tightly cropped, allowing you to see how the subject has exclusive rights to the undisturbed area. Great shot.  Warren Miller would be proud. Good Luck.</td>', 'I like the fact that this is not tightly cropped, allowing you to see how the subject has exclusive rights to the undisturbed area. Great shot.  Warren Miller would be proud. Good Luck.', '2007-01-13 19:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
