(3228359, 451659, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with nasty compression artifacts. You realize your file is only 24KB? Remember, the maximum is 200KB, so compressing down to 24KB is unnecessary and just damages the image.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with nasty compression artifacts. You realize your file is only 24KB? Remember, the maximum is 200KB, so compressing down to 24KB is unnecessary and just damages the image.', '2007-01-13 23:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
