(3228404, 448175, 35274, '<td valign="top">Dizzying almost, with that radial blur. The lighting is also very striking. All the elements add up for a very dramatic effect.</td>', 'Dizzying almost, with that radial blur. The lighting is also very striking. All the elements add up for a very dramatic effect.', '2007-01-14 00:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228407, 451662, 7485, '<td valign="top">Must have been a difficult choice, you have so many excellent shots. But this one is indeed exquisite, as if you are looking straight to the viewer from another age.</td>', 'Must have been a difficult choice, you have so many excellent shots. But this one is indeed exquisite, as if you are looking straight to the viewer from another age.', '2007-01-14 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228417, 449878, 18367, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this... it has and enchanting and mystical allure.  Great job on the lighting... reminds me of the Dance of the Mushrooms I believe it was.</td>', 'I absolutely love this... it has and enchanting and mystical allure.  Great job on the lighting... reminds me of the Dance of the Mushrooms I believe it was.', '2007-01-14 00:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228419, 449149, 7485, '<td valign="top">Where do you find this regal beast? A remarkable looking blend of a sweet pussycat and a wild predator. And the photo is perfectly lit and composed to boot - 10</td>', 'Where do you find this regal beast? A remarkable looking blend of a sweet pussycat and a wild predator. And the photo is perfectly lit and composed to boot - 10', '2007-01-14 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228429, 447855, 7485, '<td valign="top">The policeman''s look is priceless, but the lighting is very strange, looks like HDR gone wild.</td>', 'The policeman''s look is priceless, but the lighting is very strange, looks like HDR gone wild.', '2007-01-14 00:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228435, 448864, 7485, '<td valign="top">Love the freckles and the expression, but the contrast is too high for my taste. There''s no dynamic range in the hair, it''s just jetblack and highlights.</td>', 'Love the freckles and the expression, but the contrast is too high for my taste. There''s no dynamic range in the hair, it''s just jetblack and highlights.', '2007-01-14 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228443, 447767, 35274, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, that''s stunning! One of a small handfull in this challenge that made me stop and stare for a solid minute atleast. Everything in this just works so well. The lighting, the focus. I feel like I could reach out and touch the birds you''ve captured so perfectly. Bravo.</td>', 'Holy crap, that''s stunning! One of a small handfull in this challenge that made me stop and stare for a solid minute atleast. Everything in this just works so well. The lighting, the focus. I feel like I could reach out and touch the birds you''ve captured so perfectly. Bravo.', '2007-01-14 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228445, 451138, 35274, '<td valign="top">Must be an interesting place to live. It''s very beautiful and charming, and you''ve captured it well.</td>', 'Must be an interesting place to live. It''s very beautiful and charming, and you''ve captured it well.', '2007-01-14 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228461, 451581, 7485, '<td valign="top">Hey, I remember that one! Not sure which version I like better, the horizontal original or this one, but the concept is great.</td>', 'Hey, I remember that one! Not sure which version I like better, the horizontal original or this one, but the concept is great.', '2007-01-14 00:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3228476, 450961, 10867, '<td valign="top">The snails are wonderful, but I''m not sure about the very large out of focus area in the foreground.  You might want to consider cropping about halfway up to the snails.</td>', 'The snails are wonderful, but I''m not sure about the very large out of focus area in the foreground.  You might want to consider cropping about halfway up to the snails.', '2007-01-14 00:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
