(3229715, 451936, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very cute - I like the tight composition, and the wet hair texture.  The reflection in the dogs eyes is distracting.</td>', 'Very cute - I like the tight composition, and the wet hair texture.  The reflection in the dogs eyes is distracting.', '2007-01-14 11:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
