(3229896, 451221, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, so that''s what snow looks like, I''ve just about forgotten here in this worthless winter in the NE USA. Great color contrast between the deep blue sky and the orange parka. Maybe less foreground would help, but the near-centered composition works too.</td>', 'Wow, so that''s what snow looks like, I''ve just about forgotten here in this worthless winter in the NE USA. Great color contrast between the deep blue sky and the orange parka. Maybe less foreground would help, but the near-centered composition works too.', '2007-01-14 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
