(3230301, 450829, 48389, '<td valign="top">Not my type of image at all, sadly (being a woman) I am always inclined to think these images are out to titalate the men (which often works) but I will try to offer an unbiased critique! IMHO the lighting on the models face is a little too harsh and the way the left leg leaves the frame makes the pose look a little awkward. The light on the background is nice but I find the pattern against the plain sofa doesn''t work. For me, the lighting on the models back is nicely done and if you could have had the same on the face this would have been better (this is just my humble opinion)</td>', 'Not my type of image at all, sadly (being a woman) I am always inclined to think these images are out to titalate the men (which often works) but I will try to offer an unbiased critique! IMHO the lighting on the models face is a little too harsh and the way the left leg leaves the frame makes the pose look a little awkward. The light on the background is nice but I find the pattern against the plain sofa doesn''t work. For me, the lighting on the models back is nicely done and if you could have had the same on the face this would have been better (this is just my humble opinion)', '2007-01-14 14:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
