(3230401, 448331, 48389, '<td valign="top">I am so pleased to see this here! A wonderful image of what must have been a wonderful woman. This image is so real and shows a lovely smile and pose on a beautiful lady. Knowing the sadness this year has brought you and the emotional  attachment you must have to this image I want to say how proud I am of you for sharing this with us.<br/> <br/>I know another DPC''er who entered a very personal image in another challenge and received some hard comments,I don''t know if this applies to you but if at any point it does just stop yourself from shedding a tear and remember something you and your Mammaw used to do together. Hang on to your happy memories. Thoughts and prayers are with you and yours x</td>', 'I am so pleased to see this here! A wonderful image of what must have been a wonderful woman. This image is so real and shows a lovely smile and pose on a beautiful lady. Knowing the sadness this year has brought you and the emotional  attachment you must have to this image I want to say how proud I am of you for sharing this with us. I know another DPC''er who entered a very personal image in another challenge and received some hard comments,I don''t know if this applies to you but if at any point it does just stop yourself from shedding a tear and remember something you and your Mammaw used to do together. Hang on to your happy memories. Thoughts and prayers are with you and yours x', '2007-01-14 14:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
