(3232147, 451903, 7628, '<td valign="top">Those huge dark eyes and the wonderful, glistening curls - what a terrific subject.  Good solid compositon. Nice tonal range, but you''ve lost some detail in some darker sections of the hair which is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Those huge dark eyes and the wonderful, glistening curls - what a terrific subject.  Good solid compositon. Nice tonal range, but you''ve lost some detail in some darker sections of the hair which is a bit distracting.', '2007-01-14 22:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
