(3232155, 450989, 32997, '<td valign="top">oh my..this is incredible...maybe i will see a better shot in the challenge but I doubt it...<br/>this really is what it is all about for me...life and the essence of life told in a shot that is pure poetry...<br/>I look at this and smile, I want to look again, pause and take it all in...<br/>it is simple and yet it is everything...10 and a fav...</td>', 'oh my..this is incredible...maybe i will see a better shot in the challenge but I doubt it...this really is what it is all about for me...life and the essence of life told in a shot that is pure poetry...I look at this and smile, I want to look again, pause and take it all in...it is simple and yet it is everything...10 and a fav...', '2007-01-14 22:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232158, 451084, 7628, '<td valign="top">I particularly like how you''ve gotten down low here - the girls seem tall and confident - this is their territory.  Great colors, wonderful facial expressions.  Good composition in what could have been too busy a shot - having the girls all to one side and choosing that low angle focuses the viewers eye while also giving a good perspective on the surroundings. 9</td>', 'I particularly like how you''ve gotten down low here - the girls seem tall and confident - this is their territory.  Great colors, wonderful facial expressions.  Good composition in what could have been too busy a shot - having the girls all to one side and choosing that low angle focuses the viewers eye while also giving a good perspective on the surroundings. 9', '2007-01-14 22:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232160, 450040, 59470, '<td valign="top">maybe a little too much PP in my opinion.  But still a nice shot.  I''ve been trying to guess what city this is.... guess i''ll have to wait :)</td>', 'maybe a little too much PP in my opinion.  But still a nice shot.  I''ve been trying to guess what city this is.... guess i''ll have to wait :)', '2007-01-14 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232161, 451940, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot. Not only did you captured the lightning well but the end result is quite artistic.</td>', 'Fabulous shot. Not only did you captured the lightning well but the end result is quite artistic.', '2007-01-14 22:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
