(3232549, 448899, 26313, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the colours seem off to me...</td>', 'I like the composition, but the colours seem off to me...', '2007-01-14 23:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232551, 451066, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the pose, this style of post processing just doesn''t really appeal to me, though.  that said, I could see it as an ad in a glamour magazine.</td>', 'I like the composition and the pose, this style of post processing just doesn''t really appeal to me, though.  that said, I could see it as an ad in a glamour magazine.', '2007-01-14 23:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232559, 451420, 26313, '<td valign="top">Cool shot... Shallower depth to isolate the birds from the background might have been nice, but what can you do hey?</td>', 'Cool shot... Shallower depth to isolate the birds from the background might have been nice, but what can you do hey?', '2007-01-14 23:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232561, 447572, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the dof you have chosen to use.  However, the picture feels severely off balance to me.  The rose is in the middle of the frame (well, almost) adn the statues are in the middle and right, but there is absolutely nothing in the left.  It is not enough to be effective negative space, I think, and too much to add to the composition.  Perhaps if you cropped it just at the edge of the flower and statue-thingys, then "mirrored" it, it would feel more balanced.</td>', 'I like the dof you have chosen to use.  However, the picture feels severely off balance to me.  The rose is in the middle of the frame (well, almost) adn the statues are in the middle and right, but there is absolutely nothing in the left.  It is not enough to be effective negative space, I think, and too much to add to the composition.  Perhaps if you cropped it just at the edge of the flower and statue-thingys, then "mirrored" it, it would feel more balanced.', '2007-01-14 23:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232570, 451567, 26313, '<td valign="top">I know the horizon and the post are probably not orthogonal, but all the same it looks like you could use a little clockwise rotation.</td>', 'I know the horizon and the post are probably not orthogonal, but all the same it looks like you could use a little clockwise rotation.', '2007-01-14 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232571, 451023, 811, '<td valign="top">Butterflies or not, I wanna be there!!!  Nice exposure and composition.</td>', 'Butterflies or not, I wanna be there!!!  Nice exposure and composition.', '2007-01-14 23:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
