(3233157, 450699, 47316, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of washed out. I like how this makes my hungry for some candy but other than that I don''t really see the significance. Not sure I like the composition and crop.</td>', 'Seems kind of washed out. I like how this makes my hungry for some candy but other than that I don''t really see the significance. Not sure I like the composition and crop.', '2007-01-15 02:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233165, 451719, 47316, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing image. One of the few so far today that really startled me and made me go yes! This is great! Like the editing. Can''t even put my finger on what you did exactly (which is a good thing!) it''s different! Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! Amazing image. One of the few so far today that really startled me and made me go yes! This is great! Like the editing. Can''t even put my finger on what you did exactly (which is a good thing!) it''s different! Good luck!', '2007-01-15 02:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
