(3233172, 447740, 47316, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this cropped closer. The background is wrinkled in the corner and is rather distracting. This also seems rather distant from the baby and might have gone better more and his/her level.</td>', 'Would have liked this cropped closer. The background is wrinkled in the corner and is rather distracting. This also seems rather distant from the baby and might have gone better more and his/her level.', '2007-01-15 02:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233183, 448209, 47316, '<td valign="top">Great! It really took my eyes a second to focus and figure out what was going on. As it was loading I thought it was a really low quality image of who knows what and then it finished and I got a good look in and wow! Quite the opposite. Lovely lines and colors.</td>', 'Great! It really took my eyes a second to focus and figure out what was going on. As it was loading I thought it was a really low quality image of who knows what and then it finished and I got a good look in and wow! Quite the opposite. Lovely lines and colors.', '2007-01-15 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233189, 451102, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I''m not sure weither I like the legs in the back or not. The problem is they were the first thing my eyes went to and kept taking my attention but in context it is kind of need to see them behind the shoe polisher. Great contrast. A tad over edited for my taste.</td>', 'Very nice image. I''m not sure weither I like the legs in the back or not. The problem is they were the first thing my eyes went to and kept taking my attention but in context it is kind of need to see them behind the shoe polisher. Great contrast. A tad over edited for my taste.', '2007-01-15 02:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
