(3233344, 449240, 10867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and very nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful light and very nice composition.', '2007-01-15 03:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233407, 451318, 6999, '<td valign="top">Feels like science fiction, like the beginning of the transporter beam; or maybe like a stage set, lit.</td>', 'Feels like science fiction, like the beginning of the transporter beam; or maybe like a stage set, lit.', '2007-01-15 04:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233412, 447860, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s something (I think) unintentionally amusing about the horse: perhaps its just that the portrait part of the image is so - well, ''standard'' would give the lie to it, but perhaps ''just as one would expect'' is right; and then the horse, with its face turned toward us. There are strong leading lines that make the horse almost a stronger part of the composition than the man, and so we expect something from it.</td>', 'There''s something (I think) unintentionally amusing about the horse: perhaps its just that the portrait part of the image is so - well, ''standard'' would give the lie to it, but perhaps ''just as one would expect'' is right; and then the horse, with its face turned toward us. There are strong leading lines that make the horse almost a stronger part of the composition than the man, and so we expect something from it.', '2007-01-15 04:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233420, 451666, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems to exist almost completely in the lighter half of the spectrum - I feel no depth of tonality in this image. The flattening effect of this - the apparent absence of real shadow - is quite eye-catching, and quite strange: although rationally we can deduce that there are objects closer and further away from us, there is almost no visual clue to immediately suggest that.</td>', 'Seems to exist almost completely in the lighter half of the spectrum - I feel no depth of tonality in this image. The flattening effect of this - the apparent absence of real shadow - is quite eye-catching, and quite strange: although rationally we can deduce that there are objects closer and further away from us, there is almost no visual clue to immediately suggest that.', '2007-01-15 04:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233421, 449549, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite intense - and the dynamic range is excellently handled.</td>', 'Quite intense - and the dynamic range is excellently handled.', '2007-01-15 04:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233422, 447721, 61348, '<td valign="top">oversaturated IMO</td>', 'oversaturated IMO', '2007-01-15 04:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233423, 451651, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst there''s always a fun aspect to selective de-sat, I have to say I dislike almost all uses of the technique: it makes your image more about your processing than your photography. The sheer weirdness of the stand-out eyes in a black and white image immediately distracts from consideration of your capture of the subject.</td>', 'Whilst there''s always a fun aspect to selective de-sat, I have to say I dislike almost all uses of the technique: it makes your image more about your processing than your photography. The sheer weirdness of the stand-out eyes in a black and white image immediately distracts from consideration of your capture of the subject.', '2007-01-15 04:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233429, 447937, 6999, '<td valign="top">Contrary to most butterfly/moth/winged animal macros in this challenge, this has actually achieved a sense of fragility rather than the abstraction of shape and colour. The background will of course cause many voters problems, but I think it parallels the lines and shapes of the insect''s wings quite well.</td>', 'Contrary to most butterfly/moth/winged animal macros in this challenge, this has actually achieved a sense of fragility rather than the abstraction of shape and colour. The background will of course cause many voters problems, but I think it parallels the lines and shapes of the insect''s wings quite well.', '2007-01-15 04:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233431, 449226, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems almost to be trying to be simple and complex at the same time: and I''m not sure that''s a successful dichotomy. The simplicity of the tonality of it, against the complex shapes and shadows - the tension between what are broadly plain and geometric shapes, and the details of the aerial, the steels and their rivets, the wiring ...</td>', 'Seems almost to be trying to be simple and complex at the same time: and I''m not sure that''s a successful dichotomy. The simplicity of the tonality of it, against the complex shapes and shadows - the tension between what are broadly plain and geometric shapes, and the details of the aerial, the steels and their rivets, the wiring ...', '2007-01-15 04:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233433, 448157, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''ve simply passed over most of the landscapes in this challenge, but the strength of composition, and genuine communication of a place''s mood here makes this one worth more attention.</td>', 'I''ve simply passed over most of the landscapes in this challenge, but the strength of composition, and genuine communication of a place''s mood here makes this one worth more attention.', '2007-01-15 04:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
