(3233909, 448446, 57421, '<td valign="top">Definitely very nice. The eyes stand out well, her left eye being skillfully party-hidden-but-not-really-by-the-hair. The hair, at time dark and at time light work really well too. The pose could seem a bit static, fully frontal like that, but I find it consistent with the darkish tone of the picture and her neutral face. Gives it kind of an unnatural feel.<br/> <br/>What I like a bit less are: (i) the background, a bit too "dull" and (ii) the lighting/composition on the breast&amp;arms.</td>', 'Definitely very nice. The eyes stand out well, her left eye being skillfully party-hidden-but-not-really-by-the-hair. The hair, at time dark and at time light work really well too. The pose could seem a bit static, fully frontal like that, but I find it consistent with the darkish tone of the picture and her neutral face. Gives it kind of an unnatural feel. What I like a bit less are: (i) the background, a bit too "dull" and (ii) the lighting/composition on the breast&arms.', '2007-01-15 09:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
