(3234278, 451084, 32767, '<td valign="top">Third-World-A-Licious.<br/> <br/>Nicely taken shot but I wish I was drawing more from the subjects. We only seem to be connecting with the two girls in the center. All the elements are there but not much is coming through outside of the usual stuff that always sparks us with these images. This will do quite well in the voting. Good Luck.</td>', 'Third-World-A-Licious. Nicely taken shot but I wish I was drawing more from the subjects. We only seem to be connecting with the two girls in the center. All the elements are there but not much is coming through outside of the usual stuff that always sparks us with these images. This will do quite well in the voting. Good Luck.', '2007-01-15 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
