(3235304, 451772, 29797, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Composition and mood in this photo are stunning. One little tiny nitpick would be about the glowing areas in the clouds around some of the mountains, (I''m guessing) caused by burning of the clouds with a soft edge and not getting too close to the mountains. Try masking out the mountains, tracing the edges with a small hard edge brush to get all the edge details. This will let you burn right up to the mountains and not leave a glow around them. -Just one small thing in a really beautiful shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Composition and mood in this photo are stunning. One little tiny nitpick would be about the glowing areas in the clouds around some of the mountains, (I''m guessing) caused by burning of the clouds with a soft edge and not getting too close to the mountains. Try masking out the mountains, tracing the edges with a small hard edge brush to get all the edge details. This will let you burn right up to the mountains and not leave a glow around them. -Just one small thing in a really beautiful shot.', '2007-01-15 14:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235306, 451727, 46202, '<td valign="top">This photo is beautiful, great composition, fantastic colors and lighting...A bit too much noise/grain for my taste though. 8</td>', 'This photo is beautiful, great composition, fantastic colors and lighting...A bit too much noise/grain for my taste though. 8', '2007-01-15 14:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
