(3235412, 448074, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice soft and glowing light - pastel colors.  I like how the tree leans to the upper corner, a less drastic angle than the hill behind but mirroring it slightly.  The road in the foreground anchors the image - I wonder how it would look if you rotated the image slightly counter clockwise so the road was perfectly horizontal in the frame?</td>', 'Nice soft and glowing light - pastel colors.  I like how the tree leans to the upper corner, a less drastic angle than the hill behind but mirroring it slightly.  The road in the foreground anchors the image - I wonder how it would look if you rotated the image slightly counter clockwise so the road was perfectly horizontal in the frame?', '2007-01-15 15:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
