(3235421, 451171, 38509, '<td valign="top">not bad , great colors</td>', 'not bad , great colors', '2007-01-15 15:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235425, 451494, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a sweeping view! The herd in the foreground works nicely - bringing the eyes of the viewer from the details to the towering mountains.  The red light feels very extreem - perhaps that is just how it was - but eberything else is so pastel and dim compared to the vivid reds and oranges, it is jarring.  Boosting the blue in the sky, or at least the darkness in the clouds might add balance.</td>', 'What a sweeping view! The herd in the foreground works nicely - bringing the eyes of the viewer from the details to the towering mountains.  The red light feels very extreem - perhaps that is just how it was - but eberything else is so pastel and dim compared to the vivid reds and oranges, it is jarring.  Boosting the blue in the sky, or at least the darkness in the clouds might add balance.', '2007-01-15 15:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235434, 448169, 56502, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-01-15 15:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235435, 449980, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Very nice indeed.', '2007-01-15 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235443, 451904, 7628, '<td valign="top">Eden - I am enjoying seeing this image in a larger format.  It is ethereal - makes me feel like I''ve discovered a portal into a fairytale.  The combination of motion and stillness is inspiring - like the laws of physics have been broken in the most freeing way! Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Eden - I am enjoying seeing this image in a larger format.  It is ethereal - makes me feel like I''ve discovered a portal into a fairytale.  The combination of motion and stillness is inspiring - like the laws of physics have been broken in the most freeing way! Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-01-15 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235455, 451086, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cool and smooth - great DOF.  Feels like I am there - I can smell the water and the moss, feel the chill of the fresh water streaming past.</td>', 'Cool and smooth - great DOF.  Feels like I am there - I can smell the water and the moss, feel the chill of the fresh water streaming past.', '2007-01-15 15:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235463, 451857, 30982, '<td valign="top">The way the dog is looking up at his master really does make this work.  Love the brightness on the water beyond them, too.</td>', 'The way the dog is looking up at his master really does make this work.  Love the brightness on the water beyond them, too.', '2007-01-15 15:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235465, 451319, 7628, '<td valign="top">JOY! The photo portrays so well the fleeting ebulliance of the day - a refreshing diversion from the posed, stayed portraits that have their place in the album too.<br/>Nice tone.</td>', 'JOY! The photo portrays so well the fleeting ebulliance of the day - a refreshing diversion from the posed, stayed portraits that have their place in the album too.Nice tone.', '2007-01-15 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235470, 448635, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely natural framing and very good silhouette.  The texture is quite nice as well.</td>', 'Lovely natural framing and very good silhouette.  The texture is quite nice as well.', '2007-01-15 15:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235473, 449958, 7628, '<td valign="top">The yellow and blue make a perfect combo.  I like the use of a narrow DOF - wish all the foreground leaves were sharp - or there were just one particular leaf to focus on.</td>', 'The yellow and blue make a perfect combo.  I like the use of a narrow DOF - wish all the foreground leaves were sharp - or there were just one particular leaf to focus on.', '2007-01-15 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235477, 447721, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely perspective to shoot this from!  Would make a wonderful postcard.</td>', 'What a lovely perspective to shoot this from!  Would make a wonderful postcard.', '2007-01-15 15:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
