(3235484, 451118, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very simple - elegant.  I like the way the blue lines in the snow cross the golden wisps of grass that are bendind as if under their influence.  You have made the image so small, I am not getting any details - with must be only 300 pixles wide - 720 was allowed.</td>', 'Very simple - elegant.  I like the way the blue lines in the snow cross the golden wisps of grass that are bendind as if under their influence.  You have made the image so small, I am not getting any details - with must be only 300 pixles wide - 720 was allowed.', '2007-01-15 15:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
