(3235531, 451948, 7628, '<td valign="top">The theme of unreal suffuses the image. The colors, the light, the juxtiposition of the elements (the BACK end of a cow?) and the post processing all act to unsettle the viewer.  The sky is particularly odd - some weird storm a-brewin'' - all very perplexing, but also entrancing. One asks, what? why? and looks at the picture again... and again.</td>', 'The theme of unreal suffuses the image. The colors, the light, the juxtiposition of the elements (the BACK end of a cow?) and the post processing all act to unsettle the viewer.  The sky is particularly odd - some weird storm a-brewin'' - all very perplexing, but also entrancing. One asks, what? why? and looks at the picture again... and again.', '2007-01-15 15:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235535, 449364, 30982, '<td valign="top">Amazing how calm it is.  Nice rich tones and incredible reflections.</td>', 'Amazing how calm it is.  Nice rich tones and incredible reflections.', '2007-01-15 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235538, 450701, 10867, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice, but the lighting is a bit problematic, since it highlights the dog''s nose, but puts his eyes in shadow.</td>', 'The composition is nice, but the lighting is a bit problematic, since it highlights the dog''s nose, but puts his eyes in shadow.', '2007-01-15 15:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235548, 449656, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this and the quiet, muted tones.</td>', 'I like the softness of this and the quiet, muted tones.', '2007-01-15 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235550, 451173, 57882, '<td valign="top">Wonderful layering, and really pulls you into the environment.</td>', 'Wonderful layering, and really pulls you into the environment.', '2007-01-15 15:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235563, 450774, 30982, '<td valign="top">The expression makes this shot.  Lovely light, nice stop action with the water, but the look she''s giving you?  That''s the best part.</td>', 'The expression makes this shot.  Lovely light, nice stop action with the water, but the look she''s giving you?  That''s the best part.', '2007-01-15 15:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235567, 448022, 30982, '<td valign="top">13?  She''s a lovely woman already!  Very nice portrait - excellent lighting, good detail.</td>', '13?  She''s a lovely woman already!  Very nice portrait - excellent lighting, good detail.', '2007-01-15 15:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235575, 450434, 30982, '<td valign="top">A classic, lovely shot well done.  Colors are very nice.</td>', 'A classic, lovely shot well done.  Colors are very nice.', '2007-01-15 15:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235584, 450976, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an interesting, fun picture!  The building is remarkable on it''s own - the inclusion of the colorful figures adds just the right spark.</td>', 'What an interesting, fun picture!  The building is remarkable on it''s own - the inclusion of the colorful figures adds just the right spark.', '2007-01-15 15:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235597, 448858, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh what an attitude!  Remarkable pose - truly looks like he''s just chillin'' on the beach, waiting for the waves to be just right.</td>', 'Oh what an attitude!  Remarkable pose - truly looks like he''s just chillin'' on the beach, waiting for the waves to be just right.', '2007-01-15 15:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
