(3235611, 451151, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring you have chosen on this (bw with the red hat) and also the composition.  However, to me, it is soft, but seems more out of focus than a true soft focus.</td>', 'I like the coloring you have chosen on this (bw with the red hat) and also the composition.  However, to me, it is soft, but seems more out of focus than a true soft focus.', '2007-01-15 15:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
