(3235672, 448926, 811, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and good details.  The composition doesn''t do a lot for me, though.  Perhaps if there were more negative space at the top, it would be more interesting.</td>', 'Lovely colors and good details.  The composition doesn''t do a lot for me, though.  Perhaps if there were more negative space at the top, it would be more interesting.', '2007-01-15 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
