(3238714, 449260, 19831, '<td valign="top">Normally, pics of sculptors and statues and stuff don''t do much for me. But I can see here that you put some attention in to this shot. It shows a thought out composition, and getting the right timing (exposure and a decent sky) and is not bad.</td>', 'Normally, pics of sculptors and statues and stuff don''t do much for me. But I can see here that you put some attention in to this shot. It shows a thought out composition, and getting the right timing (exposure and a decent sky) and is not bad.', '2007-01-16 05:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
