(3238878, 451793, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong colour - the benefits of underexposure, as so many don''t understand. I find the composition a little awkward - those curves just aren''t similar enough, perhaps, for a really easy-on-the-eye balance. Great stuff, though.</td>', 'Strong colour - the benefits of underexposure, as so many don''t understand. I find the composition a little awkward - those curves just aren''t similar enough, perhaps, for a really easy-on-the-eye balance. Great stuff, though.', '2007-01-16 06:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3238885, 447873, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong graphic understanding shown here - especially well done is the parabolic line made by the tops of the buildings leading up to the black vertical lines image right. The two white windows just make a nice counterpoint to break up the regularity, too. Artistically, I find it perhaps a bit cold and inhuman - but that isn''t to say that''s not how it should be.</td>', 'Strong graphic understanding shown here - especially well done is the parabolic line made by the tops of the buildings leading up to the black vertical lines image right. The two white windows just make a nice counterpoint to break up the regularity, too. Artistically, I find it perhaps a bit cold and inhuman - but that isn''t to say that''s not how it should be.', '2007-01-16 06:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3238891, 451912, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the processing of this; one point - with such detailed composition, the nature of the reflected light becomes just as important, and the clarity of the lampshade is a touch disturbing: the simple expedient of a piece of paper over the front of the lamp would help prevent that. Fine shot, otherwise.</td>', 'I like the processing of this; one point - with such detailed composition, the nature of the reflected light becomes just as important, and the clarity of the lampshade is a touch disturbing: the simple expedient of a piece of paper over the front of the lamp would help prevent that. Fine shot, otherwise.', '2007-01-16 06:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3238894, 451516, 66709, '<td valign="top">with this I am here 10</td>', 'with this I am here 10', '2007-01-16 06:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3238895, 448737, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong photography - well balanced, great light, and with some human interest. For real pretty photography, I suspect people would like more detail and light in the foreground - but I''m not sure I actually know what the public want ;-)</td>', 'Strong photography - well balanced, great light, and with some human interest. For real pretty photography, I suspect people would like more detail and light in the foreground - but I''m not sure I actually know what the public want ;-)', '2007-01-16 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3238899, 451566, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like. The bench - a sense of a possible rest from her endeavours, is a very nice touch. A touch more control of light might have been effective - she perhaps disappears into the highlight lines across the road too much? Very strong composition.</td>', 'I like. The bench - a sense of a possible rest from her endeavours, is a very nice touch. A touch more control of light might have been effective - she perhaps disappears into the highlight lines across the road too much? Very strong composition.', '2007-01-16 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
