(3238902, 451727, 6999, '<td valign="top">The middle ground - the trees, seem over-lightened, without bringing the black areas back to where they should be. The light on the mountain tops is fine, but that middle ground lightening causes problems for the sweetness of the entirety.</td>', 'The middle ground - the trees, seem over-lightened, without bringing the black areas back to where they should be. The light on the mountain tops is fine, but that middle ground lightening causes problems for the sweetness of the entirety.', '2007-01-16 06:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
