(3238923, 451727, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully composed photograph, capturing some gorgeous lighting on the snow-capped mountains.  It does seem to suffer from digital noise, which rather detracts, and I would like to see a bit more detail in the trees and water - as it is, it appears almost as a painting, and I am unsure if this is as a result of post-processing.  I would prefer a more ''photographic'' feel, but very pleasing nonetheless.</td>', 'This is a beautifully composed photograph, capturing some gorgeous lighting on the snow-capped mountains.  It does seem to suffer from digital noise, which rather detracts, and I would like to see a bit more detail in the trees and water - as it is, it appears almost as a painting, and I am unsure if this is as a result of post-processing.  I would prefer a more ''photographic'' feel, but very pleasing nonetheless.', '2007-01-16 06:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
