(3239132, 451230, 28710, '<td valign="top">A bit overdone with the processing (which I would guess involves some creative use of sharpening layers to push the backlit feathers) which is particularly evidenced by the fringing on the feathers in the top left of the frame and the grainy sky, but I really like the base picture. It''s a very thought provoking and interesting composition. - 7</td>', 'A bit overdone with the processing (which I would guess involves some creative use of sharpening layers to push the backlit feathers) which is particularly evidenced by the fringing on the feathers in the top left of the frame and the grainy sky, but I really like the base picture. It''s a very thought provoking and interesting composition. - 7', '2007-01-16 07:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
