(3239174, 447685, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ooh, there''s Dory and... I think I see NEMO! ;) great shot of the sharks. Be careful of your saturation. I think you might have pushed the blue and red channels a bit too much specifically. Note the full 256 value reds visible in almost all of the reds and all of the blue fish have smooth areas of full value blues as well. 7</td>', 'Ooh, there''s Dory and... I think I see NEMO! ;) great shot of the sharks. Be careful of your saturation. I think you might have pushed the blue and red channels a bit too much specifically. Note the full 256 value reds visible in almost all of the reds and all of the blue fish have smooth areas of full value blues as well. 7', '2007-01-16 07:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239177, 450086, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yummy shot. great use of vignetting.</td>', 'Yummy shot. great use of vignetting.', '2007-01-16 07:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239179, 447596, 19831, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky. Good solid composition. Nice job.</td>', 'Awesome sky. Good solid composition. Nice job.', '2007-01-16 07:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239180, 448116, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oddly, this has a look of selective saturation, rather than selective <i>de</i>-saturation. I like the feel, which is probably the old-fashioned thing, but those colours that are brought out seem artificially done: things like the flag, where the colours are quite muted, give the game away a little.</td>', 'Oddly, this has a look of selective saturation, rather than selective de-saturation. I like the feel, which is probably the old-fashioned thing, but those colours that are brought out seem artificially done: things like the flag, where the colours are quite muted, give the game away a little.', '2007-01-16 07:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239181, 451595, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.. Seems like you might have gone a bit too far with the dodging of the eyes...</td>', 'Nice shot.. Seems like you might have gone a bit too far with the dodging of the eyes...', '2007-01-16 07:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239189, 451945, 28710, '<td valign="top">66KB file size... <br/> <br/>Why did I notice? Look at all the weird patterning in your noise/grain... those are JPG artifacts from overcompression. <br/> <br/>mono/duo/tri... tone images are very low in information to begin with, so you don''t usually need to compress them much. You were allowed 200KB.<br/> <br/>Not really got anything to do with the pic or my vote, but just a heads up.</td>', '66KB file size...  Why did I notice? Look at all the weird patterning in your noise/grain... those are JPG artifacts from overcompression.  mono/duo/tri... tone images are very low in information to begin with, so you don''t usually need to compress them much. You were allowed 200KB. Not really got anything to do with the pic or my vote, but just a heads up.', '2007-01-16 08:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239195, 450741, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice pic!</td>', 'Nice pic!', '2007-01-16 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
