(3239238, 450993, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice IR pic. The sky rocks, but a bit of burning might have helped the blown highlights in the foliage and grass. 8</td>', 'Nice IR pic. The sky rocks, but a bit of burning might have helped the blown highlights in the foliage and grass. 8', '2007-01-16 08:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239253, 447957, 28710, '<td valign="top">extra note. If you crop this pic just below the two holes in the pacified, this pic looks totally different and ultra-creepy. Good for a laugh if you like. It gets even better if you push the contrast a bit to push the shadows down.</td>', 'extra note. If you crop this pic just below the two holes in the pacified, this pic looks totally different and ultra-creepy. Good for a laugh if you like. It gets even better if you push the contrast a bit to push the shadows down.', '2007-01-16 08:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239259, 448668, 28710, '<td valign="top">Just a tiny step short of masterful. or maybe not...</td>', 'Just a tiny step short of masterful. or maybe not...', '2007-01-16 08:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239270, 447740, 28710, '<td valign="top">In advanced editing, it is acceptable to burn and you can get rid of the visible black blanket. Also, too bad about the corner having been clipped off of the trombone. If those two issues had been fixed, this would have received a 10 from me.</td>', 'In advanced editing, it is acceptable to burn and you can get rid of the visible black blanket. Also, too bad about the corner having been clipped off of the trombone. If those two issues had been fixed, this would have received a 10 from me.', '2007-01-16 08:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239276, 450531, 28710, '<td valign="top">Almost a tragic picture. Mostly because of what I know we are missing... :)<br/> <br/>Watch your reds channel. Loads of oversaturation here.</td>', 'Almost a tragic picture. Mostly because of what I know we are missing... :) Watch your reds channel. Loads of oversaturation here.', '2007-01-16 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
