(3239791, 450699, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the symphony of reds and the lacy background is very pleasant.  The lighting feels very flat - better addressed when the photo is shot, but can be played with in post processing using curves, selective colors, shadow/highlight or some combination of the three.  The crop on the left feels awkward to me - I''d rather see the jelly beans flow past the boarder of the photo on the left AND the top or have lacy space on both sides.</td>', 'I like the symphony of reds and the lacy background is very pleasant.  The lighting feels very flat - better addressed when the photo is shot, but can be played with in post processing using curves, selective colors, shadow/highlight or some combination of the three.  The crop on the left feels awkward to me - I''d rather see the jelly beans flow past the boarder of the photo on the left AND the top or have lacy space on both sides.', '2007-01-16 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239794, 451780, 38509, '<td valign="top">great catch, with postprocessing this photo would benefit very much ... contrast, saturation, curves ...</td>', 'great catch, with postprocessing this photo would benefit very much ... contrast, saturation, curves ...', '2007-01-16 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
