(3240030, 451727, 52713, '<td valign="top">shame about the noise. Look into Neat Image or Noise Ninja. would have really helped here too. It looks like you might not be shooting at the highest resolution. If that is the case, I recommend that you always shoot the highest quality the camera will allow. If this is from a camera phone, then I recommend getting a decent digital camera. The picture is lovely, the image quality is killing it.</td>', 'shame about the noise. Look into Neat Image or Noise Ninja. would have really helped here too. It looks like you might not be shooting at the highest resolution. If that is the case, I recommend that you always shoot the highest quality the camera will allow. If this is from a camera phone, then I recommend getting a decent digital camera. The picture is lovely, the image quality is killing it.', '2007-01-16 11:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3240037, 451346, 28261, '<td valign="top">( 1 )<br/>Coloration is very muddy.  High level of noise in clouds and water.  Oversharpening of lights has caused the image to appear out of focus.</td>', '( 1 )Coloration is very muddy.  High level of noise in clouds and water.  Oversharpening of lights has caused the image to appear out of focus.', '2007-01-16 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
