(3240786, 451242, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and a nice relaxed look on your model. The black and white suits and I like how you used a square crop which has given this big picture size. The distance to the background has put it nicely out of focus and your subject is nicely in focus. The crop is also good. All round a very good portrait.</td>', 'Very nice light and a nice relaxed look on your model. The black and white suits and I like how you used a square crop which has given this big picture size. The distance to the background has put it nicely out of focus and your subject is nicely in focus. The crop is also good. All round a very good portrait.', '2007-01-16 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
