(3241368, 450801, 48389, '<td valign="top">Such simple things :o) Lovely moment in time but for me the background is a little distracting as is the other daffodil entering the bottom of the frame (just my humble opinion)</td>', 'Such simple things :o) Lovely moment in time but for me the background is a little distracting as is the other daffodil entering the bottom of the frame (just my humble opinion)', '2007-01-16 17:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241372, 451900, 48389, '<td valign="top">A shame about the blown out clouds in the sky here, I hope you didn''t take any more steps further forward cos that looks like one serious drop!! Good colours in the Lake and trees :o)</td>', 'A shame about the blown out clouds in the sky here, I hope you didn''t take any more steps further forward cos that looks like one serious drop!! Good colours in the Lake and trees :o)', '2007-01-16 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241376, 448776, 70270, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this just looked like a snapshot to me.  Try getting lower, and shooting your subject from "dog level" -- lay down on the carpet and put your camera at the same level as the dog''s head; you''ll be amazed at the difference.</td>', 'Sorry, this just looked like a snapshot to me.  Try getting lower, and shooting your subject from "dog level" -- lay down on the carpet and put your camera at the same level as the dog''s head; you''ll be amazed at the difference.', '2007-01-16 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241380, 451956, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your composition - there is a nice broad ledge for the viewers eyes to start their journey and then the line of rocks and canyon wall leads you into the photo all the way to the distant mountains.  However, I think the contrasts are too strong.  The large black shadow in the middle lacks any detail as do many of the other shadows.  he ledge in front is so bright it feels washed out - there must be some nice texture in that rock tat is missing.  The colors also feel odd- everything has a magenta tinge.</td>', 'I like your composition - there is a nice broad ledge for the viewers eyes to start their journey and then the line of rocks and canyon wall leads you into the photo all the way to the distant mountains.  However, I think the contrasts are too strong.  The large black shadow in the middle lacks any detail as do many of the other shadows.  he ledge in front is so bright it feels washed out - there must be some nice texture in that rock tat is missing.  The colors also feel odd- everything has a magenta tinge.', '2007-01-16 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241386, 451767, 58610, '<td valign="top">What is goin'' on with THIS? Is it, like, floating on it''s back in mid-air? Did you rotate? And, are those hydrangias turned red? Soooo many questions and so few answers. Cool! Love the way he just floats there.</td>', 'What is goin'' on with THIS? Is it, like, floating on it''s back in mid-air? Did you rotate? And, are those hydrangias turned red? Soooo many questions and so few answers. Cool! Love the way he just floats there.', '2007-01-16 17:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241391, 451149, 58610, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2007-01-16 17:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241400, 451177, 70270, '<td valign="top">It''s an ok snapshot and a nice keepsake of the concert, but imho as a standalone photo its somewhat lacking, particularly in this challenge.  You can barely see the performer''s face, and the colors are kind of washed out.  You might try cropping out some of the sky above his head, and cropping the shot at the elbow instead of the wrist to eliminate the distracting trees in the background.</td>', 'It''s an ok snapshot and a nice keepsake of the concert, but imho as a standalone photo its somewhat lacking, particularly in this challenge.  You can barely see the performer''s face, and the colors are kind of washed out.  You might try cropping out some of the sky above his head, and cropping the shot at the elbow instead of the wrist to eliminate the distracting trees in the background.', '2007-01-16 17:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241404, 447561, 66494, '<td valign="top">Marvelous action shot. You can see the wind in this shot with the waves and the hair movement. I really like the spray coming up. Fantastic capture. Congrats.</td>', 'Marvelous action shot. You can see the wind in this shot with the waves and the hair movement. I really like the spray coming up. Fantastic capture. Congrats.', '2007-01-16 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241409, 451741, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but imho photo is too small and the tree trunk in the background interferes with the forms of the maple branches in the foreground.  Maybe if you moved a bit to the right that tree trunk would disappear, or if you opened the f-stop up wide you could have blurred it out of existence.</td>', 'Nice idea, but imho photo is too small and the tree trunk in the background interferes with the forms of the maple branches in the foreground.  Maybe if you moved a bit to the right that tree trunk would disappear, or if you opened the f-stop up wide you could have blurred it out of existence.', '2007-01-16 17:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241419, 449505, 58610, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful photograph, but I don''t get the title at all unless it''s purely sacrastic. And, if it is, well done!</td>', 'This is a very powerful photograph, but I don''t get the title at all unless it''s purely sacrastic. And, if it is, well done!', '2007-01-16 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241430, 449543, 66494, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The only thing that bothers me a bit is the tattoo is not clearly visible and looks odd at the angle shown. However, the entire photograph is gorgeous.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The only thing that bothers me a bit is the tattoo is not clearly visible and looks odd at the angle shown. However, the entire photograph is gorgeous.', '2007-01-16 17:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241435, 447492, 58610, '<td valign="top">Yeah, at least while you''re there. How do you get such a great shot through the window? That''s what I don''t get. Love the colors and tonality on the wing.</td>', 'Yeah, at least while you''re there. How do you get such a great shot through the window? That''s what I don''t get. Love the colors and tonality on the wing.', '2007-01-16 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241442, 451523, 70270, '<td valign="top">I think you could have improved this image by opening up the aperture to blur the building in the background.  The building competes with your subject for attention, particularly due to the closeness in colors (i.e., on the elephant and its canopy) and sharpness between the two.</td>', 'I think you could have improved this image by opening up the aperture to blur the building in the background.  The building competes with your subject for attention, particularly due to the closeness in colors (i.e., on the elephant and its canopy) and sharpness between the two.', '2007-01-16 17:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241448, 451871, 58610, '<td valign="top">Boy, I bet you''re glad you got THAT shot.</td>', 'Boy, I bet you''re glad you got THAT shot.', '2007-01-16 17:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241454, 451314, 70270, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this one is too out of focus for me, and the light fixture is clipped at the top of the frame.</td>', 'Sorry, this one is too out of focus for me, and the light fixture is clipped at the top of the frame.', '2007-01-16 17:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241456, 451706, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2007-01-16 17:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241464, 451540, 48389, '<td valign="top">what an eerie feeling this image has! I like it! The runner is nicely placed and mist is excellent :o)</td>', 'what an eerie feeling this image has! I like it! The runner is nicely placed and mist is excellent :o)', '2007-01-16 17:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241466, 450226, 48389, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and nice light on the side ofthe tigers face :o)</td>', 'Beautiful detail and nice light on the side ofthe tigers face :o)', '2007-01-16 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241468, 451431, 58610, '<td valign="top">What a pain in the....foot that must have been to set up. Very nice composition with one foot following the other. The anklets add a touch of filligree that is dainty and femenine.</td>', 'What a pain in the....foot that must have been to set up. Very nice composition with one foot following the other. The anklets add a touch of filligree that is dainty and femenine.', '2007-01-16 17:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241471, 447625, 70270, '<td valign="top">Not much more than a snapshot here, imho.  Colors are washed out, the backs of the fans down front don''t add anything to the image, and you can''t see the batter''s face, or even the ball.  Move around to the third base sideline next time and get down lower so you capture the batter''s face and the fans reaction, and you''ll have something to sell on ebay after no. 11 makes it to the Hall of Fame!</td>', 'Not much more than a snapshot here, imho.  Colors are washed out, the backs of the fans down front don''t add anything to the image, and you can''t see the batter''s face, or even the ball.  Move around to the third base sideline next time and get down lower so you capture the batter''s face and the fans reaction, and you''ll have something to sell on ebay after no. 11 makes it to the Hall of Fame!', '2007-01-16 17:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241473, 447769, 48389, '<td valign="top">The little girl looks lost in what she is doing! I''d be tempted to crop out the leaves at the top of the frame but the placement of the rock and girl is nicely done :o)</td>', 'The little girl looks lost in what she is doing! I''d be tempted to crop out the leaves at the top of the frame but the placement of the rock and girl is nicely done :o)', '2007-01-16 17:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241478, 450580, 70270, '<td valign="top">Image is too small imho, and composition is off ... the white and the pink flowers compete for attention, and the pink petal at the top of the fram is distracting.  Hard to do this kind of shot without a macro lens (which I''m guessing you don''t have or didn''t use for this one)</td>', 'Image is too small imho, and composition is off ... the white and the pink flowers compete for attention, and the pink petal at the top of the fram is distracting.  Hard to do this kind of shot without a macro lens (which I''m guessing you don''t have or didn''t use for this one)', '2007-01-16 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3241479, 451791, 48389, '<td valign="top">This image really makes me want to get up close to the boat! I like the light, colour and detail in the foreground but feel the background is a little bland (just my humble opinion)</td>', 'This image really makes me want to get up close to the boat! I like the light, colour and detail in the foreground but feel the background is a little bland (just my humble opinion)', '2007-01-16 17:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241481, 451416, 48389, '<td valign="top">Love the detail in the marble on the right but find the background just too distracting</td>', 'Love the detail in the marble on the right but find the background just too distracting', '2007-01-16 17:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241485, 447652, 48389, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light! Really given the ground a lovely glow :o)</td>', 'Beautiful light! Really given the ground a lovely glow :o)', '2007-01-16 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241491, 451867, 16780, '<td valign="top">Stunning poofy clouds!</td>', 'Stunning poofy clouds!', '2007-01-16 17:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241492, 450680, 70270, '<td valign="top">what''s your subject ... the birds, the park bench, the brackish pond, or the bridge in the distance?  not sure what I''m supposed to be looking at here.  Try getting closer in and focusing on the element that caught your eye.</td>', 'what''s your subject ... the birds, the park bench, the brackish pond, or the bridge in the distance?  not sure what I''m supposed to be looking at here.  Try getting closer in and focusing on the element that caught your eye.', '2007-01-16 17:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241495, 451966, 70270, '<td valign="top">Your focus is slightly off here, but a nice capture.</td>', 'Your focus is slightly off here, but a nice capture.', '2007-01-16 17:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241503, 450801, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but imho could have been improved dramatically by getting down on the child''s level and shooting at his eye level, rather than down from above.  Also the stroller in the background is distracting, watch your backgrounds in the viewfinder.</td>', 'Nice subject, but imho could have been improved dramatically by getting down on the child''s level and shooting at his eye level, rather than down from above.  Also the stroller in the background is distracting, watch your backgrounds in the viewfinder.', '2007-01-16 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241505, 451570, 16780, '<td valign="top">The shadow across the middle of her face, leaving each eye in light with dark between them, is a distraction for me</td>', 'The shadow across the middle of her face, leaving each eye in light with dark between them, is a distraction for me', '2007-01-16 17:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241512, 450932, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes; I didn''t like the soft focus the first time I saw this image, but on second viewing I like it a lot better, particularly with the sharpness in Jack''s right eye.</td>', 'Nice eyes; I didn''t like the soft focus the first time I saw this image, but on second viewing I like it a lot better, particularly with the sharpness in Jack''s right eye.', '2007-01-16 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241513, 451842, 48389, '<td valign="top">For me all the ropes in the foreground here are just too distracting (sorry)</td>', 'For me all the ropes in the foreground here are just too distracting (sorry)', '2007-01-16 17:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241517, 450668, 26313, '<td valign="top">Maybe the dullness was your intention, but I think this needs more contrast (bring up the whites).</td>', 'Maybe the dullness was your intention, but I think this needs more contrast (bring up the whites).', '2007-01-16 17:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241535, 451444, 41337, '<td valign="top">I gotta say after first seeing your other photos of her this one pales in comparison. It just doesn''t have quite the clarity. Still a fascinating study and scored it as such. Good luck!<br/> <br/>ETA: Ok this one is starting to grow from me. Besides, it is after all your most memorable subject posted at DPC this year so bumping up!</td>', 'I gotta say after first seeing your other photos of her this one pales in comparison. It just doesn''t have quite the clarity. Still a fascinating study and scored it as such. Good luck! ETA: Ok this one is starting to grow from me. Besides, it is after all your most memorable subject posted at DPC this year so bumping up!', '2007-01-16 17:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241538, 447673, 70270, '<td valign="top">imho, the composition is too in between ... would have liked to have seen you a lot closer in to the subject to concentrate more on the lines and the forms, or a lot farther away to give more of a sense of what was closed for the season.</td>', 'imho, the composition is too in between ... would have liked to have seen you a lot closer in to the subject to concentrate more on the lines and the forms, or a lot farther away to give more of a sense of what was closed for the season.', '2007-01-16 17:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241540, 450625, 48389, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately if it wasn''t for your title I would have no idea what this was (sorry)</td>', 'Unfortunately if it wasn''t for your title I would have no idea what this was (sorry)', '2007-01-16 17:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241542, 450931, 70270, '<td valign="top">hihglights are too blown out, no contrast between the white petals and the background.</td>', 'hihglights are too blown out, no contrast between the white petals and the background.', '2007-01-16 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241546, 451595, 48389, '<td valign="top">There is something fascinating about this image :o) Wonderful expressions on the childrens faces :o)</td>', 'There is something fascinating about this image :o) Wonderful expressions on the childrens faces :o)', '2007-01-16 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241551, 448624, 48389, '<td valign="top">ugh! A part of me doesn''t want to look but the other part is amazed at the detail here!! Fantastic :o)</td>', 'ugh! A part of me doesn''t want to look but the other part is amazed at the detail here!! Fantastic :o)', '2007-01-16 17:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241555, 451719, 48389, '<td valign="top">The light on the ''elephant'' is good but for me the colour in the sky just doesn''t look right (just my humble opinion)</td>', 'The light on the ''elephant'' is good but for me the colour in the sky just doesn''t look right (just my humble opinion)', '2007-01-16 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241557, 450713, 48389, '<td valign="top">I love images with greens and blues like this but find the fence and tree a little distracting or maybe they could have been slightly better placed in the frame (justmy humble opnion)</td>', 'I love images with greens and blues like this but find the fence and tree a little distracting or maybe they could have been slightly better placed in the frame (justmy humble opnion)', '2007-01-16 18:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241558, 449814, 48389, '<td valign="top">Lovely depth to this image, we can see for miles!</td>', 'Lovely depth to this image, we can see for miles!', '2007-01-16 18:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241564, 451788, 48389, '<td valign="top">Excellent image! Very nicely composed and the editing really makes the most of the subject :o)</td>', 'Excellent image! Very nicely composed and the editing really makes the most of the subject :o)', '2007-01-16 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
