(3241683, 451291, 71268, '<td valign="top">I totally agree with her, man the emotion of screaming at something is dripping off it. Light and shadow is working perfect together... a ribbon in my book but their a lot of great entry''s</td>', 'I totally agree with her, man the emotion of screaming at something is dripping off it. Light and shadow is working perfect together... a ribbon in my book but their a lot of great entry''s', '2007-01-16 18:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
