(3242382, 447903, 28710, '<td valign="top">looks like this might be a fairly heavy crop to achieve the macro effect. In the event that I am correct, have you considered playing with arbitrary rotations to complement your composition? I''m looking at this and thinking that about 12 degrees to the right would make a nice line across the wings from the top left corner down and generally make the overall effect slightly more aesthetic.</td>', 'looks like this might be a fairly heavy crop to achieve the macro effect. In the event that I am correct, have you considered playing with arbitrary rotations to complement your composition? I''m looking at this and thinking that about 12 degrees to the right would make a nice line across the wings from the top left corner down and generally make the overall effect slightly more aesthetic.', '2007-01-16 20:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242392, 451752, 28710, '<td valign="top">Strange banding in the sky. Did you use a gradient? Did you set it to dither? If not, is this banding normal for your cam?</td>', 'Strange banding in the sky. Did you use a gradient? Did you set it to dither? If not, is this banding normal for your cam?', '2007-01-16 20:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242445, 449779, 28710, '<td valign="top">So much promise in this one. The left half of the image is a 10. You really made it very surreal and capitalized on that with excellent use of the frame and skillful processing. Sadly, on the right of the image, my interest is lost because the man looks too... "normal"... he just looks like some guy who was just walking around and sat down in the chair. I cannot think of any positive adjectives to describe his facial expression. While that''s not terribly bad, it does spoil the interesting mood. The background could use some blur and possibly the removal of the two big radio towers too.</td>', 'So much promise in this one. The left half of the image is a 10. You really made it very surreal and capitalized on that with excellent use of the frame and skillful processing. Sadly, on the right of the image, my interest is lost because the man looks too... "normal"... he just looks like some guy who was just walking around and sat down in the chair. I cannot think of any positive adjectives to describe his facial expression. While that''s not terribly bad, it does spoil the interesting mood. The background could use some blur and possibly the removal of the two big radio towers too.', '2007-01-16 20:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242472, 451084, 28710, '<td valign="top">Powerful context, but really what makes this for me is the faces of the girls. the defiant leader/older sister, the following protectee, the adventurous, quirky and indomitable, as well as the questioning, guarded and distrustful girl on the left staring you down. 10</td>', 'Powerful context, but really what makes this for me is the faces of the girls. the defiant leader/older sister, the following protectee, the adventurous, quirky and indomitable, as well as the questioning, guarded and distrustful girl on the left staring you down. 10', '2007-01-16 20:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242488, 451242, 28710, '<td valign="top">Oh no, those Icelanders keep breeding girls that look like this and the future of DPC is sealed! :)<br/> <br/>oh and you nailed the shot.</td>', 'Oh no, those Icelanders keep breeding girls that look like this and the future of DPC is sealed! :) oh and you nailed the shot.', '2007-01-16 20:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242498, 449122, 28710, '<td valign="top">? man vs beast? does this mean that he''s hitting the dog?</td>', '? man vs beast? does this mean that he''s hitting the dog?', '2007-01-16 20:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242524, 451580, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I love how the eyes are so close to the top, nowhere near the top third. Adventurous and powerful.</td>', 'Great composition. I love how the eyes are so close to the top, nowhere near the top third. Adventurous and powerful.', '2007-01-16 20:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242528, 451151, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the red hat adds punch however the image seems a little soft and the highlight in only one eye is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the composition and the red hat adds punch however the image seems a little soft and the highlight in only one eye is a little distracting.', '2007-01-16 20:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
