(3242623, 451163, 164, '<td valign="top">Where is that fire coming from?</td>', 'Where is that fire coming from?', '2007-01-16 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242628, 447619, 60047, '<td valign="top">The title reminded me of Bear_Music''s  "My time is spent waiting for the light" entry. Great idea - one we can all relate to. Very appropriate for this particular challenge. I think the road really adds a lot to this image (perspective). Though I know not how to dodge and burn well, I can''t help but conclude that an adept dodge/burn on the sky could really add to this particular image if done well. Nice work.</td>', 'The title reminded me of Bear_Music''s  "My time is spent waiting for the light" entry. Great idea - one we can all relate to. Very appropriate for this particular challenge. I think the road really adds a lot to this image (perspective). Though I know not how to dodge and burn well, I can''t help but conclude that an adept dodge/burn on the sky could really add to this particular image if done well. Nice work.', '2007-01-16 21:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242645, 447683, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective. I love the sky - the deep blue is wonderful. I think the green is just a shade too neon and takes away from the overall package.</td>', 'I love the perspective. I love the sky - the deep blue is wonderful. I think the green is just a shade too neon and takes away from the overall package.', '2007-01-16 21:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242656, 449258, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love it! Great idea. I think a tighter crop would work better on this - I would love to see a better contrast between the two subjects'' expressions.</td>', 'I love it! Great idea. I think a tighter crop would work better on this - I would love to see a better contrast between the two subjects'' expressions.', '2007-01-16 21:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242669, 450143, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really, really want to be there right now! Nice job on capturing the unique texture of the rock striations. I am sure the harsh lighting conditions made this difficult. Nice job.</td>', 'I really, really want to be there right now! Nice job on capturing the unique texture of the rock striations. I am sure the harsh lighting conditions made this difficult. Nice job.', '2007-01-16 21:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242679, 449543, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow. Captivating soft focus effect. Very tasteful nude - tough to do well. The hair adds great movement to the photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Wow. Captivating soft focus effect. Very tasteful nude - tough to do well. The hair adds great movement to the photo. Nice job.', '2007-01-16 21:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242689, 449035, 60047, '<td valign="top">A classic subject done well. Nice job.</td>', 'A classic subject done well. Nice job.', '2007-01-16 21:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242690, 451948, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like what the processing did to everything but the sky. Nice job though.</td>', 'I like what the processing did to everything but the sky. Nice job though.', '2007-01-16 21:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242698, 447655, 60047, '<td valign="top">Quite a captivating shot.</td>', 'Quite a captivating shot.', '2007-01-16 21:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242703, 450983, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the reflection on the statue. It really adds to the whole setting.  I also like the blending of the colors in the sky. Nice job. 7</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the reflection on the statue. It really adds to the whole setting.  I also like the blending of the colors in the sky. Nice job. 7', '2007-01-16 21:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242707, 449298, 19708, '<td valign="top">What a powerful image. Your post-processing really adds to the aged feel here.<br/>Very well done!</td>', 'What a powerful image. Your post-processing really adds to the aged feel here.Very well done!', '2007-01-16 21:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242720, 451758, 19708, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail looked so good, then upon viewing this, was disappointed in it being out of focus / blurry. Still a good shot, but could have been so much better had it been clear, especially with those marvelous eyes!</td>', 'The thumbnail looked so good, then upon viewing this, was disappointed in it being out of focus / blurry. Still a good shot, but could have been so much better had it been clear, especially with those marvelous eyes!', '2007-01-16 21:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242722, 448134, 60047, '<td valign="top">Now this shot really makes me wonder - what the heck are those brown strips? How on earth did you do this? Where is this?<br/> <br/>Fantastic shot. Makes the observer really take a second and third look.<br/> <br/>I would have given this a 10 if the plane were in sharper focus.<br/> <br/>Bravo!</td>', 'Now this shot really makes me wonder - what the heck are those brown strips? How on earth did you do this? Where is this? Fantastic shot. Makes the observer really take a second and third look. I would have given this a 10 if the plane were in sharper focus. Bravo!', '2007-01-16 21:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242731, 451084, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great slice of real life! So much to look at here and yet retains a strong focal point. Marvelous shot!</td>', 'Great slice of real life! So much to look at here and yet retains a strong focal point. Marvelous shot!', '2007-01-16 21:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242740, 451447, 68266, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes</td>', 'Beautiful eyes', '2007-01-16 21:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242741, 451366, 19708, '<td valign="top">Having a bit of a hard time with the colors being so bright and contrasty.<br/>Almost looks like a black light poster of sorts.</td>', 'Having a bit of a hard time with the colors being so bright and contrasty.Almost looks like a black light poster of sorts.', '2007-01-16 21:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242744, 449035, 57378, '<td valign="top">A little too much dodging I think on the people. Nice subject though.</td>', 'A little too much dodging I think on the people. Nice subject though.', '2007-01-16 21:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
