(3242820, 451129, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great capture - one in a million and I can see this getting the win!!!<br/>Very well done and I would have put it in in my best of 2006 if I had it!</td>', 'Great capture - one in a million and I can see this getting the win!!!Very well done and I would have put it in in my best of 2006 if I had it!', '2007-01-16 21:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
