(3245732, 451963, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice straight out of the camera.  I think you might have been able to possibly sharpen it a little better, which I consider to still be somewhat straight out of the camera.  Nice composition with the radiating lines toward the center.</td>', 'Nice straight out of the camera.  I think you might have been able to possibly sharpen it a little better, which I consider to still be somewhat straight out of the camera.  Nice composition with the radiating lines toward the center.', '2007-01-17 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3245740, 447711, 15204, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot with nice colors and composition.  I like the over the shoulder gaze of the zebra.  The shadows seem blocked on my monitor, though.  Both in the zebra stripes and in the other animals (wildebeasts?) in the background.  6 from me.</td>', 'This is a cool shot with nice colors and composition.  I like the over the shoulder gaze of the zebra.  The shadows seem blocked on my monitor, though.  Both in the zebra stripes and in the other animals (wildebeasts?) in the background.  6 from me.', '2007-01-17 09:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3245755, 448176, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lovely shape.  The grassblades in the foreground (the ghost ones) kind of upset the general harmony of the image.  I think they could have easily been cloned out to give the eye no break between the screen and the lovely twisted shape.</td>', 'Lovely shape.  The grassblades in the foreground (the ghost ones) kind of upset the general harmony of the image.  I think they could have easily been cloned out to give the eye no break between the screen and the lovely twisted shape.', '2007-01-17 09:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
