(3247309, 451719, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Well now, this is an asset to DPC.  The ''dirty/dusty pp effect'' suits this image well.  Glad you retained the colors, especially of the sky, which complements the browns nicely.  Like to have seen the upper left area even ''smoother'', but fairly minor.  Very good natural capture - glad that the background is there for context and ''verification''.</td>', '9 - Well now, this is an asset to DPC.  The ''dirty/dusty pp effect'' suits this image well.  Glad you retained the colors, especially of the sky, which complements the browns nicely.  Like to have seen the upper left area even ''smoother'', but fairly minor.  Very good natural capture - glad that the background is there for context and ''verification''.', '2007-01-17 14:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247330, 448524, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Difficult with an obvious ''opportune capture'', but more detail make it even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Difficult with an obvious ''opportune capture'', but more detail make it even better in my opinion.', '2007-01-17 14:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
