(3247561, 447620, 23430, '<td valign="top">Composition very good. Light OK. Subject very good. Clarity very good. DOF very good. I like this one. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Composition very good. Light OK. Subject very good. Clarity very good. DOF very good. I like this one. Hope it does well for you.', '2007-01-17 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247565, 451282, 16046, '<td valign="top">funny, made me smile</td>', 'funny, made me smile', '2007-01-17 15:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247567, 449683, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool night shot.  It feels a bit off balanced to me, thought.  Maybe if the tower were further to the left in the frame, almost eliminating the light and pole.  Because eyes seem to be drawn to bright spots, I find myself looking at the light on the left more than the tower/bridge.  If it were not there, my eyes would tend to be pulled to the light on the right, which would then "cause" me to see more of the bridge and tower.<br/> <br/>Or maybe I am just part moth.</td>', 'Cool night shot.  It feels a bit off balanced to me, thought.  Maybe if the tower were further to the left in the frame, almost eliminating the light and pole.  Because eyes seem to be drawn to bright spots, I find myself looking at the light on the left more than the tower/bridge.  If it were not there, my eyes would tend to be pulled to the light on the right, which would then "cause" me to see more of the bridge and tower. Or maybe I am just part moth.', '2007-01-17 15:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247570, 449779, 16046, '<td valign="top">cool, great prop, I imagine you will have other images with it. well done</td>', 'cool, great prop, I imagine you will have other images with it. well done', '2007-01-17 15:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247572, 447982, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and exposure.  However, the background, limbs, and bird are all kinda in the same color family, so it feels a little drab.</td>', 'Excellent focus and exposure.  However, the background, limbs, and bird are all kinda in the same color family, so it feels a little drab.', '2007-01-17 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247574, 451555, 811, '<td valign="top">Intriguing.  Good capture.</td>', 'Intriguing.  Good capture.', '2007-01-17 15:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247576, 449975, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Well done.  Just wish ''somehow'' the colors popped more, even though I realize that the subtlety may be intentional.  Perhaps a different choice of framing, who knows.</td>', '8 - Well done.  Just wish ''somehow'' the colors popped more, even though I realize that the subtlety may be intentional.  Perhaps a different choice of framing, who knows.', '2007-01-17 15:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
