(3248000, 450148, 23430, '<td valign="top">The light and composition is very nice. I like how the black dress matches the background making just the model''s hair and skin come out. Her look is nice too. Well done on a beautiful portrait.</td>', 'The light and composition is very nice. I like how the black dress matches the background making just the model''s hair and skin come out. Her look is nice too. Well done on a beautiful portrait.', '2007-01-17 16:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
