(3250276, 447568, 39243, '<td valign="top">I am making an assumption here and guessing that this young man has Cerebral Palsy. Reguardless of what his condition is - it truly is mighty for him to be out and about on the beach with his walker. Hard packed land can be hard enough. - As for the technical merrit I think this photo would be better served taken later in the day so that there is not so much glare off of the ocean. Give this kid a big old congrats from me! I think its awesome!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 02:26:06.</i></td>', 'I am making an assumption here and guessing that this young man has Cerebral Palsy. Reguardless of what his condition is - it truly is mighty for him to be out and about on the beach with his walker. Hard packed land can be hard enough. - As for the technical merrit I think this photo would be better served taken later in the day so that there is not so much glare off of the ocean. Give this kid a big old congrats from me! I think its awesome!', '2007-01-18 03:53:39.000000', '2007-01-26 02:26:06.000000', 1),
(3250279, 451939, 39243, '<td valign="top">great photo - the money is a little over the top - I think the photo did not need the cash to be great - as is 8. I am currious how this one will do!</td>', 'great photo - the money is a little over the top - I think the photo did not need the cash to be great - as is 8. I am currious how this one will do!', '2007-01-18 03:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
