(3251237, 447992, 22689, '<td valign="top">I remember quite well this view , I suppose it''s you Barry.<br/> <br/>This time the atmosphere is totally different , in "Warming Rays: Progressive Illumination" it was magic , this one is dreamy like the mental sketch of the memory while evoking that place.<br/>The quite warm tones of the dawn and the flying birds add poetry ; like an Impressionist work with soft touches of light you depicted a delicate landscape.<br/>Sorry if it''s not very constructive but for me this photography is perfect.<br/>I would love to be able to hang side by side "Foggy Dawn on the Rappahanock River" and "Warming Rays: Progressive Illumination" on a wall in my house.<br/>my vote : 10</td>', 'I remember quite well this view , I suppose it''s you Barry. This time the atmosphere is totally different , in "Warming Rays: Progressive Illumination" it was magic , this one is dreamy like the mental sketch of the memory while evoking that place.The quite warm tones of the dawn and the flying birds add poetry ; like an Impressionist work with soft touches of light you depicted a delicate landscape.Sorry if it''s not very constructive but for me this photography is perfect.I would love to be able to hang side by side "Foggy Dawn on the Rappahanock River" and "Warming Rays: Progressive Illumination" on a wall in my house.my vote : 10', '2007-01-18 11:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
