(3251458, 449975, 4517, '<td valign="top">This is good, very sharp. Great action shot.</td>', 'This is good, very sharp. Great action shot.', '2007-01-18 12:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251459, 447624, 32321, '<td valign="top">Lot''s I like, processing and lighting..pose looks stiff, and you have a distracting shadow</td>', 'Lot''s I like, processing and lighting..pose looks stiff, and you have a distracting shadow', '2007-01-18 12:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251461, 450938, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really quite like this - very striking.</td>', 'I really quite like this - very striking.', '2007-01-18 12:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251463, 451752, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like this, but the quality seems to be lacking - could be resizing / pp issues.</td>', '5 - Like this, but the quality seems to be lacking - could be resizing / pp issues.', '2007-01-18 12:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251468, 451129, 48954, '<td valign="top">very cool capture but over edited. the tiger looks like it cut out from another frame. The left paw for example is very odd looking. the colours are off compared to the rest of the animal and the edge is unreal and flat. 6</td>', 'very cool capture but over edited. the tiger looks like it cut out from another frame. The left paw for example is very odd looking. the colours are off compared to the rest of the animal and the edge is unreal and flat. 6', '2007-01-18 12:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251474, 451824, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for well done bug macros and this one is delightful!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for well done bug macros and this one is delightful!', '2007-01-18 12:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251489, 450208, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the moment in time aspect of this.  Not as sure about the desat, but I understand why you did it and you did it very well.  Interesting characters!</td>', 'I like the moment in time aspect of this.  Not as sure about the desat, but I understand why you did it and you did it very well.  Interesting characters!', '2007-01-18 12:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251499, 451843, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the combinations of colors and grays.  I know this is 720, but still ''wish it were bigger'' - an image that likely cannot be appreciated in this medium.  More detail/depth discernible, be even better, but difficult.  Nice scene.  Also like the cloud capture over the mountain/hill top.  The top part of the image isn''t as ''rich'' as the rest of the image, but I do understand that you''ve likely left it there for compositional balance, as well as color.  Lines are good.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Like the combinations of colors and grays.  I know this is 720, but still ''wish it were bigger'' - an image that likely cannot be appreciated in this medium.  More detail/depth discernible, be even better, but difficult.  Nice scene.  Also like the cloud capture over the mountain/hill top.  The top part of the image isn''t as ''rich'' as the rest of the image, but I do understand that you''ve likely left it there for compositional balance, as well as color.  Lines are good.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2007-01-18 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251509, 451055, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition, great tones.</td>', 'Nice simple composition, great tones.', '2007-01-18 12:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251513, 447673, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of shot - love the quietness of it, the curve of the composition.</td>', 'My kind of shot - love the quietness of it, the curve of the composition.', '2007-01-18 12:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251517, 450933, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Really like the greens.  Frame gives it a ''poster'' feel, which is ''good'', but I wonder about a variation, especially for this medium - even if perhaps just a little ''finer'', not sure.  I know it is 720, but still, ''wish it were bigger''.  Bottom part of the image, perhaps <i>maybe</i> a little too tightly cropped - but your call, obviously.  Just seems <i>slightly</i> out compositionally/balance wise.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Really like the greens.  Frame gives it a ''poster'' feel, which is ''good'', but I wonder about a variation, especially for this medium - even if perhaps just a little ''finer'', not sure.  I know it is 720, but still, ''wish it were bigger''.  Bottom part of the image, perhaps maybe a little too tightly cropped - but your call, obviously.  Just seems slightly out compositionally/balance wise.', '2007-01-18 12:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251530, 451948, 35994, '<td valign="top">Colors look a little funky, I''m guessing intentionally... The 1/2 a cow is funny though, i like it</td>', 'Colors look a little funky, I''m guessing intentionally... The 1/2 a cow is funny though, i like it', '2007-01-18 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251532, 451079, 35994, '<td valign="top">Neato! Nice colors</td>', 'Neato! Nice colors', '2007-01-18 12:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
