(3251907, 451580, 69387, '<td valign="top">Incredible subject. Nice clarity on the face.  I don''t mind the blurry focus on the rest of the body, but it''s a tad too dark. Also, I would have cropped this differently, showing more of the face and head and less of the ground. This is a great photo and should do you well. Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Incredible subject. Nice clarity on the face.  I don''t mind the blurry focus on the rest of the body, but it''s a tad too dark. Also, I would have cropped this differently, showing more of the face and head and less of the ground. This is a great photo and should do you well. Good luck!', '2007-01-18 14:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
