(3252045, 450924, 6999, '<td valign="top">Clever, aware, and disarmingly simple - in fact, deceptively simple: this balance of composition is a hurdle at which many would fall, but your awareness of the balance throughout frame is exemplary. Nice work. I''d be intrigued to know why it isn''t a black and white image - I''d have thought it lent itself beautifully to a form that would emphasise the graphic more strongly.</td>', 'Clever, aware, and disarmingly simple - in fact, deceptively simple: this balance of composition is a hurdle at which many would fall, but your awareness of the balance throughout frame is exemplary. Nice work. I''d be intrigued to know why it isn''t a black and white image - I''d have thought it lent itself beautifully to a form that would emphasise the graphic more strongly.', '2007-01-18 15:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252047, 450534, 69387, '<td valign="top">Great subject. The sky looks overprocessed.</td>', 'Great subject. The sky looks overprocessed.', '2007-01-18 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
