(3252054, 451445, 6999, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite feel sharp enough - like the finest detail isn''t quite resolved in this image. I think - and certainly for a more DPC-friendly image - you should pay more attention to the background, which is messy here, and perhaps also some processing could add depth to the colour.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite feel sharp enough - like the finest detail isn''t quite resolved in this image. I think - and certainly for a more DPC-friendly image - you should pay more attention to the background, which is messy here, and perhaps also some processing could add depth to the colour.', '2007-01-18 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252057, 450055, 69387, '<td valign="top">Way too overprocessed for my taste. Great subject/idea though.</td>', 'Way too overprocessed for my taste. Great subject/idea though.', '2007-01-18 15:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
