(3252678, 447593, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The variety of rock angles that the water is falling over makes this shot very apealing to me and sets it apart from being "just another soft water shot".  Nicely done.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Lovely.  The variety of rock angles that the water is falling over makes this shot very apealing to me and sets it apart from being "just another soft water shot".  Nicely done.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-01-18 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
