(3252691, 448446, 70270, '<td valign="top">There''s something haunting about this image that captures me every time I come across it, though I can''t quite figure out what it is.  Maybe a combination of the windblown hair and the model''s expression ... whatever it is, i like it.  9.</td>', 'There''s something haunting about this image that captures me every time I come across it, though I can''t quite figure out what it is.  Maybe a combination of the windblown hair and the model''s expression ... whatever it is, i like it.  9.', '2007-01-18 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252699, 449035, 55838, '<td valign="top">Cool color tones and I like the composition.  The people in the foreground have an unusual glow about them :) but other than that this is a very nice shot.  I think the grain works very well on this image.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Cool color tones and I like the composition.  The people in the foreground have an unusual glow about them :) but other than that this is a very nice shot.  I think the grain works very well on this image.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-01-18 18:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252703, 451268, 42013, '<td valign="top">Hi!</td>', 'Hi!', '2007-01-18 18:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252704, 451441, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting cloud formation, but the picture strikes me as little more than a snapshot imho.  The interest here is in the clouds, but not necessarily in the way it was photographed.  A longer lens or a tighter crop would have helped.</td>', 'Interesting cloud formation, but the picture strikes me as little more than a snapshot imho.  The interest here is in the clouds, but not necessarily in the way it was photographed.  A longer lens or a tighter crop would have helped.', '2007-01-18 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252706, 450638, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very impressive sharpness throughout. Good work!</td>', 'Very impressive sharpness throughout. Good work!', '2007-01-18 18:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252708, 451683, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  You might consider moving the horizon lower or higher, depending on whether you want to capture the clouds or the landscape ... as it is, I found the two elements competing with one another</td>', 'Nice scene.  You might consider moving the horizon lower or higher, depending on whether you want to capture the clouds or the landscape ... as it is, I found the two elements competing with one another', '2007-01-18 18:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252709, 448385, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, but the image is just not that interesting to look at, imho.</td>', 'Interesting colors, but the image is just not that interesting to look at, imho.', '2007-01-18 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252710, 450967, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, I''m sure, but a difficult one to capture on film.  There''s no clear center of attention in the image, and the tree on the far bank blends into the background a bit much.  I''d suggest moving around the subject a bit more and changing your angle of view (don''t care for the shooting down into the canyon look, imho), but that was probably difficult given the topography.</td>', 'Nice subject, I''m sure, but a difficult one to capture on film.  There''s no clear center of attention in the image, and the tree on the far bank blends into the background a bit much.  I''d suggest moving around the subject a bit more and changing your angle of view (don''t care for the shooting down into the canyon look, imho), but that was probably difficult given the topography.', '2007-01-18 18:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3252711, 451319, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic real life moment captured!  It emanates the love &amp; fun of family.  Each with very much their own personality.  Very nice.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'What a fantastic real life moment captured!  It emanates the love & fun of family.  Each with very much their own personality.  Very nice.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-01-18 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
