(3253497, 447625, 51802, '<td valign="top">Maybe this would be more significant to me if I kept up with baseball.  The big problem with this photo, is that half of it is dedicated to the backs of the people in front of you.</td>', 'Maybe this would be more significant to me if I kept up with baseball.  The big problem with this photo, is that half of it is dedicated to the backs of the people in front of you.', '2007-01-18 22:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
