(3254336, 449878, 30861, '<td valign="top">Are they ten feet tall? jejeje... This is sweet, albeit in my eyes it carries a hint of being "contrived", as if it''s almost trying too hard. A high score from me.</td>', 'Are they ten feet tall? jejeje... This is sweet, albeit in my eyes it carries a hint of being "contrived", as if it''s almost trying too hard. A high score from me.', '2007-01-19 02:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
