(3254339, 451545, 72418, '<td valign="top">From an artistic point of view, all the different lines and angles created by the architecture of the structures speaks of a varied history of events. This history captured, fenced in, and just off-center, might attest to that. The fact it is a vintage RCMP station might just confirm it.<br/>Nice work!</td>', 'From an artistic point of view, all the different lines and angles created by the architecture of the structures speaks of a varied history of events. This history captured, fenced in, and just off-center, might attest to that. The fact it is a vintage RCMP station might just confirm it.Nice work!', '2007-01-19 02:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254342, 451560, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a simply outstanding cloudscape. I can''t wait to see an original, if you care to share it, to see what you were working from. You may well suffer for "lack of a subject" but I don''t care. This one''s at the top of my list with a few others.</td>', 'This is a simply outstanding cloudscape. I can''t wait to see an original, if you care to share it, to see what you were working from. You may well suffer for "lack of a subject" but I don''t care. This one''s at the top of my list with a few others.', '2007-01-19 02:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
