(3256081, 449047, 52713, '<td valign="top">pretty child. the pink is a little over powering.</td>', 'pretty child. the pink is a little over powering.', '2007-01-19 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256089, 449116, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, colors tones and focus. Beautiful model and expression! Maybe there could be more cropped at the bottom?</td>', 'Very nice portrait, colors tones and focus. Beautiful model and expression! Maybe there could be more cropped at the bottom?', '2007-01-19 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256091, 451822, 52439, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective here, but nothing really interests me, and the sky looks  pretty dark and over saturated?</td>', 'I like the perspective here, but nothing really interests me, and the sky looks  pretty dark and over saturated?', '2007-01-19 14:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256101, 447654, 52439, '<td valign="top">I think the tones work really well here, although theres just something that doesn''t quite work, i think it''s the mothers pose and the darkness of both of their faces.<br/>Still good shot though.</td>', 'I think the tones work really well here, although theres just something that doesn''t quite work, i think it''s the mothers pose and the darkness of both of their faces.Still good shot though.', '2007-01-19 14:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256107, 447851, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks unreal.<br/>I think it works really well, except i don''t like the dead space to the left, and feel that if you could have shifted your perspective further right and possibly given it a panoramic crop it would be outstanding.</td>', 'Wow, looks unreal.I think it works really well, except i don''t like the dead space to the left, and feel that if you could have shifted your perspective further right and possibly given it a panoramic crop it would be outstanding.', '2007-01-19 14:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256115, 451864, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow.<br/>Those hands look scarily human, which gives this photo a whole new level of effectiveness. Think the tight crop is a good idea as it forces you to confront it. Shame it''s not a little more in focus.<br/>Still very thought provoking.</td>', 'Wow.Those hands look scarily human, which gives this photo a whole new level of effectiveness. Think the tight crop is a good idea as it forces you to confront it. Shame it''s not a little more in focus.Still very thought provoking.', '2007-01-19 14:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256116, 447742, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, nice composition but lacks the ''wow'' factor.<br/>Still a nice shot.</td>', 'Lovely colours, nice composition but lacks the ''wow'' factor.Still a nice shot.', '2007-01-19 14:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256119, 449116, 69537, '<td valign="top">The color, sharpness and cropping are amazing. The model is absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'The color, sharpness and cropping are amazing. The model is absolutely beautiful.', '2007-01-19 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256122, 451471, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset. The horizon line seems a bit tilted.</td>', 'Nice sunset. The horizon line seems a bit tilted.', '2007-01-19 14:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256124, 447982, 52439, '<td valign="top">Really great clarity and sharpness here. Shame about the twig crossing his body but it''s a great capture that couldn''t have been easy.</td>', 'Really great clarity and sharpness here. Shame about the twig crossing his body but it''s a great capture that couldn''t have been easy.', '2007-01-19 14:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256128, 450084, 52439, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection of you in the eyes.<br/>Shame here face is a little dimly lit, if you could have, somehow, gotten a bit more light in there it would have illuminated her cute features.</td>', 'Love the reflection of you in the eyes.Shame here face is a little dimly lit, if you could have, somehow, gotten a bit more light in there it would have illuminated her cute features.', '2007-01-19 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256134, 451354, 52439, '<td valign="top">Good capture with great expressions.<br/>Well done on the exposure aswell as it''s spot on.<br/>I think you needed to keep the floor in the crop to show here levitation but somehow it doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'Good capture with great expressions.Well done on the exposure aswell as it''s spot on.I think you needed to keep the floor in the crop to show here levitation but somehow it doesn''t seem to fit.', '2007-01-19 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256142, 449039, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great timing here.<br/>Lovely colours and a nice feeling here but it feels alittle over sharpened perhaps, and could be improved by cropping tighter around the two moths(?).</td>', 'Great timing here.Lovely colours and a nice feeling here but it feels alittle over sharpened perhaps, and could be improved by cropping tighter around the two moths(?).', '2007-01-19 14:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256146, 451697, 29591, '<td valign="top">Great old-timer :)</td>', 'Great old-timer :)', '2007-01-19 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256148, 450938, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very well exposed here as her face is really nicely lit.<br/>Not a bad idea with the omposition here either.<br/>I hope i don''t offend anyone here, but my first thoughts were it''s a man in drag...? :/</td>', 'Very well exposed here as her face is really nicely lit.Not a bad idea with the omposition here either.I hope i don''t offend anyone here, but my first thoughts were it''s a man in drag...? :/', '2007-01-19 14:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256149, 449496, 69537, '<td valign="top">Interesting and amazing capture of the lemurs. Good DOF and colors. I want to see this cropped as perfect square and make the lovable subjects in the center. This one is slightly off-centered and is neither a square nor a rectangle. I hope this will do well.</td>', 'Interesting and amazing capture of the lemurs. Good DOF and colors. I want to see this cropped as perfect square and make the lovable subjects in the center. This one is slightly off-centered and is neither a square nor a rectangle. I hope this will do well.', '2007-01-19 14:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256153, 451694, 29591, '<td valign="top">IMHO the composition looks too busy and distracting. On the other hand, nice colors and shallow DOF</td>', 'IMHO the composition looks too busy and distracting. On the other hand, nice colors and shallow DOF', '2007-01-19 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256154, 451727, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, nicely exposed, nice leading lines drawing the eye into the photo.<br/>However, it seems over processed and that cloud peeping over the mountains is a prime example, also the trees and the water lack any punch, maybe they needed a boost in saturation to liven the shot up a little.</td>', 'Nicely composed, nicely exposed, nice leading lines drawing the eye into the photo.However, it seems over processed and that cloud peeping over the mountains is a prime example, also the trees and the water lack any punch, maybe they needed a boost in saturation to liven the shot up a little.', '2007-01-19 14:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256155, 451933, 52439, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this shot.<br/>My eye is just drawn to the scratch below his/hers.</td>', 'I don''t like this shot.My eye is just drawn to the scratch below his/hers.', '2007-01-19 14:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256157, 451857, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and silhouette, evoking a wonderful afternoon. You could have leveled the the water line though...</td>', 'Nice composition and silhouette, evoking a wonderful afternoon. You could have leveled the the water line though...', '2007-01-19 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256164, 451117, 69537, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky, simple but beautiful valley, cute tiny houses, rocks, marshes ,great colors, clean and sharp image. What more can one ask for? Great capture and here''s hoping that it will do well.</td>', 'Dramatic sky, simple but beautiful valley, cute tiny houses, rocks, marshes ,great colors, clean and sharp image. What more can one ask for? Great capture and here''s hoping that it will do well.', '2007-01-19 14:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256165, 448624, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an impact here!<br/>Fantastic macro shot.<br/>Brilliantly composed, i hope this is cropped in otherwise it was excellent camera work to actually get this.<br/>I can''t stop looking at it, perfectly focused and oh so sharp for the dpc crowd, :P</td>', 'Wow, what an impact here!Fantastic macro shot.Brilliantly composed, i hope this is cropped in otherwise it was excellent camera work to actually get this.I can''t stop looking at it, perfectly focused and oh so sharp for the dpc crowd, :P', '2007-01-19 14:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256168, 448730, 52439, '<td valign="top">Love it. <br/>I don''t think i need to waffle on about why.<br/>Its brilliant.</td>', 'Love it. I don''t think i need to waffle on about why.Its brilliant.', '2007-01-19 14:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256170, 448695, 35994, '<td valign="top">A little dark IMO, like the idea though</td>', 'A little dark IMO, like the idea though', '2007-01-19 14:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
