(3256189, 450293, 52439, '<td valign="top">It''s alittle bland and lifeless, needs abit more exposure and abit of a contrast boost to liven things up.</td>', 'It''s alittle bland and lifeless, needs abit more exposure and abit of a contrast boost to liven things up.', '2007-01-19 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256190, 451598, 52439, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot, after what i''ve just voted on.<br/>In contrast to the last image i saw this has punch, vobrance and is well composed. I like the ivy leading you into the frame and up climbing the wall.<br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Perfect shot, after what i''ve just voted on.In contrast to the last image i saw this has punch, vobrance and is well composed. I like the ivy leading you into the frame and up climbing the wall.Nice shot.', '2007-01-19 14:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256197, 448477, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice title, :P<br/>I like this shot actually, think it''s really creative.<br/>My only criticism apart from the nit picking feel that the wall isn''t level, (although i''m sure it''s only because the grass is taller at the left than the right), is that the cat doesn''t seem to be very much in focus. I think as he is the main subject (despite size proportions) the focus should be on him.<br/>Good shot though, really nice.</td>', 'Nice title, :PI like this shot actually, think it''s really creative.My only criticism apart from the nit picking feel that the wall isn''t level, (although i''m sure it''s only because the grass is taller at the left than the right), is that the cat doesn''t seem to be very much in focus. I think as he is the main subject (despite size proportions) the focus should be on him.Good shot though, really nice.', '2007-01-19 14:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256199, 451581, 52439, '<td valign="top">Quite deep!<br/>I like it, despite being a little bit scared, :P<br/>Bet it took a while with all those pages, unless ofcourse you already had all those pinned up, which i hope you didn''t.<br/>Brilliant motion blur, bet that took some tries!<br/>Very well done here.</td>', 'Quite deep!I like it, despite being a little bit scared, :PBet it took a while with all those pages, unless ofcourse you already had all those pinned up, which i hope you didn''t.Brilliant motion blur, bet that took some tries!Very well done here.', '2007-01-19 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256201, 451540, 52439, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.<br/>Really strong atmosphere, great composition, great focus and i like that you have the nearest tree in focus and not actually the runner.<br/>Could be a cover poster for Rocky!<br/>Great shot.<br/>Might come back to fav.<br/>8</td>', 'Love this shot.Really strong atmosphere, great composition, great focus and i like that you have the nearest tree in focus and not actually the runner.Could be a cover poster for Rocky!Great shot.Might come back to fav.8', '2007-01-19 14:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256202, 451691, 35994, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous of these kind of shots!! Wish I could see this skyline!! Nice colors</td>', 'I am so jealous of these kind of shots!! Wish I could see this skyline!! Nice colors', '2007-01-19 14:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256217, 448121, 29797, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really makes one want to go there. The mountains and architecture really give a nice sense of scale to each other. I wish there were just a little more to view underneath the hotel (or whatever it is), but just a minor nitpick in a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Nice shot, really makes one want to go there. The mountains and architecture really give a nice sense of scale to each other. I wish there were just a little more to view underneath the hotel (or whatever it is), but just a minor nitpick in a beautiful photo.', '2007-01-19 14:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
