(3256285, 451555, 29797, '<td valign="top">Looks like Newport Harbor from Balboa? Incredible capture there, I love how the bolts of lightning framing Balboa Pavillion. Nice job!</td>', 'Looks like Newport Harbor from Balboa? Incredible capture there, I love how the bolts of lightning framing Balboa Pavillion. Nice job!', '2007-01-19 15:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
