(3256432, 450040, 69537, '<td valign="top">There are so many good entries here and it''s hard to decide which one is really the best. The great thing about this photograph are the elements present: sparkling water with the reflections, dramatic cloudy skies, good buildings to enhance the sky line, green trees that add more colors. <br/> <br/>HDR? I am not big fan but this isn''t cartoonish so it works for me. <br/> <br/>One request: I wish to see the water cropped just a little bit tight so that the lines for the trees and bldgs are on the 1/3 line of the photo. <br/> <br/>Overall, this is one great entry. <br/> <br/>I hope this will do well.</td>', 'There are so many good entries here and it''s hard to decide which one is really the best. The great thing about this photograph are the elements present: sparkling water with the reflections, dramatic cloudy skies, good buildings to enhance the sky line, green trees that add more colors.  HDR? I am not big fan but this isn''t cartoonish so it works for me.  One request: I wish to see the water cropped just a little bit tight so that the lines for the trees and bldgs are on the 1/3 line of the photo.  Overall, this is one great entry.  I hope this will do well.', '2007-01-19 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
