(3256684, 451662, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting, trying to get a paintinglike effect here I guess? I quite like those ideas, altough the effect here has resulted in some blur softness that I do not see in paintings. There is a light halo around some parts of the arm and head scarf, looks a bit sloppy.<br/>I also think that this could benefit from a more darkened background, because the tones fo grey in fore and background are too close now.<br/>I like the composition, the pose, the light and the facial expression. 7</td>', 'Interesting, trying to get a paintinglike effect here I guess? I quite like those ideas, altough the effect here has resulted in some blur softness that I do not see in paintings. There is a light halo around some parts of the arm and head scarf, looks a bit sloppy.I also think that this could benefit from a more darkened background, because the tones fo grey in fore and background are too close now.I like the composition, the pose, the light and the facial expression. 7', '2007-01-19 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
