(3256796, 451703, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity of detail and what wonderful textures and colours! I love the dried and dying petals, twisting and falling away from the stem. The shallow DOF is perfect and composition also spot on.</td>', 'Lovely clarity of detail and what wonderful textures and colours! I love the dried and dying petals, twisting and falling away from the stem. The shallow DOF is perfect and composition also spot on.', '2007-01-19 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256800, 448635, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely use of silhouette and framing together. The texture of the background arches/ walls is wonderful, the overall composition excellent and I just love the simple detail of the workman and his tool.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely use of silhouette and framing together. The texture of the background arches/ walls is wonderful, the overall composition excellent and I just love the simple detail of the workman and his tool.', '2007-01-19 17:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256801, 449145, 327, '<td valign="top">Pure. This is so clean, crisp. Love it. Wonderful work.</td>', 'Pure. This is so clean, crisp. Love it. Wonderful work.', '2007-01-19 17:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256802, 448668, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely lighting.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely lighting.', '2007-01-19 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256806, 450990, 42013, '<td valign="top">Its a non-typical view of an alpine stream. Not sure if it is the best option but frankly your picture is so striking that it doesn''t get marked down by me. 9.  It looks like some of terje''s work.</td>', 'Its a non-typical view of an alpine stream. Not sure if it is the best option but frankly your picture is so striking that it doesn''t get marked down by me. 9.  It looks like some of terje''s work.', '2007-01-19 17:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256807, 448624, 327, '<td valign="top">Good. That''s a nice lens!</td>', 'Good. That''s a nice lens!', '2007-01-19 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256808, 451677, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what colours! Though I would prefer this without the bee - I don''t think it''s a great focal point compared to the flower and given that the flower attracts my focus, I don''t need the bee really! Composition and shallow DOF great too - I love the contrast between reds and yellow of the foreground and blues and greens behind.</td>', 'Wow, what colours! Though I would prefer this without the bee - I don''t think it''s a great focal point compared to the flower and given that the flower attracts my focus, I don''t need the bee really! Composition and shallow DOF great too - I love the contrast between reds and yellow of the foreground and blues and greens behind.', '2007-01-19 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256811, 447568, 42013, '<td valign="top">I hope you rock the challenge with this picture. Its already in my favs and its realism and depth of emotion separates it from the pack.</td>', 'I hope you rock the challenge with this picture. Its already in my favs and its realism and depth of emotion separates it from the pack.', '2007-01-19 17:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256813, 451957, 57060, '<td valign="top">The colors here are really nice with the magenta played against the green and the white as an anchor. I tend to follow the stem down to the white and then drop off the bottom. Regardless, this is really nice, great vision to see this<br/> <br/>8<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'The colors here are really nice with the magenta played against the green and the white as an anchor. I tend to follow the stem down to the white and then drop off the bottom. Regardless, this is really nice, great vision to see this 8 Jack', '2007-01-19 17:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256815, 450961, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, I do like this. Yes, I know it''s a set up of three unrelated snails but  I don''t care one bit - it''s so Alice in Wonderland! I love quirky! Plus I am a sucker for extremely shallow DOF and high contrast black and white! So you have it all really! Top shot!</td>', 'Oh yes, I do like this. Yes, I know it''s a set up of three unrelated snails but  I don''t care one bit - it''s so Alice in Wonderland! I love quirky! Plus I am a sucker for extremely shallow DOF and high contrast black and white! So you have it all really! Top shot!', '2007-01-19 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256817, 451444, 42013, '<td valign="top">Librodo I presume ;) I like the different crop you chose. It gives the impression she is hiding herself from the viewer.</td>', 'Librodo I presume ;) I like the different crop you chose. It gives the impression she is hiding herself from the viewer.', '2007-01-19 17:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256818, 449496, 57060, '<td valign="top">Great shot..<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Great shot.. 7 Jack', '2007-01-19 17:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256820, 447981, 42013, '<td valign="top">Fantastic birds!</td>', 'Fantastic birds!', '2007-01-19 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256821, 451925, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely, just lovely! Now this is an image that I know, had I taken it on safari, I''d be sooooo pleased with, so elated about... and yet I don''t know how well it works without that emotional connection to the experience of seeing the animal in real life? It''s a good shot, certainly, but not a "Wow" shot, I think. Still, as I said, I know I''d be happy if this were mine!</td>', 'Lovely, just lovely! Now this is an image that I know, had I taken it on safari, I''d be sooooo pleased with, so elated about... and yet I don''t know how well it works without that emotional connection to the experience of seeing the animal in real life? It''s a good shot, certainly, but not a "Wow" shot, I think. Still, as I said, I know I''d be happy if this were mine!', '2007-01-19 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256823, 451079, 3087, '<td valign="top">Most cool. In particular I love the purple of the sky against the aqua and green of the wheel lights. Just lovely.</td>', 'Most cool. In particular I love the purple of the sky against the aqua and green of the wheel lights. Just lovely.', '2007-01-19 17:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256825, 451953, 57060, '<td valign="top">For some reason I''m not too big on pg shots, but you''ve done a wonderful job in capturing her happiness and personality. THis is really good with or without the pregnancy<br/> <br/>8<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'For some reason I''m not too big on pg shots, but you''ve done a wonderful job in capturing her happiness and personality. THis is really good with or without the pregnancy 8 Jack', '2007-01-19 17:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256826, 447984, 3087, '<td valign="top">Choice of backdrop colour works well to give a very funky, modern feel to this shot...</td>', 'Choice of backdrop colour works well to give a very funky, modern feel to this shot...', '2007-01-19 17:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256828, 447670, 3087, '<td valign="top">Loooove the colours and especially how the background colours mimic the beetle ones. Though I usually love extremely shallow DOF, I think it could afford to be just a touch deeper here.</td>', 'Loooove the colours and especially how the background colours mimic the beetle ones. Though I usually love extremely shallow DOF, I think it could afford to be just a touch deeper here.', '2007-01-19 17:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256829, 450961, 3032, '<td valign="top">ROFL, great shot, also like the b&amp;W toning a lot.</td>', 'ROFL, great shot, also like the b&W toning a lot.', '2007-01-19 17:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256830, 451767, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hey stranger, haven''t seen you on DPC much lately! Gotta love the complete contrast in colours between subject nad background... works really well.</td>', 'Hey stranger, haven''t seen you on DPC much lately! Gotta love the complete contrast in colours between subject nad background... works really well.', '2007-01-19 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256831, 447639, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharpness, I love those hairs along it''s neck/ body. Fantastic composition. Excellent DOF - love the softness of the background against the sharpness of the foreground. Oh and colours too - the foreground ones are just perfect over the background ones. An absolutely wonderful wildlife shot.</td>', 'Lovely sharpness, I love those hairs along it''s neck/ body. Fantastic composition. Excellent DOF - love the softness of the background against the sharpness of the foreground. Oh and colours too - the foreground ones are just perfect over the background ones. An absolutely wonderful wildlife shot.', '2007-01-19 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256839, 449996, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a wonderful pose you''ve captured - like a ballerina! The background looks almost painted - which continues that theatrical feel. And the green of the leaves echoes that of his makeup - sorry, his eyes! Great shot!</td>', 'Wow, what a wonderful pose you''ve captured - like a ballerina! The background looks almost painted - which continues that theatrical feel. And the green of the leaves echoes that of his makeup - sorry, his eyes! Great shot!', '2007-01-19 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256842, 451829, 3087, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I nearly skipped straight on past but actually, this shot has a strange permanence that made me stop. The light has a wonderful quality and the long exposure has managed to stress both the stillness and the movement at the same time! Colours are lovely. Lovely.</td>', 'At first glance, I nearly skipped straight on past but actually, this shot has a strange permanence that made me stop. The light has a wonderful quality and the long exposure has managed to stress both the stillness and the movement at the same time! Colours are lovely. Lovely.', '2007-01-19 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
