(3258722, 447552, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow! This has got to be one of the better plane shots I''ve seen. I really like how it is not just a shot of a plane going across a dull featureless sky. The trees and blur give a strong context, and a good feel of motion, and of being ''there''. Detail in the plane is very good. It stands out well. Nice work, very nice!</td>', 'Wow! This has got to be one of the better plane shots I''ve seen. I really like how it is not just a shot of a plane going across a dull featureless sky. The trees and blur give a strong context, and a good feel of motion, and of being ''there''. Detail in the plane is very good. It stands out well. Nice work, very nice!', '2007-01-20 05:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
