(3259666, 451441, 51802, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your subject is supposed to be.  If it is the sunset, you waited a little too late for that since almost all of the colors are gone.  Otherwise, this is a dark and uninteresting shot.  If you are trying to capture something in the water or tree line, a longer exposure would have helped.  Also, I don''t see the relevance of you title.</td>', 'I''m not sure what your subject is supposed to be.  If it is the sunset, you waited a little too late for that since almost all of the colors are gone.  Otherwise, this is a dark and uninteresting shot.  If you are trying to capture something in the water or tree line, a longer exposure would have helped.  Also, I don''t see the relevance of you title.', '2007-01-20 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259675, 448443, 51802, '<td valign="top">This may be an important event, and the people here may be important, but this does not convey much more than a quick snap-shot.  Was this really the best photo you took all year?  Not trying to be mean, but to a viewer who does not have any perspective as to what is going in this shot, it does not make a good impression.</td>', 'This may be an important event, and the people here may be important, but this does not convey much more than a quick snap-shot.  Was this really the best photo you took all year?  Not trying to be mean, but to a viewer who does not have any perspective as to what is going in this shot, it does not make a good impression.', '2007-01-20 14:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259679, 451852, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait, but something has degraded the detail in his eyes and hair to the point that it becomes a major distraction.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait, but something has degraded the detail in his eyes and hair to the point that it becomes a major distraction.', '2007-01-20 14:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259701, 450801, 42013, '<td valign="top">Precious picture. Technically not as strong as most but it''s really the moment that counts and its meaning to you.</td>', 'Precious picture. Technically not as strong as most but it''s really the moment that counts and its meaning to you.', '2007-01-20 14:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259703, 451961, 51802, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the clouds.</td>', 'I like the reflection of the clouds.', '2007-01-20 14:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259705, 449848, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro, but lacks the "wow" factor.</td>', 'This is a nice macro, but lacks the "wow" factor.', '2007-01-20 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259717, 447572, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if the flower were not so close to the bottom edge of the photo.</td>', 'I think it would be better if the flower were not so close to the bottom edge of the photo.', '2007-01-20 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259718, 451876, 51802, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the processing done on this shot.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the processing done on this shot.', '2007-01-20 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259719, 451190, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a stunning shot if the lighting were not so bad.  It looks like you tried to boost the brightness on this, but it has given the image a grayish tint.</td>', 'I think this would be a stunning shot if the lighting were not so bad.  It looks like you tried to boost the brightness on this, but it has given the image a grayish tint.', '2007-01-20 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259720, 451154, 51802, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the available lighting.</td>', 'Interesting use of the available lighting.', '2007-01-20 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3259722, 450680, 51802, '<td valign="top">Next time, pay a little more attention to how the image is framed in the camera.  This picture is not level and leaves the viewer with an uneasy feeling.</td>', 'Next time, pay a little more attention to how the image is framed in the camera.  This picture is not level and leaves the viewer with an uneasy feeling.', '2007-01-20 14:21:38.000000', NULL, 1);
