(3259723, 449814, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think if you had adjusted the saturation some, the colors would really make a much more dramatic impact.</td>', 'I think if you had adjusted the saturation some, the colors would really make a much more dramatic impact.', '2007-01-20 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
