(3259917, 450741, 811, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  At first glance, I wasn''t crazy about the effect of what appears to be post processing, but, I think the awkwardness of color/lighting (for lack of a better word) on the horse''s belly and the unevenness of the lighting really helps to emphasize the harshness of the weather.  Good work.</td>', 'This is awesome.  At first glance, I wasn''t crazy about the effect of what appears to be post processing, but, I think the awkwardness of color/lighting (for lack of a better word) on the horse''s belly and the unevenness of the lighting really helps to emphasize the harshness of the weather.  Good work.', '2007-01-20 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
