(3261356, 449271, 50695, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53572" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">xianart</a>. I love this image. It is simply magnificent. Epic and intimate. Utterly mysterious but full of stories. Abstract and representational at the same time. divided into sections that resonate with each other like tuning forks. I give this a 10, and whatever else I can give it.</td>', 'this reminds me of  xianart. I love this image. It is simply magnificent. Epic and intimate. Utterly mysterious but full of stories. Abstract and representational at the same time. divided into sections that resonate with each other like tuning forks. I give this a 10, and whatever else I can give it.', '2007-01-21 00:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
