(3261983, 448888, 30850, '<td valign="top">Would have benefited from a tighter crop.  Too much sky.</td>', 'Would have benefited from a tighter crop.  Too much sky.', '2007-01-21 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3261988, 450983, 30850, '<td valign="top">Wonder if fill flash would have improved this shot</td>', 'Wonder if fill flash would have improved this shot', '2007-01-21 09:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262003, 449039, 24962, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moth? in flight, yet still keeping everything else in focus. A sharp punchy shot with good contrast. Well worth 10</td>', 'Great capture of the moth? in flight, yet still keeping everything else in focus. A sharp punchy shot with good contrast. Well worth 10', '2007-01-21 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262007, 451560, 24962, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour, not over staturated, yet keeps that menace of the impending storm. It is a photo that draws the eye back time and again to see if the wispy clouds have moved at all. Well worth 10</td>', 'Great use of colour, not over staturated, yet keeps that menace of the impending storm. It is a photo that draws the eye back time and again to see if the wispy clouds have moved at all. Well worth 10', '2007-01-21 10:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262010, 448838, 24962, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a capture. I am guessing you had to bump ISO pretty high to freeze the hummingbird, hence the noise, which does not detract from the beauty of the photo. Worthy of 10</td>', 'Wow! What a capture. I am guessing you had to bump ISO pretty high to freeze the hummingbird, hence the noise, which does not detract from the beauty of the photo. Worthy of 10', '2007-01-21 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262012, 451691, 24962, '<td valign="top">I never tire of seeing these displays. I can''t say a lot more about this photo, the colours are stunning, the reflections as sharp as the display. Worthy 10</td>', 'I never tire of seeing these displays. I can''t say a lot more about this photo, the colours are stunning, the reflections as sharp as the display. Worthy 10', '2007-01-21 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262015, 448899, 24962, '<td valign="top">Highly emotive subject that has been processed with care. The colouring gives a greater feeling of desolation and finality. Well Done</td>', 'Highly emotive subject that has been processed with care. The colouring gives a greater feeling of desolation and finality. Well Done', '2007-01-21 10:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262017, 449938, 24962, '<td valign="top">I have a morbid fascination with thunderstorms and they never fail to catch my eye. The colouring increases the feeling of foreboding. Great shot.</td>', 'I have a morbid fascination with thunderstorms and they never fail to catch my eye. The colouring increases the feeling of foreboding. Great shot.', '2007-01-21 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262018, 451940, 24962, '<td valign="top">I have a morbid fascination with thunderstorms and they never fail to catch my eye. The colouring increases the feeling of foreboding. Great shot.</td>', 'I have a morbid fascination with thunderstorms and they never fail to catch my eye. The colouring increases the feeling of foreboding. Great shot.', '2007-01-21 10:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262023, 451117, 24962, '<td valign="top">Your picture conjures up a feeling of wild space, of isolation and desolation. I am not normally drawn to landscape enough to comment on them, but this jumped out of the rest and bit me hard! Well Done</td>', 'Your picture conjures up a feeling of wild space, of isolation and desolation. I am not normally drawn to landscape enough to comment on them, but this jumped out of the rest and bit me hard! Well Done', '2007-01-21 10:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262026, 451555, 24962, '<td valign="top">I can hear the crackling of the lightning and smell that unique smell. And yet, the world goes on on the harbour. A fantastic photo, well done.</td>', 'I can hear the crackling of the lightning and smell that unique smell. And yet, the world goes on on the harbour. A fantastic photo, well done.', '2007-01-21 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262027, 448209, 24962, '<td valign="top">I have read about the canyons and the weird shapes water has carved through them. The lighting is superb, the colours magical and overall the abstract nature of the photo lift it above many others. Well done.</td>', 'I have read about the canyons and the weird shapes water has carved through them. The lighting is superb, the colours magical and overall the abstract nature of the photo lift it above many others. Well done.', '2007-01-21 10:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262037, 451954, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh!</td>', 'Love the bokeh!', '2007-01-21 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262048, 447957, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Excellent tonal control, light and composition...and thank you for not going crazy with some sort of noise control, I love that I can see the texture of the skin, the slight "grain" of the background...so nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice! Excellent tonal control, light and composition...and thank you for not going crazy with some sort of noise control, I love that I can see the texture of the skin, the slight "grain" of the background...so nicely done.', '2007-01-21 10:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262070, 449153, 23053, '<td valign="top">I know that it would mean missing the spire on the extreme upper left, but I think I would have liked this shot more had you taken it beyond the shrub in the foreground.  I like the skewed perspective that comes from the wide-angle, and the colors are nicely saturated.  Good luck this week.</td>', 'I know that it would mean missing the spire on the extreme upper left, but I think I would have liked this shot more had you taken it beyond the shrub in the foreground.  I like the skewed perspective that comes from the wide-angle, and the colors are nicely saturated.  Good luck this week.', '2007-01-21 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262085, 451788, 23053, '<td valign="top">Personally, I don''t like the D&amp;B work here, since it gives the shot an almost cartoony feel.  It does serve to highlight the subject, however your framing and timing have already accomplished that admirably, making the D&amp;B seem unnecessary.  Trust your instincts, and do what feels right.  Good luck this week, and in the coming year.  A very interesting shot, by the way.</td>', 'Personally, I don''t like the D&B work here, since it gives the shot an almost cartoony feel.  It does serve to highlight the subject, however your framing and timing have already accomplished that admirably, making the D&B seem unnecessary.  Trust your instincts, and do what feels right.  Good luck this week, and in the coming year.  A very interesting shot, by the way.', '2007-01-21 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262093, 451829, 61191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the PP, the top is perhaps a bit too dark. Great colors btw.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the PP, the top is perhaps a bit too dark. Great colors btw.', '2007-01-21 11:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262095, 450534, 23053, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition...but I guess you already know that.  Good work.</td>', 'Beautiful composition...but I guess you already know that.  Good work.', '2007-01-21 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262096, 451741, 61191, '<td valign="top">This is an intersting shot but too small. Read the tutorial here at DPC about sizing images.</td>', 'This is an intersting shot but too small. Read the tutorial here at DPC about sizing images.', '2007-01-21 11:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262097, 451050, 61191, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love your composition and what''s going on in the sky! Too improve this I would make it brighter and add more contrast.</td>', 'Wow, I love your composition and what''s going on in the sky! Too improve this I would make it brighter and add more contrast.', '2007-01-21 11:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262098, 451947, 23484, '<td valign="top">A perfect example of the old and the new. Great idea for a shot.</td>', 'A perfect example of the old and the new. Great idea for a shot.', '2007-01-21 11:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262099, 449488, 61191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, amazing colors!</td>', 'Beautiful scene, amazing colors!', '2007-01-21 11:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262100, 451788, 23484, '<td valign="top">The whole scene is very interesting.  Looks like it came out of the old vaudville days.  Good job.</td>', 'The whole scene is very interesting.  Looks like it came out of the old vaudville days.  Good job.', '2007-01-21 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262109, 447733, 23053, '<td valign="top">Almost lost the cat in this...thanks for the title (it definately held my attention long enough to find the connection).  Good luck this week.</td>', 'Almost lost the cat in this...thanks for the title (it definately held my attention long enough to find the connection).  Good luck this week.', '2007-01-21 11:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262120, 449225, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is just plain cool.  You''ve done well on the exposure with only a few hot spots.  What would make it even better would be if the horizon weren''t running through the middle of the main subject. 8</td>', 'This is just plain cool.  You''ve done well on the exposure with only a few hot spots.  What would make it even better would be if the horizon weren''t running through the middle of the main subject. 8', '2007-01-21 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
