(3262529, 448898, 32754, '<td valign="top">I believe this was in your portfolio and appealed to me then; it still has a mesmerizing feel; wonderful point of view...the expressions on the people are just fascinating.</td>', 'I believe this was in your portfolio and appealed to me then; it still has a mesmerizing feel; wonderful point of view...the expressions on the people are just fascinating.', '2007-01-21 14:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
