(3265614, 450814, 2553, '<td valign="top">Stunning view, and your shot is nicely done.  I really love the composition you chose.  Seems most people choose a fairly close-up "portrait" orientation for lighthouses, but I like this far more.  Really gives a feel for the mood of the place.</td>', 'Stunning view, and your shot is nicely done.  I really love the composition you chose.  Seems most people choose a fairly close-up "portrait" orientation for lighthouses, but I like this far more.  Really gives a feel for the mood of the place.', '2007-01-22 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265773, 447625, 23484, '<td valign="top">You captured the action well but this shot is a little washed out.</td>', 'You captured the action well but this shot is a little washed out.', '2007-01-22 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265777, 447683, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and sky.  I think the people in the picture is a nice touch.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and sky.  I think the people in the picture is a nice touch.', '2007-01-22 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265834, 449683, 35044, '<td valign="top">I got married in the arch that you see here!<br/> <br/>Nice image - I might have preferred it with a longer shutter speed to leave light trails.  If you had used a higher fnumber for a smaller aperture, you would also obtain those interesting starlights around the lights.  Slightly earlier in the evening would have the benefit of a slightly more interesting sky - though I quite like the deep blue you have achieved.</td>', 'I got married in the arch that you see here! Nice image - I might have preferred it with a longer shutter speed to leave light trails.  If you had used a higher fnumber for a smaller aperture, you would also obtain those interesting starlights around the lights.  Slightly earlier in the evening would have the benefit of a slightly more interesting sky - though I quite like the deep blue you have achieved.', '2007-01-22 10:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265843, 451534, 20941, '<td valign="top">One of the most amazing wedding shots I''ve seen!!</td>', 'One of the most amazing wedding shots I''ve seen!!', '2007-01-22 10:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265848, 450924, 20941, '<td valign="top">cool composition with a wonderful perspective</td>', 'cool composition with a wonderful perspective', '2007-01-22 10:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265872, 451947, 20941, '<td valign="top">A very cool scene in contrasting situations, nice capture!</td>', 'A very cool scene in contrasting situations, nice capture!', '2007-01-22 10:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265885, 448898, 35044, '<td valign="top">Ooh - looks busy!  Not sure I like the crowd, though I see what you are trying to achieve.<br/> <br/>Image is oversharpened (see the jaggies on the statue''s side) and parts are overexposed (shirts of some of the viewers).  <br/> <br/>A shallow depth of field might have worked well here to keep the focus on the statue and keep the crowd in the background - IMO, you need the impression of a crowd more than the distracting detail.</td>', 'Ooh - looks busy!  Not sure I like the crowd, though I see what you are trying to achieve. Image is oversharpened (see the jaggies on the statue''s side) and parts are overexposed (shirts of some of the viewers).   A shallow depth of field might have worked well here to keep the focus on the statue and keep the crowd in the background - IMO, you need the impression of a crowd more than the distracting detail.', '2007-01-22 10:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
