(3266385, 451798, 35044, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there!  Mine is not a fantastic image, but here is one of my snaps (it mirrors the 20 yuan note).<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=445980" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35044/thumb/445980.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35044/thumb/445980.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35044/thumb/445980.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Great place - shame your horizon is a bit off and parts of the sky look a little overexposed and parts over-burned.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 06:16:49.</i></td>', 'I''ve been there!  Mine is not a fantastic image, but here is one of my snaps (it mirrors the 20 yuan note).   Great place - shame your horizon is a bit off and parts of the sky look a little overexposed and parts over-burned.', '2007-01-22 12:14:41.000000', '2007-01-26 06:16:49.000000', 1),
(3266387, 447682, 35044, '<td valign="top">Stunning light. Gets my vote for a ribbon.</td>', 'Stunning light. Gets my vote for a ribbon.', '2007-01-22 12:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3266401, 447683, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lovely - I presume HDR, but done right.  Great composition.  My vote for a ribbon.</td>', 'Lovely - I presume HDR, but done right.  Great composition.  My vote for a ribbon.', '2007-01-22 12:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3266405, 447639, 35044, '<td valign="top">Superb.  Great light and capture.  My only minor niggle is the slight overexposure on the neck.  I love the colour tone adpted.</td>', 'Superb.  Great light and capture.  My only minor niggle is the slight overexposure on the neck.  I love the colour tone adpted.', '2007-01-22 12:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
