(3266472, 448765, 35044, '<td valign="top">Dark skies, to be sure - but not "exciting" skies - no contrast in the clouds = a bit dull.</td>', 'Dark skies, to be sure - but not "exciting" skies - no contrast in the clouds = a bit dull.', '2007-01-22 12:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
