(3269546, 447519, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and contrast.  Saturation is nice and the blue is so vibrant that it gives a good counterpoint to the oranges.  I like that the reflection isn''t a perfect image of the real thing but is broken up by things in the water. It gets to me sometimes when I see photos where you almost can''t tell the reflection from the real thing; it just doesn''t "click" in my mind.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and contrast.  Saturation is nice and the blue is so vibrant that it gives a good counterpoint to the oranges.  I like that the reflection isn''t a perfect image of the real thing but is broken up by things in the water. It gets to me sometimes when I see photos where you almost can''t tell the reflection from the real thing; it just doesn''t "click" in my mind.', '2007-01-23 03:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269547, 447867, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the crop!!! Very simple, and effective, composition.</td>', 'Love the crop!!! Very simple, and effective, composition.', '2007-01-23 03:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269550, 451784, 53316, '<td valign="top">Amazingly gorgeous colors and a fantastic abstract image overall.</td>', 'Amazingly gorgeous colors and a fantastic abstract image overall.', '2007-01-23 03:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269551, 451560, 53316, '<td valign="top">Colors and contrast are just stellar. I also like the understanted border.</td>', 'Colors and contrast are just stellar. I also like the understanted border.', '2007-01-23 03:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269552, 447568, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  I like the "washed out" look because it seems to me to fit the subject matter.  Great title as well.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  I like the "washed out" look because it seems to me to fit the subject matter.  Great title as well.', '2007-01-23 03:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269555, 449845, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice! Is very subtle and beautiful.</td>', 'Nice! Is very subtle and beautiful.', '2007-01-23 03:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269557, 451706, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the color scheme a lot.</td>', 'I like the color scheme a lot.', '2007-01-23 03:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269559, 449904, 53316, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of color here.  So vibrant and alive.</td>', 'Fantastic use of color here.  So vibrant and alive.', '2007-01-23 03:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269560, 451609, 53316, '<td valign="top">STUNNING composition.</td>', 'STUNNING composition.', '2007-01-23 03:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269561, 448017, 53316, '<td valign="top">... WOW! Just amazing.  I love "optical illusion"ish stuff like this.  Works very, very well here as everything is so smooth... by that I mean when I look at it it just SEEMS real - no attention is drawn to the behind-the-scenes setup, for me.</td>', '... WOW! Just amazing.  I love "optical illusion"ish stuff like this.  Works very, very well here as everything is so smooth... by that I mean when I look at it it just SEEMS real - no attention is drawn to the behind-the-scenes setup, for me.', '2007-01-23 03:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269567, 449078, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love it! Composition is great - it is an abstract image but there is definitely a subject.  The yellow is not just some "blob" but is made more substantial by the lines of green around the bottom and out of the bottom.  It immediately says "flower" - in an understated way.  The colors compliment each other perfectly.. and I like the ... I don''t know how to put it but it seems that if I were to take this photo and adjust levels in Photoshop, I wouldn''t be able to get anything more to my liking.  Border is subtle yet definitely "there", acting as a way to hold in all the flowing color.  Very very good image in my opinion.</td>', 'I love it! Composition is great - it is an abstract image but there is definitely a subject.  The yellow is not just some "blob" but is made more substantial by the lines of green around the bottom and out of the bottom.  It immediately says "flower" - in an understated way.  The colors compliment each other perfectly.. and I like the ... I don''t know how to put it but it seems that if I were to take this photo and adjust levels in Photoshop, I wouldn''t be able to get anything more to my liking.  Border is subtle yet definitely "there", acting as a way to hold in all the flowing color.  Very very good image in my opinion.', '2007-01-23 03:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269568, 451580, 39993, '<td valign="top">Great.  Love the crop.</td>', 'Great.  Love the crop.', '2007-01-23 03:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269569, 449975, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great colors! Has the feel of selective desaturation without the harsh line between things that are and things that are not colored.</td>', 'Great colors! Has the feel of selective desaturation without the harsh line between things that are and things that are not colored.', '2007-01-23 03:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269570, 449055, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of light here.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of light here.', '2007-01-23 03:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269571, 451829, 53316, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and use of longer exposure.. my nitpick is that the upper right corner seems a bit too dark for me.</td>', 'Fantastic colors and use of longer exposure.. my nitpick is that the upper right corner seems a bit too dark for me.', '2007-01-23 03:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269572, 451540, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very serene image, and nice to view.</td>', 'Very serene image, and nice to view.', '2007-01-23 03:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269574, 451598, 53316, '<td valign="top">Color definitely very good here!</td>', 'Color definitely very good here!', '2007-01-23 03:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
