(3271193, 449457, 811, '<td valign="top">What a character!</td>', 'What a character!', '2007-01-23 14:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271197, 447561, 62095, '<td valign="top">This is a great image up front.  At the back the sloping horizon is a bit off-putting, but I can see why you would go for having the ground up front flat.</td>', 'This is a great image up front.  At the back the sloping horizon is a bit off-putting, but I can see why you would go for having the ground up front flat.', '2007-01-23 14:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271204, 447639, 62095, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this shot before on the forums though I can''t remember who it was who put it up there.  I thought it was a superb shot then and still do. A great find. 10</td>', 'I''ve seen this shot before on the forums though I can''t remember who it was who put it up there.  I thought it was a superb shot then and still do. A great find. 10', '2007-01-23 14:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271209, 451662, 62095, '<td valign="top">Good shot, very clear and subtle. 8</td>', 'Good shot, very clear and subtle. 8', '2007-01-23 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271219, 447767, 62095, '<td valign="top">Great quality of light and the "posed" bird make for a good shot. 9</td>', 'Great quality of light and the "posed" bird make for a good shot. 9', '2007-01-23 14:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271222, 447760, 811, '<td valign="top">The people look a bit brighter than the rest of the surroundings, so that looks a bit unnatural to me.  It has a bit of a snapshot feel to it--maybe the expressions cause that.  They look "forced" like they know the shot is being made, but they are trying to pretend it''s not.  (and just as an aside, I used to have a pair of black and whites vans just like that -- most comfortable shoes I''ve ever had.)</td>', 'The people look a bit brighter than the rest of the surroundings, so that looks a bit unnatural to me.  It has a bit of a snapshot feel to it--maybe the expressions cause that.  They look "forced" like they know the shot is being made, but they are trying to pretend it''s not.  (and just as an aside, I used to have a pair of black and whites vans just like that -- most comfortable shoes I''ve ever had.)', '2007-01-23 15:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271225, 447661, 811, '<td valign="top">That is cool.  Creeepy, but cool.  Nice colors and contrasts between them.</td>', 'That is cool.  Creeepy, but cool.  Nice colors and contrasts between them.', '2007-01-23 15:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271229, 448328, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the background, but it seems that the flowers could have been placed a bit better within the frame.  It almost feels like you were holding the camera with one hand and the flowers with the other.  Maybe if there were more cropped off the left, or if the flowers were at a steeper angle to the corner of the shot, it would feel a bit more natural.</td>', 'I love the background, but it seems that the flowers could have been placed a bit better within the frame.  It almost feels like you were holding the camera with one hand and the flowers with the other.  Maybe if there were more cropped off the left, or if the flowers were at a steeper angle to the corner of the shot, it would feel a bit more natural.', '2007-01-23 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271237, 451169, 811, '<td valign="top">Sounds odd to say it, but that is a pretty industrial shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Sounds odd to say it, but that is a pretty industrial shot.  Nice work.', '2007-01-23 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271242, 449225, 62095, '<td valign="top">Very clever. 9. In fact bumping to 10 now because I like this one.</td>', 'Very clever. 9. In fact bumping to 10 now because I like this one.', '2007-01-23 15:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
