(3272024, 448695, 19708, '<td valign="top">Odd critters aren''t they?<br/>This could have really been much more effective had the eye and area around it not been so deep in the shadows. Not a difficult fix in Photoshop using levels in a new layer via copy, then soft brush erasing back the areas that didn''t need to be brightened up.<br/>Jst a thought.</td>', 'Odd critters aren''t they?This could have really been much more effective had the eye and area around it not been so deep in the shadows. Not a difficult fix in Photoshop using levels in a new layer via copy, then soft brush erasing back the areas that didn''t need to be brightened up.Jst a thought.', '2007-01-23 18:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
