(3273719, 451354, 42826, '<td valign="top">hey, i have a costume just like that...but we had black pointe shoes and a red tutu!!!!  NEAT!</td>', 'hey, i have a costume just like that...but we had black pointe shoes and a red tutu!!!!  NEAT!', '2007-01-24 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3273836, 448864, 66022, '<td valign="top">Strange skin... good shot</td>', 'Strange skin... good shot', '2007-01-24 02:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3273932, 449225, 72102, '<td valign="top">cool!</td>', 'cool!', '2007-01-24 03:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274072, 447769, 19708, '<td valign="top">Tender moment captured here.<br/>Looks like something I could see on a greeting card, with some white cursive sentiments. Have you tried this in black &amp; white?<br/><i>psssst - go hide the one in your portfolio during the challenge.</i></td>', 'Tender moment captured here.Looks like something I could see on a greeting card, with some white cursive sentiments. Have you tried this in black & white?psssst - go hide the one in your portfolio during the challenge.', '2007-01-24 04:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274078, 451467, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very soft and precious shot. The direction her eyes are pointing to really makes this.</td>', 'Very soft and precious shot. The direction her eyes are pointing to really makes this.', '2007-01-24 04:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274083, 449359, 19708, '<td valign="top">Even us old dudes have jeans like that!<br/>Great point of view and a great expression captured here.<br/>Have you considered doing this in black &amp; white?<br/>Often the colors are a distracting element and our brains work harder studying them, then absorbing the emotions in an image.</td>', 'Even us old dudes have jeans like that!Great point of view and a great expression captured here.Have you considered doing this in black & white?Often the colors are a distracting element and our brains work harder studying them, then absorbing the emotions in an image.', '2007-01-24 04:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274088, 450774, 19708, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' love the expression here. Was this after the 40th shot?<br/> <br/>Have you considered doing this in black &amp; white?<br/>Often the colors are a distracting element and our brains work harder studying them, then absorbing the emotions in an image.</td>', 'Gotta'' love the expression here. Was this after the 40th shot? Have you considered doing this in black & white?Often the colors are a distracting element and our brains work harder studying them, then absorbing the emotions in an image.', '2007-01-24 04:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274130, 451491, 19708, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose and warm tones. Amazing hair too!<br/> <br/>Have you considered doing this in black &amp; white or quadtone?<br/>Often the colors are a distracting element and our brains work harder studying them, then absorbing the emotions in an image.</td>', 'I really like the pose and warm tones. Amazing hair too! Have you considered doing this in black & white or quadtone?Often the colors are a distracting element and our brains work harder studying them, then absorbing the emotions in an image.', '2007-01-24 04:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274158, 451864, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very strong message. The cold bars and weathered hands add to the feeling of years of sadness. Would have liked it to have been a bit sharper, to really get the texture on those hands out.</td>', 'Very strong message. The cold bars and weathered hands add to the feeling of years of sadness. Would have liked it to have been a bit sharper, to really get the texture on those hands out.', '2007-01-24 04:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274175, 451900, 46314, '<td valign="top">One of those ''Wish You Were Here'' photos - it really looks beautiful.</td>', 'One of those ''Wish You Were Here'' photos - it really looks beautiful.', '2007-01-24 04:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274186, 448895, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, exposure and composition. However, I can see some halo-ing around the edges of the wings where you must have done the selections for the selective desat on the background. Was the desaturation really necessary? I think it might have been just as good an image without the extra processing.</td>', 'Nice focus, exposure and composition. However, I can see some halo-ing around the edges of the wings where you must have done the selections for the selective desat on the background. Was the desaturation really necessary? I think it might have been just as good an image without the extra processing.', '2007-01-24 04:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274187, 448506, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed image. Colours look a bit over-processed maybe, but in a sense that adds to the magical atmosphere of the image. There is just so much to look are here - it''s like the river leads you into a whole new world.</td>', 'Beautifully detailed image. Colours look a bit over-processed maybe, but in a sense that adds to the magical atmosphere of the image. There is just so much to look are here - it''s like the river leads you into a whole new world.', '2007-01-24 04:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274189, 451402, 46314, '<td valign="top">Bokeh in the background is a bit distracting, as is the little log? in the foreground.</td>', 'Bokeh in the background is a bit distracting, as is the little log? in the foreground.', '2007-01-24 04:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274190, 451643, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well captured silhouette. Good sharp lines.</td>', 'Well captured silhouette. Good sharp lines.', '2007-01-24 04:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274194, 449845, 46314, '<td valign="top">The image doesn''t work as a silhouette, because there is all that water in the foreground. Would have been much better if you cropped from halfway up.</td>', 'The image doesn''t work as a silhouette, because there is all that water in the foreground. Would have been much better if you cropped from halfway up.', '2007-01-24 04:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274197, 448385, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s going on here, but the colours are interesting.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s going on here, but the colours are interesting.', '2007-01-24 04:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274202, 451268, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. The colour of the tree is really radiant, and it contrast the blue in the sky nicely.</td>', 'Lovely capture. The colour of the tree is really radiant, and it contrast the blue in the sky nicely.', '2007-01-24 05:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274204, 451828, 46314, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours, and good focus. Composition lacks ''wow'' factor though.</td>', 'Pretty colours, and good focus. Composition lacks ''wow'' factor though.', '2007-01-24 05:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274210, 451366, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. Really packs a punch in terms of visual impact. Looks a bit oversharpened, but maybe that''s just my imagination, or as a result of the strong tonal contrast in the image.</td>', 'Lovely colours. Really packs a punch in terms of visual impact. Looks a bit oversharpened, but maybe that''s just my imagination, or as a result of the strong tonal contrast in the image.', '2007-01-24 05:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274218, 450465, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing - looks almost unreal, as well as antiquated. Nice tones, and the emotion of the image really comes through well. Good image.</td>', 'Interesting processing - looks almost unreal, as well as antiquated. Nice tones, and the emotion of the image really comes through well. Good image.', '2007-01-24 05:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274220, 451754, 46314, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very pretty pond. Nicely taken.</td>', 'Looks like a very pretty pond. Nicely taken.', '2007-01-24 05:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274223, 448260, 46314, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and colours. Strong compostion. My only complaint is that the skin looks a bit plasticky. Is it really that flawless (at 5 I guess it could be), or is there some NeatImage there? Still, good work.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and colours. Strong compostion. My only complaint is that the skin looks a bit plasticky. Is it really that flawless (at 5 I guess it could be), or is there some NeatImage there? Still, good work.', '2007-01-24 05:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274227, 448781, 46314, '<td valign="top">Amazing bands of colour running through this photo. The patterns on that sand are surreal. It almost looks like a digitally created image, rather than a real one. Very well processed.</td>', 'Amazing bands of colour running through this photo. The patterns on that sand are surreal. It almost looks like a digitally created image, rather than a real one. Very well processed.', '2007-01-24 05:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274234, 451500, 46314, '<td valign="top">The colour of that water is incredible. Composition seems to be lacking a bit though, and the blown out sky is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The colour of that water is incredible. Composition seems to be lacking a bit though, and the blown out sky is a bit distracting.', '2007-01-24 05:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274238, 451192, 46314, '<td valign="top">Blue and white always makes for a nice colour contrast. Not sure I like the composition though. Nothing is really attracting my attention apart from the bushes in the right foreground that are a little distracting.</td>', 'Blue and white always makes for a nice colour contrast. Not sure I like the composition though. Nothing is really attracting my attention apart from the bushes in the right foreground that are a little distracting.', '2007-01-24 05:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274249, 451923, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, and you captured his face well. The cup in his hand still attracts the eye though (maybe because it is central and white), but when you look there, the cup is all smudgy and weird-looking. It''s not terrible, just a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the scene, and you captured his face well. The cup in his hand still attracts the eye though (maybe because it is central and white), but when you look there, the cup is all smudgy and weird-looking. It''s not terrible, just a bit distracting.', '2007-01-24 05:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274256, 451346, 46314, '<td valign="top">Love the skeleton-like image that the lights and their reflection make. The colour cast makes the picture feel a bit murky though - maybe you could have balanced it a bit more towards the blue side?</td>', 'Love the skeleton-like image that the lights and their reflection make. The colour cast makes the picture feel a bit murky though - maybe you could have balanced it a bit more towards the blue side?', '2007-01-24 05:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274260, 447565, 46314, '<td valign="top">The face looks far more processed than the rest of the image. That certainly draws attention to it - it''s a good pose and expression. But the rest of the image seems too flat. Although I like the choice of outfit and the couch. Has a retro feel.</td>', 'The face looks far more processed than the rest of the image. That certainly draws attention to it - it''s a good pose and expression. But the rest of the image seems too flat. Although I like the choice of outfit and the couch. Has a retro feel.', '2007-01-24 05:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274266, 451944, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Gives you some room to look around and explore it. Nice photography.</td>', 'Interesting image. Gives you some room to look around and explore it. Nice photography.', '2007-01-24 05:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274272, 451354, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well frozen action.</td>', 'Well frozen action.', '2007-01-24 05:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274276, 450531, 46314, '<td valign="top">Out of focus (or camera-shake in the low lighting?). Other than that, nice idea.</td>', 'Out of focus (or camera-shake in the low lighting?). Other than that, nice idea.', '2007-01-24 05:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274280, 448539, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the way the fumes cut out the background and turn this into an almost minimalist composition.</td>', 'I love the way the fumes cut out the background and turn this into an almost minimalist composition.', '2007-01-24 05:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274288, 451218, 46314, '<td valign="top">There is a bit of odd halo-ing on the left: maybe fringing from the camera lens? maybe overprocessed? It just takes a little of the sharpness away from what is otherwise a really nicely captured silhouette - quite a striking image.</td>', 'There is a bit of odd halo-ing on the left: maybe fringing from the camera lens? maybe overprocessed? It just takes a little of the sharpness away from what is otherwise a really nicely captured silhouette - quite a striking image.', '2007-01-24 05:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274295, 447874, 46314, '<td valign="top">Was he dressed up for a play? Either way, nice image. Love how you captured all the details. Well done.</td>', 'Was he dressed up for a play? Either way, nice image. Love how you captured all the details. Well done.', '2007-01-24 05:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274298, 451063, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, and good lighting.</td>', 'Nice pose, and good lighting.', '2007-01-24 05:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274304, 451341, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Really depicts vast space. I like how the light blue water mirror, with small wave crests, mirrors the sky and clouds. I''m think Iceland?</td>', 'Great capture. Really depicts vast space. I like how the light blue water mirror, with small wave crests, mirrors the sky and clouds. I''m think Iceland?', '2007-01-24 05:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274310, 450539, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Not sure if the expression on his face matches the action, but there is something about it that makes you want to know more.</td>', 'Interesting image. Not sure if the expression on his face matches the action, but there is something about it that makes you want to know more.', '2007-01-24 05:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274312, 450749, 46314, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject for infrared. Awesome capture. Very well composed, and the tones are excellent. Crisp sharpness works brilliantly for the texture of the barn and trees.</td>', 'Excellent subject for infrared. Awesome capture. Very well composed, and the tones are excellent. Crisp sharpness works brilliantly for the texture of the barn and trees.', '2007-01-24 05:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274314, 447491, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Maybe a slightly wider DOF to get the nose in focus too.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Maybe a slightly wider DOF to get the nose in focus too.', '2007-01-24 05:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274316, 447804, 46314, '<td valign="top">Soft-focus is very wedding-y - fits the image. Background is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Soft-focus is very wedding-y - fits the image. Background is a bit distracting though.', '2007-01-24 05:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274318, 447566, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of motion here. If the dancer himself had been sharper, it would have been a very powerful image.</td>', 'Nice sense of motion here. If the dancer himself had been sharper, it would have been a very powerful image.', '2007-01-24 05:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274320, 450240, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Pity the couple at the bottom aren''t a bit more emphasised (like if the backlighting had been stronger. That would have made for a very balanced composition.</td>', 'Nice image. Pity the couple at the bottom aren''t a bit more emphasised (like if the backlighting had been stronger. That would have made for a very balanced composition.', '2007-01-24 05:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274353, 449939, 43215, '<td valign="top">bautyful picture!! very strong!</td>', 'bautyful picture!! very strong!', '2007-01-24 05:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274599, 449543, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the pose but I''m not too sure about the smudging in the hair and on the body.</td>', 'I like the pose but I''m not too sure about the smudging in the hair and on the body.', '2007-01-24 07:49:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3274605, 451808, 72714, '<td valign="top">An absolutely beautiful photograph. You have captured the pure wonderment in her face perfectly. I also like the way the brightness of the flowers is balanced by the bows in her hair and the outfit.</td>', 'An absolutely beautiful photograph. You have captured the pure wonderment in her face perfectly. I also like the way the brightness of the flowers is balanced by the bows in her hair and the outfit.', '2007-01-24 07:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274607, 449657, 72714, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo but I feel the colour saturation is slightly ''unreal'' and a catchlight created by fill in flash would have brightened the eye a little.</td>', 'A lovely photo but I feel the colour saturation is slightly ''unreal'' and a catchlight created by fill in flash would have brightened the eye a little.', '2007-01-24 07:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274637, 449494, 72714, '<td valign="top">Glad I wasn''t behind this camera!</td>', 'Glad I wasn''t behind this camera!', '2007-01-24 08:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274643, 451050, 72714, '<td valign="top">The holidays are over! Nice mood!</td>', 'The holidays are over! Nice mood!', '2007-01-24 08:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274660, 451159, 72714, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I would lose the watch though.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I would lose the watch though.', '2007-01-24 08:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274665, 451651, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. Would be interesting to see the eyes slightly more subtle in a rich yellow or orange.</td>', 'Lovely picture. Would be interesting to see the eyes slightly more subtle in a rich yellow or orange.', '2007-01-24 08:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274672, 451776, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of landscape format as allows the owl space to gaze into. Nice soft background.</td>', 'I like the choice of landscape format as allows the owl space to gaze into. Nice soft background.', '2007-01-24 08:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274676, 448973, 72714, '<td valign="top">I might need glasses, but the picture seems a bit soft?</td>', 'I might need glasses, but the picture seems a bit soft?', '2007-01-24 08:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274685, 447508, 72714, '<td valign="top">A haunting picture! Personally, I would have liked to see more of the picture to see the purpose of the rope. Is it a swing across a river?</td>', 'A haunting picture! Personally, I would have liked to see more of the picture to see the purpose of the rope. Is it a swing across a river?', '2007-01-24 08:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274688, 448163, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the textures and lighting!</td>', 'I love the textures and lighting!', '2007-01-24 08:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274692, 447661, 72714, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh! Didn''t notice the ''bug'' staring at me at first!</td>', 'Oh my gosh! Didn''t notice the ''bug'' staring at me at first!', '2007-01-24 08:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274713, 451868, 72714, '<td valign="top">If this was my horse, I would be proud to own this portrait!</td>', 'If this was my horse, I would be proud to own this portrait!', '2007-01-24 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274721, 451228, 72714, '<td valign="top">A good action shot! The expression on his face must have been good! Pity we can''t see it!</td>', 'A good action shot! The expression on his face must have been good! Pity we can''t see it!', '2007-01-24 08:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274722, 450699, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like your creativity in this picture. The backround looks really good to!</td>', 'I like your creativity in this picture. The backround looks really good to!', '2007-01-24 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274723, 451416, 72581, '<td valign="top">i like your focus on the two up front and the blurred backround.</td>', 'i like your focus on the two up front and the blurred backround.', '2007-01-24 08:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274726, 451367, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white. I don''t like the shadows on the person''s face though.</td>', 'I like the black and white. I don''t like the shadows on the person''s face though.', '2007-01-24 08:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274729, 449870, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the level of the horizon but would have moved the boat slightly to the left or right instead of dead centre.</td>', 'I like the level of the horizon but would have moved the boat slightly to the left or right instead of dead centre.', '2007-01-24 08:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274731, 447860, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like thsi photo, but I don''t see the importance of the horse. I also think it should be in color.</td>', 'I like thsi photo, but I don''t see the importance of the horse. I also think it should be in color.', '2007-01-24 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274736, 451813, 72581, '<td valign="top">I love how this pic is in black and white. You can see the trees well and the sunlight gives a nice touch.</td>', 'I love how this pic is in black and white. You can see the trees well and the sunlight gives a nice touch.', '2007-01-24 08:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274739, 451651, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like the owl and the way the eyes are red.</td>', 'I like the owl and the way the eyes are red.', '2007-01-24 08:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274741, 450208, 72714, '<td valign="top">What about making only the two ''chilling out'' guys in colour and converting the fella with the long hair to b&amp;w? I enjoy the way everyone else seems to be rushing around!</td>', 'What about making only the two ''chilling out'' guys in colour and converting the fella with the long hair to b&w? I enjoy the way everyone else seems to be rushing around!', '2007-01-24 08:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274748, 447878, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like the eyes.</td>', 'I like the eyes.', '2007-01-24 08:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274753, 447620, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred backround and the focus on the ducks face.</td>', 'I like the blurred backround and the focus on the ducks face.', '2007-01-24 08:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
