(3277201, 451154, 30422, '<td valign="top">The house is overlit and the foreground is underlit.  Try having more ambient light for this kind of shot.</td>', 'The house is overlit and the foreground is underlit.  Try having more ambient light for this kind of shot.', '2007-01-24 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277203, 447683, 19708, '<td valign="top">A superb view with an amazing sky! The post-processing here is just a tad over the top for my tastes, but did give it a surrealistic look, rather than reality. Still a gorgeous shot!</td>', 'A superb view with an amazing sky! The post-processing here is just a tad over the top for my tastes, but did give it a surrealistic look, rather than reality. Still a gorgeous shot!', '2007-01-24 19:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277208, 451711, 22459, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture with great lighting, well done</td>', 'Beautiful picture with great lighting, well done', '2007-01-24 19:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277216, 451086, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view here, and is certainly a place I could envision as calming, quiet and a great stress-reducer.<br/>There is something that just seems a bit odd on this, and though the waterline is level, it almost feels like the shot as a whole needs a very minor CCW rotation or something, and is probably due to the angle of the left side throwing off my perceived horizon.</td>', 'I like the point of view here, and is certainly a place I could envision as calming, quiet and a great stress-reducer.There is something that just seems a bit odd on this, and though the waterline is level, it almost feels like the shot as a whole needs a very minor CCW rotation or something, and is probably due to the angle of the left side throwing off my perceived horizon.', '2007-01-24 19:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277222, 447773, 19708, '<td valign="top">Truly majstic animals with a pose to match.<br/>The eyes seem just a touch dark, but maybe that''s just me.<br/><i>(their eyes, not my eyes - mine aren''t dark)</i> :)</td>', 'Truly majstic animals with a pose to match.The eyes seem just a touch dark, but maybe that''s just me.(their eyes, not my eyes - mine aren''t dark) :)', '2007-01-24 19:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277229, 451595, 46663, '<td valign="top">Great photograph - what a story it tells.  Well composed.</td>', 'Great photograph - what a story it tells.  Well composed.', '2007-01-24 19:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277236, 448525, 46663, '<td valign="top">Stunning! The smooth textures of the water compared to the rough textures of the sky combined with the stark beauty of this place makes this a top 5 in this challenge for me.</td>', 'Stunning! The smooth textures of the water compared to the rough textures of the sky combined with the stark beauty of this place makes this a top 5 in this challenge for me.', '2007-01-24 19:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277239, 451359, 19708, '<td valign="top">A deeper, richer green would really make this change in richness.<br/>Easy way to make the grass greener, is to make a new layer via copy, then in the Hue/Saturation adjustments, go to the Yellow, slide the Hue to the right a bit, maybe 10%, increase teh saturation a touch, and drop the lightness down a bit. That will effectively change the yellowish grass to a richer green. Use your eraser tool carefully and erase back any areas you didn''t want changed, such as the yellows that are in the horse''s colors, then flatten the image.<br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'A deeper, richer green would really make this change in richness.Easy way to make the grass greener, is to make a new layer via copy, then in the Hue/Saturation adjustments, go to the Yellow, slide the Hue to the right a bit, maybe 10%, increase teh saturation a touch, and drop the lightness down a bit. That will effectively change the yellowish grass to a richer green. Use your eraser tool carefully and erase back any areas you didn''t want changed, such as the yellows that are in the horse''s colors, then flatten the image.Hope this helps.', '2007-01-24 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277242, 449657, 46663, '<td valign="top">I love these birds - so similar to the kingfishers in South Africa.  Well composed photograph with perfect DOF.</td>', 'I love these birds - so similar to the kingfishers in South Africa.  Well composed photograph with perfect DOF.', '2007-01-24 19:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277247, 449364, 46663, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph - the calmness of the water combined with the colors and the anticipation of your title makes this a top 5 in this challenge for me.</td>', 'Stunning photograph - the calmness of the water combined with the colors and the anticipation of your title makes this a top 5 in this challenge for me.', '2007-01-24 19:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277248, 451471, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and moment preserved here.<br/>I can''t help but to think a slight CCW rotation to make the waterline level would help this overall.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and moment preserved here.I can''t help but to think a slight CCW rotation to make the waterline level would help this overall.', '2007-01-24 19:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277253, 448668, 46663, '<td valign="top">excellent photograph - great use of thirds, color, contrast and interest.</td>', 'excellent photograph - great use of thirds, color, contrast and interest.', '2007-01-24 19:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
