(3277593, 449467, 71644, '<td valign="top">Toots doing what he does best.  Great photo of a great man.</td>', 'Toots doing what he does best.  Great photo of a great man.', '2007-01-24 21:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277625, 447754, 15204, '<td valign="top">The coolest composition for a close-up cat shot I have ever seen.  Really nice.  I like the way his gaze leads out of the corner of the frame, too.  Like he is stalking something, as cats do.  I know it is a personal preference, but I feel like this is a little underexposed and flat.  The white fur is just lightier than middle gray.  A curves adjustment could really make this sing!  Still a 7 from me.</td>', 'The coolest composition for a close-up cat shot I have ever seen.  Really nice.  I like the way his gaze leads out of the corner of the frame, too.  Like he is stalking something, as cats do.  I know it is a personal preference, but I feel like this is a little underexposed and flat.  The white fur is just lightier than middle gray.  A curves adjustment could really make this sing!  Still a 7 from me.', '2007-01-24 21:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277636, 451450, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the square crop for this.  It is different and works very well.  Nice colors.  I like all the diagonal lines, including the implied lines made by the clouds.  Cool shot. 7 from me.</td>', 'I like the square crop for this.  It is different and works very well.  Nice colors.  I like all the diagonal lines, including the implied lines made by the clouds.  Cool shot. 7 from me.', '2007-01-24 21:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3277639, 449001, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with that extra bird way down at the bottom.  It is kind of quirky and I think it really makes the shot.  Very nicely seen.  7 from me.</td>', 'I like the composition with that extra bird way down at the bottom.  It is kind of quirky and I think it really makes the shot.  Very nicely seen.  7 from me.', '2007-01-24 21:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
