(3278060, 450801, 23394, '<td valign="top">i know this moment holds a special place for you, and having been a member here for a while, i also know this will probably wind up near the bottom--that''s just the way things are around here.  just don''t take it personally.  this is a great place to learn, grow, and push yourself, as long as you have thick enough skin and some desire.<br/> <br/>for all intents and purposes, this is a snapshot, as opposed to something you set out to capture.  you were good to keen in on the moment, but there are many things that you could do to go from grabbing cute snapshots to capturing great images of your children.</td>', 'i know this moment holds a special place for you, and having been a member here for a while, i also know this will probably wind up near the bottom--that''s just the way things are around here.  just don''t take it personally.  this is a great place to learn, grow, and push yourself, as long as you have thick enough skin and some desire. for all intents and purposes, this is a snapshot, as opposed to something you set out to capture.  you were good to keen in on the moment, but there are many things that you could do to go from grabbing cute snapshots to capturing great images of your children.', '2007-01-24 22:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
