(3278066, 451157, 23394, '<td valign="top">that''s a nice enough photo, and i love the colors, but am also curious as to how this photo stood out to you as the best image you made all year.</td>', 'that''s a nice enough photo, and i love the colors, but am also curious as to how this photo stood out to you as the best image you made all year.', '2007-01-24 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
