(3278091, 448888, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m a fan of this type of shot, and love trying for them.  i think this would have been much stronger if you had found a perspective that really showed your subject as being alone.</td>', 'i''m a fan of this type of shot, and love trying for them.  i think this would have been much stronger if you had found a perspective that really showed your subject as being alone.', '2007-01-24 22:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
