(3278094, 451952, 23394, '<td valign="top">a shot like this just begs to be sharper.  it also seems to be slightly over-exposed.  for a challenge such as this, it also leaves me wondering what made this stand out to you as your best image of the year...</td>', 'a shot like this just begs to be sharper.  it also seems to be slightly over-exposed.  for a challenge such as this, it also leaves me wondering what made this stand out to you as your best image of the year...', '2007-01-24 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
