(3278105, 450148, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is nice enough, but there''s something about the pose and the lighting on her hand that throws the image out of balance, at least for me.  the lack of expression also leaves me feeling a lack of emotion, as well.</td>', 'this is nice enough, but there''s something about the pose and the lighting on her hand that throws the image out of balance, at least for me.  the lack of expression also leaves me feeling a lack of emotion, as well.', '2007-01-24 22:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
