(3278275, 447855, 23394, '<td valign="top">yeah, that''s against the law.  you shoulda had your camera confiscated.</td>', 'yeah, that''s against the law.  you shoulda had your camera confiscated.', '2007-01-24 22:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278276, 447958, 23394, '<td valign="top">simply intoxicating.  i could stay here for a while.</td>', 'simply intoxicating.  i could stay here for a while.', '2007-01-24 22:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278277, 447625, 23394, '<td valign="top">i dont'' know if you have any emotional attachment to this image, but it really comes across as a bad snapshot that could use some serious post-processing.  after the challenge, you might want to seek out some help in the forums just to see what solutions others might be able to come up with.  as it is, though, i imagine this will get rather hammered in the scoring.</td>', 'i dont'' know if you have any emotional attachment to this image, but it really comes across as a bad snapshot that could use some serious post-processing.  after the challenge, you might want to seek out some help in the forums just to see what solutions others might be able to come up with.  as it is, though, i imagine this will get rather hammered in the scoring.', '2007-01-24 22:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278279, 450208, 23394, '<td valign="top">i can go with the blue and yellow dudes, but leaving the pony-tail guy saturated doesn''t do anything for the photo.  that really kills an otherwise fine photo.</td>', 'i can go with the blue and yellow dudes, but leaving the pony-tail guy saturated doesn''t do anything for the photo.  that really kills an otherwise fine photo.', '2007-01-24 22:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278281, 451792, 23394, '<td valign="top">killer opportunity, great processing.  just wish the image had been of some interplay between the mother and child.  as is, she looks like she''s trying to let the wind blow the hair off her face.  not bad, but all the same, it leaves the image a hair below spectacular ;-)</td>', 'killer opportunity, great processing.  just wish the image had been of some interplay between the mother and child.  as is, she looks like she''s trying to let the wind blow the hair off her face.  not bad, but all the same, it leaves the image a hair below spectacular ;-)', '2007-01-24 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278282, 448175, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow!  love the dynamics you''ve captured here.  it must have cost a fortune, what you had to pay to get that sky ordered up and delivered ;-)</td>', 'wow!  love the dynamics you''ve captured here.  it must have cost a fortune, what you had to pay to get that sky ordered up and delivered ;-)', '2007-01-24 22:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278284, 447802, 23394, '<td valign="top">ay-yi-yi, i LOVE it.  this has an incredible hitchcock feel to it.  very, very nicely done.</td>', 'ay-yi-yi, i LOVE it.  this has an incredible hitchcock feel to it.  very, very nicely done.', '2007-01-24 22:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278287, 448149, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait.  gotta love the freckles.</td>', 'excellent portrait.  gotta love the freckles.', '2007-01-24 22:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278288, 448074, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is nice enough, but it doesn''t really grab me.  not really sure if i''m sold on the post-processing.  the hues just seem a bit unnatural.</td>', 'this is nice enough, but it doesn''t really grab me.  not really sure if i''m sold on the post-processing.  the hues just seem a bit unnatural.', '2007-01-24 22:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278290, 449171, 23394, '<td valign="top">absolutely blows me away, like light escaping from heaven.</td>', 'absolutely blows me away, like light escaping from heaven.', '2007-01-24 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278291, 451186, 23394, '<td valign="top">love the expression.  i''ll be this was fun to shoot.</td>', 'love the expression.  i''ll be this was fun to shoot.', '2007-01-24 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278292, 451701, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, but really seems to be more of a backdrop than anything else.  maybe you should offer it as a custom portrait backdrop...</td>', 'this is beautiful, but really seems to be more of a backdrop than anything else.  maybe you should offer it as a custom portrait backdrop...', '2007-01-24 22:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278294, 447624, 60047, '<td valign="top">The unique pose really shows off the model''s body.</td>', 'The unique pose really shows off the model''s body.', '2007-01-24 22:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278296, 451798, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow, that really captures the imagination!  very nice.</td>', 'wow, that really captures the imagination!  very nice.', '2007-01-24 22:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278297, 451063, 23394, '<td valign="top">how adorable!  this could possibly use a little more work, cropping wise; it seems a little unbalanced, losing part of the hat, part of the foot.</td>', 'how adorable!  this could possibly use a little more work, cropping wise; it seems a little unbalanced, losing part of the hat, part of the foot.', '2007-01-24 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278299, 447628, 23394, '<td valign="top">i imagine <a href="//www.taughannock.com/photos.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">they</a> would love to have your beautiful image in their collection.</td>', 'i imagine they would love to have your beautiful image in their collection.', '2007-01-24 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278300, 451132, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow!  what a composition.  i imagine your subject would be nice without the clouds, but then again, i guess this is the type of thing that made them invent the word ''serendipity''...</td>', 'wow!  what a composition.  i imagine your subject would be nice without the clouds, but then again, i guess this is the type of thing that made them invent the word ''serendipity''...', '2007-01-24 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278301, 451242, 58247, '<td valign="top">Great clarity! Very nice portrait. :-)</td>', 'Great clarity! Very nice portrait. :-)', '2007-01-24 22:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278302, 451524, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow - this shot just makes me laugh out loud!  =)</td>', 'Wow - this shot just makes me laugh out loud!  =)', '2007-01-24 22:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278303, 449596, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  would love to see what other mischief the truants who broke the ice are up to.</td>', 'interesting image.  would love to see what other mischief the truants who broke the ice are up to.', '2007-01-24 22:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278305, 450713, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough, but lacking anything to really keep my interest.  this is why we have tripods and timers--so we can add ourselves to photos when we''re presented with this incredible opportunities ;-)</td>', 'nice enough, but lacking anything to really keep my interest.  this is why we have tripods and timers--so we can add ourselves to photos when we''re presented with this incredible opportunities ;-)', '2007-01-24 22:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278306, 450654, 23394, '<td valign="top">i guess this means something to you, but it really does nothing for me.</td>', 'i guess this means something to you, but it really does nothing for me.', '2007-01-24 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278307, 451897, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  very nicely observed.</td>', 'beautiful.  very nicely observed.', '2007-01-24 22:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278308, 451441, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nice work.  is that why you took the photo, or is it something you found afterwards...</td>', 'very nice work.  is that why you took the photo, or is it something you found afterwards...', '2007-01-24 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278309, 448924, 23394, '<td valign="top">incredible.</td>', 'incredible.', '2007-01-24 22:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278310, 451955, 23394, '<td valign="top">exquisite.  too bad there''s no context to give us an idea as to how vast this really is.</td>', 'exquisite.  too bad there''s no context to give us an idea as to how vast this really is.', '2007-01-24 22:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278311, 451311, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2007-01-24 22:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278313, 447740, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful concept and composition.', '2007-01-24 22:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278314, 447848, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  i''m sure you had fun with this ;-)</td>', 'nice portrait.  i''m sure you had fun with this ;-)', '2007-01-24 22:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278315, 451924, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you have a baby and you have a camera.  good to get them acquainted at an early age.  now, what you really need to do is spend time looking at all the baby photos you can, picking out the ones you really like, then spend some time trying to mimic them.</td>', 'ok, you have a baby and you have a camera.  good to get them acquainted at an early age.  now, what you really need to do is spend time looking at all the baby photos you can, picking out the ones you really like, then spend some time trying to mimic them.', '2007-01-24 22:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278316, 450774, 23394, '<td valign="top">the thing that bothers me about this image is the it seems to be trying to do too much.  to me, there should be a LOT more chaotic water splashing to balance out her "i can''t believe i''m here" expression.  or, the shutter should have been slowed to let the water dramatically wash over and around her.  as is, the image seems to be in limbo.</td>', 'the thing that bothers me about this image is the it seems to be trying to do too much.  to me, there should be a LOT more chaotic water splashing to balance out her "i can''t believe i''m here" expression.  or, the shutter should have been slowed to let the water dramatically wash over and around her.  as is, the image seems to be in limbo.', '2007-01-24 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278317, 448095, 23394, '<td valign="top">simply wonderful.  excellent observation.</td>', 'simply wonderful.  excellent observation.', '2007-01-24 22:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278319, 448765, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry, but this does nothing but make me wonder what else you did with your camera last year...</td>', 'i''m sorry, but this does nothing but make me wonder what else you did with your camera last year...', '2007-01-24 22:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278320, 451079, 23394, '<td valign="top">rather marvelous, i must say, a visual treat.  it''s really a shame you didn''t take the time to heal out all the sensor spots--they are fairly noticeable...</td>', 'rather marvelous, i must say, a visual treat.  it''s really a shame you didn''t take the time to heal out all the sensor spots--they are fairly noticeable...', '2007-01-24 22:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278322, 451925, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work, perfectly processed.</td>', 'excellent work, perfectly processed.', '2007-01-24 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278323, 448116, 23394, '<td valign="top">spot on.  love the treatment.</td>', 'spot on.  love the treatment.', '2007-01-24 22:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278324, 451694, 23394, '<td valign="top">as simply beautiful as this is, the last thing it needed was that border.  other than that, nice work.</td>', 'as simply beautiful as this is, the last thing it needed was that border.  other than that, nice work.', '2007-01-24 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278325, 449001, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely observed.</td>', 'nicely observed.', '2007-01-24 22:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278326, 451291, 23394, '<td valign="top">good golly, i can hear her all the way over here.  nicely done.</td>', 'good golly, i can hear her all the way over here.  nicely done.', '2007-01-24 22:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278327, 448766, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough, but the processing leaves it feeling somewhat artificial.  you might consider trying a bw conversion.</td>', 'nice enough, but the processing leaves it feeling somewhat artificial.  you might consider trying a bw conversion.', '2007-01-24 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278330, 447492, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely done.</td>', 'nicely done.', '2007-01-24 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278331, 447508, 60047, '<td valign="top">Oh, man, what captivating eyes! Fascinating shot.</td>', 'Oh, man, what captivating eyes! Fascinating shot.', '2007-01-24 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278333, 451159, 23394, '<td valign="top">how peaceful.  and in 9 short years, somebody will be pulling their hair out every afternoon, trying to get homework finished...</td>', 'how peaceful.  and in 9 short years, somebody will be pulling their hair out every afternoon, trying to get homework finished...', '2007-01-24 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278335, 451951, 23394, '<td valign="top">that is simply gorgeous.  bet it would look real nice printed large.</td>', 'that is simply gorgeous.  bet it would look real nice printed large.', '2007-01-24 22:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278337, 451956, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m really not sure what to make of this.  the hints of over-processing are such that i really can''t tell whether the whiterock is a whiterock, or over-exposed.  and, when the processing forces me to key in on the technicals aspects of an image, i start to lose whatever connection i was trying to establish with it...</td>', 'i''m really not sure what to make of this.  the hints of over-processing are such that i really can''t tell whether the whiterock is a whiterock, or over-exposed.  and, when the processing forces me to key in on the technicals aspects of an image, i start to lose whatever connection i was trying to establish with it...', '2007-01-24 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278338, 451752, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough image, but doesn''t really come across to me as a photograph, but instead more of a piece of art.  looks like it might make a nice book jacket, though.</td>', 'nice enough image, but doesn''t really come across to me as a photograph, but instead more of a piece of art.  looks like it might make a nice book jacket, though.', '2007-01-24 22:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278339, 449494, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely observed.</td>', 'nicely observed.', '2007-01-24 22:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278340, 451447, 23394, '<td valign="top">spot on!  amazing what can be done when equipment, experience, and opportunity come together ;-)</td>', 'spot on!  amazing what can be done when equipment, experience, and opportunity come together ;-)', '2007-01-24 22:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278341, 451828, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough image, especially tough to expose given the strong light and the heavy shadows.  i''m curious as to what made this stand out to you as your best image of the year...</td>', 'nice enough image, especially tough to expose given the strong light and the heavy shadows.  i''m curious as to what made this stand out to you as your best image of the year...', '2007-01-24 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3278342, 447670, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, perfect dof.</td>', 'lovely colors, perfect dof.', '2007-01-24 22:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278343, 449473, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow - fascinating and engaging photo!  Great capture!</td>', 'Wow - fascinating and engaging photo!  Great capture!', '2007-01-24 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278344, 450086, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  thanks for not over-processing this past the point of enjoyment.</td>', 'nicely done.  thanks for not over-processing this past the point of enjoyment.', '2007-01-24 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278345, 449488, 23394, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful.  i could get lost in this.  the processing is just right, not too much, not too little.</td>', 'absolutely beautiful.  i could get lost in this.  the processing is just right, not too much, not too little.', '2007-01-24 22:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278346, 451104, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nicely done.  love the crop, love the treatment.  very interesting and intriguing.</td>', 'very nicely done.  love the crop, love the treatment.  very interesting and intriguing.', '2007-01-24 22:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278347, 451535, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely done.</td>', 'nicely done.', '2007-01-24 22:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278348, 448180, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  you know, you could have cloned off her...oh, well.  beautiful colors; i''m sure this will do well in a stock library.</td>', 'nicely done.  you know, you could have cloned off her...oh, well.  beautiful colors; i''m sure this will do well in a stock library.', '2007-01-24 22:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278349, 451569, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, this doesn''t do too much for me.</td>', 'sorry, this doesn''t do too much for me.', '2007-01-24 22:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278350, 449116, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wonderful hair color.</td>', 'Wonderful hair color.', '2007-01-24 22:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278351, 449549, 23394, '<td valign="top">i can hear the screaming in the wind.  nicely captured.</td>', 'i can hear the screaming in the wind.  nicely captured.', '2007-01-24 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278353, 451844, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent capture, nicely processed.  love the range of tones.</td>', 'excellent capture, nicely processed.  love the range of tones.', '2007-01-24 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278354, 449035, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting processing on this; gives it a rather unique feel.</td>', 'interesting processing on this; gives it a rather unique feel.', '2007-01-24 22:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278355, 449182, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful vista, for sure, but nothing really keeps me.</td>', 'beautiful vista, for sure, but nothing really keeps me.', '2007-01-24 22:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278357, 451111, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice subject, but this capture doesn''t do much for me.  the eyes don''t seem real, and the fur gets lost in the muted background.</td>', 'nice subject, but this capture doesn''t do much for me.  the eyes don''t seem real, and the fur gets lost in the muted background.', '2007-01-24 22:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278359, 450003, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a cute shot!  Great b/w.</td>', 'Wow!  What a cute shot!  Great b/w.', '2007-01-24 22:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278360, 451864, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent.  feels like a jpr.</td>', 'excellent.  feels like a jpr.', '2007-01-24 22:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278361, 451702, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, this is a nice stock image, but i''m somewhat dumbfounded that you would consider this to represent your best shot of the year.</td>', 'ok, this is a nice stock image, but i''m somewhat dumbfounded that you would consider this to represent your best shot of the year.', '2007-01-24 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278362, 451309, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough, but doesn''t do much more for me than make me wonder what it is that made this image stand out to you as your best of the year.</td>', 'nice enough, but doesn''t do much more for me than make me wonder what it is that made this image stand out to you as your best of the year.', '2007-01-24 22:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278363, 449102, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nicely observed.  hope its subtlety isn''t wasted on this crowd.</td>', 'very nicely observed.  hope its subtlety isn''t wasted on this crowd.', '2007-01-24 22:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278364, 450293, 23394, '<td valign="top">i have an idea as to what you''re after, but, all in all, am not quite getting there.</td>', 'i have an idea as to what you''re after, but, all in all, am not quite getting there.', '2007-01-24 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278367, 450666, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice subject, nice perspective, poor exposure.  just too much light.</td>', 'nice subject, nice perspective, poor exposure.  just too much light.', '2007-01-24 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278368, 451537, 23394, '<td valign="top">now that''s a postcard worth writing home about.  very nice shot.</td>', 'now that''s a postcard worth writing home about.  very nice shot.', '2007-01-24 22:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278369, 451838, 7485, '<td valign="top">An intriguing image! The colors work very well together. Only thing I''m not so sure about is the postprocessing, looks too much like an effect trying to imitate a painting. But still an 8 from me.</td>', 'An intriguing image! The colors work very well together. Only thing I''m not so sure about is the postprocessing, looks too much like an effect trying to imitate a painting. But still an 8 from me.', '2007-01-24 22:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278370, 450198, 23394, '<td valign="top">i dunno...if it''s not the processing, it must be your camera settings; in any event, it just doesn''t seem natural.</td>', 'i dunno...if it''s not the processing, it must be your camera settings; in any event, it just doesn''t seem natural.', '2007-01-24 22:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278371, 447552, 811, '<td valign="top">Perfect!!!</td>', 'Perfect!!!', '2007-01-24 22:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278372, 451365, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice observation, except that it makes my neck hurt ;-)  love the colors.  nice job with a tough exposure, as well.</td>', 'nice observation, except that it makes my neck hurt ;-)  love the colors.  nice job with a tough exposure, as well.', '2007-01-24 22:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278373, 447667, 23394, '<td valign="top">the colors and treatment of the sky make this a bit more interesting than it really seems to be.  i don''t imagine too many people would think of a photo of the front of a hotel as being representative of their best work of the year, but then again, it''s all subjective, isn''t it ;-)</td>', 'the colors and treatment of the sky make this a bit more interesting than it really seems to be.  i don''t imagine too many people would think of a photo of the front of a hotel as being representative of their best work of the year, but then again, it''s all subjective, isn''t it ;-)', '2007-01-24 22:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278374, 450741, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but in my opinion, you''ve ruined a perfectly beautiful photograph with your processing.  i imagine this may be gushed over by some, but for me, this is what i would expect to see printed on velvet, being sold in a rural flea market...and i don''t think it really needs to be that way.  the composition and capture are excellent.  oh well, to each their own.</td>', 'sorry, but in my opinion, you''ve ruined a perfectly beautiful photograph with your processing.  i imagine this may be gushed over by some, but for me, this is what i would expect to see printed on velvet, being sold in a rural flea market...and i don''t think it really needs to be that way.  the composition and capture are excellent.  oh well, to each their own.', '2007-01-24 22:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278376, 449765, 23394, '<td valign="top">i can only imagine the comments this one is generating, and probably not the ones you had in mind when you entered this.  those things are extremely dangerous, and are in fact the leading cause of trips to the ER over the 4th of july.  nice photo, anyways.</td>', 'i can only imagine the comments this one is generating, and probably not the ones you had in mind when you entered this.  those things are extremely dangerous, and are in fact the leading cause of trips to the ER over the 4th of july.  nice photo, anyways.', '2007-01-24 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278377, 451906, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The reflection really adds some interest</td>', 'Very nice.  The reflection really adds some interest', '2007-01-24 22:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278379, 450975, 23394, '<td valign="top">i guess your alternate title was ''blue sky'' ;-)  nicely observed, even though it''s probably a bit too subtle for most of this crowd.  i wonder how many viewers actually notice the skyline on the horizon...</td>', 'i guess your alternate title was ''blue sky'' ;-)  nicely observed, even though it''s probably a bit too subtle for most of this crowd.  i wonder how many viewers actually notice the skyline on the horizon...', '2007-01-24 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278380, 451918, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, but horribly mis-titled.  where are the surfers?  where are the waves?  nice work with the processing.</td>', 'beautiful image, but horribly mis-titled.  where are the surfers?  where are the waves?  nice work with the processing.', '2007-01-24 22:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278381, 451084, 23394, '<td valign="top">very compelling.  nice work, all the way around.</td>', 'very compelling.  nice work, all the way around.', '2007-01-24 22:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278382, 449236, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is just begging for sharpness.  these shots are tough, but stick with it, and you''ll get what you''re after.</td>', 'this is just begging for sharpness.  these shots are tough, but stick with it, and you''ll get what you''re after.', '2007-01-24 22:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278383, 448743, 23394, '<td valign="top">way cool.  just wish you''d gone for a deeper dof; just my personal taste, though.</td>', 'way cool.  just wish you''d gone for a deeper dof; just my personal taste, though.', '2007-01-24 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278384, 451445, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful enough, but not really over the top.</td>', 'beautiful enough, but not really over the top.', '2007-01-24 22:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
