(3278388, 450569, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, this is just too confusing.  i would have preferred you to either have shot a portrait or a landscape, but not try to cram both into one, especially when you''ve done such a nice bw conversion.  the desat leaves her looking very much pasted in.  the top of the photo, without her, is very strong, in and of itself.</td>', 'sorry, this is just too confusing.  i would have preferred you to either have shot a portrait or a landscape, but not try to cram both into one, especially when you''ve done such a nice bw conversion.  the desat leaves her looking very much pasted in.  the top of the photo, without her, is very strong, in and of itself.', '2007-01-24 22:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
