(3278419, 449446, 23394, '<td valign="top">if this was in my catalogue, i''d probably have had a tough time deciding on what to pull out for a challenge like this.  killer shot.  as i imagine most of what you keep is.</td>', 'if this was in my catalogue, i''d probably have had a tough time deciding on what to pull out for a challenge like this.  killer shot.  as i imagine most of what you keep is.', '2007-01-24 22:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278420, 450983, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautifully observed.  but, why, oh, WHY, didn''t you go on and crop out the lightpole on the right?  if you were worried about print ratio, you still had some room to crop, and you could have filled in with a black border.  or you could have simply cloned it out.  hold you hand up over it, and you''ll see what a difference it makes.  other than than, this is large print quality.  excellent shot.</td>', 'beautifully observed.  but, why, oh, WHY, didn''t you go on and crop out the lightpole on the right?  if you were worried about print ratio, you still had some room to crop, and you could have filled in with a black border.  or you could have simply cloned it out.  hold you hand up over it, and you''ll see what a difference it makes.  other than than, this is large print quality.  excellent shot.', '2007-01-24 22:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278421, 447961, 23394, '<td valign="top">this location is probably loaded with potential, but after looking at this, i can only wonder what it is that made it stand out to you as your best of the year...</td>', 'this location is probably loaded with potential, but after looking at this, i can only wonder what it is that made it stand out to you as your best of the year...', '2007-01-24 22:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278422, 450749, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of infrared.  It gives it a spooky, but intriguing feeling.  I like the composition as having the building in the left side of the frame gives the eyes a point of reference and makes the entire picture feel balanced.  The trees behind it breaks up the scenery nicely between the structure and the sky, adn the "incidentals" lying around help to give the shot some context.</td>', 'Very interesting use of infrared.  It gives it a spooky, but intriguing feeling.  I like the composition as having the building in the left side of the frame gives the eyes a point of reference and makes the entire picture feel balanced.  The trees behind it breaks up the scenery nicely between the structure and the sky, adn the "incidentals" lying around help to give the shot some context.', '2007-01-24 22:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278429, 451748, 29753, '<td valign="top">fantastic</td>', 'fantastic', '2007-01-24 22:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278431, 447681, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure on the lights.  They show detail without blowing anything or being distracting.  having the shore line be in the middle, though, makes it feel rather static.  If there was a clear reflection in the foreground, it wouldn''t be as noticeable, but since the reflections are "general" I think it would be more effective if there were less water in the foreground.</td>', 'Excellent exposure on the lights.  They show detail without blowing anything or being distracting.  having the shore line be in the middle, though, makes it feel rather static.  If there was a clear reflection in the foreground, it wouldn''t be as noticeable, but since the reflections are "general" I think it would be more effective if there were less water in the foreground.', '2007-01-24 22:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
