(3278665, 448910, 19708, '<td valign="top">:)<br/>Gotta'' love this. The missing tooth &amp; the "all-boy" natural grunge are perfect.</td>', ':)Gotta'' love this. The missing tooth & the "all-boy" natural grunge are perfect.', '2007-01-24 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278667, 450932, 48228, '<td valign="top">So soft and sweet...</td>', 'So soft and sweet...', '2007-01-24 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278668, 447960, 23394, '<td valign="top">i have a feeling as to what you were after, but something''s just not working for me.  the perspective and shallow dof lead me to look in one place, but all the similar colors keeps my eye hunting.  maybe if the subject was surrounded by complimentary colors, instead, or if only one particular flower stood out.  as is, this is, to me, anyways, visually chaotic.</td>', 'i have a feeling as to what you were after, but something''s just not working for me.  the perspective and shallow dof lead me to look in one place, but all the similar colors keeps my eye hunting.  maybe if the subject was surrounded by complimentary colors, instead, or if only one particular flower stood out.  as is, this is, to me, anyways, visually chaotic.', '2007-01-24 23:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278669, 449656, 23394, '<td valign="top">that''s a capture.  nicely done.</td>', 'that''s a capture.  nicely done.', '2007-01-24 23:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278670, 447824, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get what you''re after, but find the composition a bit haphazard, as if you couldn''t settle on where you really wanted to go with it.  it also leaves me curious as to why you settled on this to represent your best work of the year.</td>', 'i get what you''re after, but find the composition a bit haphazard, as if you couldn''t settle on where you really wanted to go with it.  it also leaves me curious as to why you settled on this to represent your best work of the year.', '2007-01-24 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278671, 449459, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice one here...</td>', 'Nice one here...', '2007-01-24 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278672, 451598, 19708, '<td valign="top">Holy Moly is that some contrast in colors!!<br/>Great detail and exposure on this.</td>', 'Holy Moly is that some contrast in colors!!Great detail and exposure on this.', '2007-01-24 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278673, 449980, 23394, '<td valign="top">very, very nice.  an excellent example of an image without a subject.  the balance of light and dark is perfect.</td>', 'very, very nice.  an excellent example of an image without a subject.  the balance of light and dark is perfect.', '2007-01-24 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278675, 451755, 44214, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo but it looks more like a wall to me than a path...</td>', 'Lovely photo but it looks more like a wall to me than a path...', '2007-01-24 23:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278676, 447683, 23394, '<td valign="top">extraordinary.  i can only imagine the time it took to process this.  reminds me of the type of landscape work ed clarke used to do.</td>', 'extraordinary.  i can only imagine the time it took to process this.  reminds me of the type of landscape work ed clarke used to do.', '2007-01-24 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278678, 451923, 48890, '<td valign="top">Kitschy, overprocessed, seen-it-a-million-times-before, Jowey.  I think you are on the wrong track. 4</td>', 'Kitschy, overprocessed, seen-it-a-million-times-before, Jowey.  I think you are on the wrong track. 4', '2007-01-24 23:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278680, 447561, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  imagine this would look good on a calendar.  too bad, though, that you couldn''t do anything about that horizon ;-)</td>', 'nicely done.  imagine this would look good on a calendar.  too bad, though, that you couldn''t do anything about that horizon ;-)', '2007-01-24 23:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278681, 451644, 23394, '<td valign="top">i would vote, but my momma told me not to look at it.</td>', 'i would vote, but my momma told me not to look at it.', '2007-01-24 23:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278683, 448028, 48228, '<td valign="top">Works for me...</td>', 'Works for me...', '2007-01-24 23:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278684, 448044, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough, but doesn''t really keep my interest.</td>', 'nice enough, but doesn''t really keep my interest.', '2007-01-24 23:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278685, 449472, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  i do hope when you are after things like this, that you take the time to explore more than just eye-level perspectives.  in some ways, the centeredness of this works, but i can''t help but wonder what this would have been like if you had shot from the floor, from the ceiling, from the side...<br/> <br/>all the same, nice work.</td>', 'nice idea.  i do hope when you are after things like this, that you take the time to explore more than just eye-level perspectives.  in some ways, the centeredness of this works, but i can''t help but wonder what this would have been like if you had shot from the floor, from the ceiling, from the side... all the same, nice work.', '2007-01-24 23:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278686, 451933, 48228, '<td valign="top">That close.....</td>', 'That close.....', '2007-01-24 23:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278687, 448572, 23394, '<td valign="top">very cute, right on the border between a great portrait and a good snapshot.  can''t really tell if the soft focus was intentional, or just the way it turned out.</td>', 'very cute, right on the border between a great portrait and a good snapshot.  can''t really tell if the soft focus was intentional, or just the way it turned out.', '2007-01-24 23:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278688, 447681, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful work.</td>', 'beautiful work.', '2007-01-24 23:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278689, 447553, 44214, '<td valign="top">A little bit too "busy" to be tranquil. A great photo nonetheless.</td>', 'A little bit too "busy" to be tranquil. A great photo nonetheless.', '2007-01-24 23:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278690, 450651, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough, but not enough here to really grab me.  too bad about that lens flare.</td>', 'nice enough, but not enough here to really grab me.  too bad about that lens flare.', '2007-01-24 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278691, 447860, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work, truly magazine quality.</td>', 'excellent work, truly magazine quality.', '2007-01-24 23:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278692, 451569, 48228, '<td valign="top">A little to strong for me...</td>', 'A little to strong for me...', '2007-01-24 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278693, 449271, 23394, '<td valign="top">this really grabs the imagination.  hope it doesn''t get overlooked in this super-sized challenge.  very, very nicely done.</td>', 'this really grabs the imagination.  hope it doesn''t get overlooked in this super-sized challenge.  very, very nicely done.', '2007-01-24 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278694, 448668, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  your vision makes the difference between a good photograph and a great one.</td>', 'beautiful.  your vision makes the difference between a good photograph and a great one.', '2007-01-24 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278695, 447620, 48228, '<td valign="top">So soft and so cute.....</td>', 'So soft and so cute.....', '2007-01-24 23:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278696, 451118, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but as you''ve doubtlessly heard from others, ''too small''...</td>', 'nice idea, but as you''ve doubtlessly heard from others, ''too small''...', '2007-01-24 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278697, 450531, 44214, '<td valign="top">Overall out of focus.</td>', 'Overall out of focus.', '2007-01-24 23:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278698, 448163, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image.  i can''t help but wondering, though, what you would have come up with if you had put the camera on a tripod or monopod and held it high above your head, but angled down just a bit.  it seems like those deeper shadows could be very interesting from a different perspective...</td>', 'beautiful image.  i can''t help but wondering, though, what you would have come up with if you had put the camera on a tripod or monopod and held it high above your head, but angled down just a bit.  it seems like those deeper shadows could be very interesting from a different perspective...', '2007-01-24 23:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278700, 450208, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the motion of the random passer-bys, but not sure the selective desaturation was best for this.<br/>I think had this been done in all black &amp; white, it would have had more impact.</td>', 'I like the motion of the random passer-bys, but not sure the selective desaturation was best for this.I think had this been done in all black & white, it would have had more impact.', '2007-01-24 23:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278701, 447984, 48228, '<td valign="top">Sweet.....very sweet.....</td>', 'Sweet.....very sweet.....', '2007-01-24 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278702, 451401, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks nice from a vacation-postcard perspective.  usually, these type images don''t keep my interest, but this one did.</td>', 'this looks nice from a vacation-postcard perspective.  usually, these type images don''t keep my interest, but this one did.', '2007-01-24 23:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278703, 451911, 23394, '<td valign="top">seems slightly oversaturated, but, all the same, an interesting perspective and composition in one of the most photographed cities in the world.</td>', 'seems slightly oversaturated, but, all the same, an interesting perspective and composition in one of the most photographed cities in the world.', '2007-01-24 23:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278704, 449996, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image.  can''t begin to imagine how extraordinary this would have been had you used the full size available to you...</td>', 'beautiful image.  can''t begin to imagine how extraordinary this would have been had you used the full size available to you...', '2007-01-24 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278705, 449349, 23394, '<td valign="top">definitely not something you see every day.  nice work.  i can''t help but wonder, though, what it is about this image that made it stand out to you as your best of the year...</td>', 'definitely not something you see every day.  nice work.  i can''t help but wonder, though, what it is about this image that made it stand out to you as your best of the year...', '2007-01-24 23:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
