(3278728, 449543, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but way, way, way too much neat image (or whatever tool you used for noise reduction).  the loss of texture really takes away from the image.  hope you have fun reshooting it ;-)</td>', 'nice idea, but way, way, way too much neat image (or whatever tool you used for noise reduction).  the loss of texture really takes away from the image.  hope you have fun reshooting it ;-)', '2007-01-24 23:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
