(3278739, 448749, 23394, '<td valign="top">i have an idea as to what you were after, but think you need to decide what it is you''re trying to compose.  this comes across a little haphazard.</td>', 'i have an idea as to what you were after, but think you need to decide what it is you''re trying to compose.  this comes across a little haphazard.', '2007-01-24 23:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278740, 451450, 23394, '<td valign="top">alt title: sky with clouds ;-)<br/> <br/>aside from being slightly over-saturated, this image is why we have tripods and timers on our cameras--so that we can put subjects in these images to make them more interesting.  this is beautiful, yes, but lacking any dynamic to keep one''s interest.</td>', 'alt title: sky with clouds ;-) aside from being slightly over-saturated, this image is why we have tripods and timers on our cameras--so that we can put subjects in these images to make them more interesting.  this is beautiful, yes, but lacking any dynamic to keep one''s interest.', '2007-01-24 23:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278741, 448121, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very grand indeed.....</td>', 'Very grand indeed.....', '2007-01-24 23:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278743, 451941, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this simply comes across as a bad snapshot.  but, don''t let my opinion deter you from pushing yourself to be a better photographer.  it takes work, a lot of work, but, if you really want to do it, you can.</td>', 'sorry, but this simply comes across as a bad snapshot.  but, don''t let my opinion deter you from pushing yourself to be a better photographer.  it takes work, a lot of work, but, if you really want to do it, you can.', '2007-01-24 23:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278744, 448129, 23394, '<td valign="top">very, very nice.  i love the idea and composition.  if i had to nitpick, it would be that parts of the image are unevenly soft (like around the mouth).  all the same, this really is a killer shot.</td>', 'very, very nice.  i love the idea and composition.  if i had to nitpick, it would be that parts of the image are unevenly soft (like around the mouth).  all the same, this really is a killer shot.', '2007-01-24 23:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3278746, 450465, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know how i feel about this.  i can''t tell if it would be better if you had processed it less.  it''s an amazing capture, to say the least.</td>', 'i don''t know how i feel about this.  i can''t tell if it would be better if you had processed it less.  it''s an amazing capture, to say the least.', '2007-01-24 23:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
