(3278825, 451867, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a nice image, but, to me, not a great image.  the different lines and objects create more a sense of visual confusion than that of a strong subjectless image.  given the sky and the different things in the image, it seems like you could have had a field day working your way around this vista.  possibly something with that tree at the bottom right, or the bridge, or following the pathway around to the left.  just some ideas, feel free to ignore me.</td>', 'this is a nice image, but, to me, not a great image.  the different lines and objects create more a sense of visual confusion than that of a strong subjectless image.  given the sky and the different things in the image, it seems like you could have had a field day working your way around this vista.  possibly something with that tree at the bottom right, or the bridge, or following the pathway around to the left.  just some ideas, feel free to ignore me.', '2007-01-24 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
