(3279037, 451945, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a cutie.  seems like you could have cropped in a lot tighter.  all that space around her doesn''t really do much for the image.</td>', 'what a cutie.  seems like you could have cropped in a lot tighter.  all that space around her doesn''t really do much for the image.', '2007-01-25 00:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
