(3279042, 450885, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice find.  love the calmness in the waters.  i would have been tempted to frame a bit lower, looking for more water and less sky, though.  just my opinion.</td>', 'nice find.  love the calmness in the waters.  i would have been tempted to frame a bit lower, looking for more water and less sky, though.  just my opinion.', '2007-01-25 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
