(3279047, 451902, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject, but i imagine this would have been stronger if you had found a spot with more of the flowers, or if you had moved your camera lower and shot through the blossoms.</td>', 'beautiful subject, but i imagine this would have been stronger if you had found a spot with more of the flowers, or if you had moved your camera lower and shot through the blossoms.', '2007-01-25 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279048, 447652, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love the misty feeling of this one...</td>', 'I love the misty feeling of this one...', '2007-01-25 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279049, 451241, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is such a beautiful setting.  the image looks like it would be nice in a magazine.  as is, it''s probably a bit too subtle for the challenge. it''s just a shame there isn''t something more to connect with, like say, the gardener taking an ice tea break...just my opinion, feel free to ignore.</td>', 'this is such a beautiful setting.  the image looks like it would be nice in a magazine.  as is, it''s probably a bit too subtle for the challenge. it''s just a shame there isn''t something more to connect with, like say, the gardener taking an ice tea break...just my opinion, feel free to ignore.', '2007-01-25 00:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279051, 449839, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m really not sure what to make of this.  i can''t see enough of the dog''s face to connect with the dog.  the flowers look interesting, but i can''t see enough of them.  there''s nothing wrong with grabbing a shot because you think it''s cute, but those shots don''t tend to do well in challenges...</td>', 'i''m really not sure what to make of this.  i can''t see enough of the dog''s face to connect with the dog.  the flowers look interesting, but i can''t see enough of them.  there''s nothing wrong with grabbing a shot because you think it''s cute, but those shots don''t tend to do well in challenges...', '2007-01-25 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279052, 447785, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough capture, but a bit over-exposed.  maybe if shot at a different time of day, you could have gotten more detail in the petals.</td>', 'nice enough capture, but a bit over-exposed.  maybe if shot at a different time of day, you could have gotten more detail in the petals.', '2007-01-25 00:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
