(3279063, 451643, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get what you''re after, and i know this wasn''t easy.  if it''s a SP, maybe you should get an assistant ;-)  the problem is the pose and hat just don''t come through enough for the image to work without the title.</td>', 'i get what you''re after, and i know this wasn''t easy.  if it''s a SP, maybe you should get an assistant ;-)  the problem is the pose and hat just don''t come through enough for the image to work without the title.', '2007-01-25 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
