(3279068, 451567, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough for a postcard, but, beyond that, nothing to really capture my imagination.</td>', 'nice enough for a postcard, but, beyond that, nothing to really capture my imagination.', '2007-01-25 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279071, 451908, 23394, '<td valign="top">i sense what you wanted to do here, but something leaves this feeling a bit strange.  not really able to put my finger on it, though.</td>', 'i sense what you wanted to do here, but something leaves this feeling a bit strange.  not really able to put my finger on it, though.', '2007-01-25 00:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279072, 451688, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but something seems a bit off.  the hair looks wildly pixelated; can''t tell if it''s from the lighting or the processing.  this has potential, but still needs a bit more work.</td>', 'nice idea, but something seems a bit off.  the hair looks wildly pixelated; can''t tell if it''s from the lighting or the processing.  this has potential, but still needs a bit more work.', '2007-01-25 00:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279073, 451192, 23394, '<td valign="top">very beautiful, for sure, but beyond a studied glance, not much to keep me hanging around.</td>', 'very beautiful, for sure, but beyond a studied glance, not much to keep me hanging around.', '2007-01-25 00:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279074, 448322, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting study of light and textures.  probably a bit too dark for this type of challenge, though.</td>', 'interesting study of light and textures.  probably a bit too dark for this type of challenge, though.', '2007-01-25 00:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279076, 447673, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an excellent observation.  an absolute shame you didn''t correct the horizon, as the tilt does nothing to enhance the image...</td>', 'what an excellent observation.  an absolute shame you didn''t correct the horizon, as the tilt does nothing to enhance the image...', '2007-01-25 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279078, 448635, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely observed, but a bit oversharpened--unnecessarily at that.  as a silhouette in bw, you probably didn''t need much sharpening.  keep shooting stuff like this, and you''ll get up there with jj and ed.</td>', 'nicely observed, but a bit oversharpened--unnecessarily at that.  as a silhouette in bw, you probably didn''t need much sharpening.  keep shooting stuff like this, and you''ll get up there with jj and ed.', '2007-01-25 00:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279079, 451691, 23394, '<td valign="top">yeah, visual perfection, but, then again, would we expect anything less from you ;-)</td>', 'yeah, visual perfection, but, then again, would we expect anything less from you ;-)', '2007-01-25 00:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279080, 451960, 23394, '<td valign="top">very, very nicely done.  love the violence in the water.  nicely observed.</td>', 'very, very nicely done.  love the violence in the water.  nicely observed.', '2007-01-25 00:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279082, 448845, 48228, '<td valign="top">Good one here...</td>', 'Good one here...', '2007-01-25 00:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279083, 451683, 23394, '<td valign="top">for sure, a beautiful vista.  nothing wrong with landscapes, but, after a good glance, there''s not much to keep me here.</td>', 'for sure, a beautiful vista.  nothing wrong with landscapes, but, after a good glance, there''s not much to keep me here.', '2007-01-25 00:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279084, 447733, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely observed, but probably a bit too subtle for this challenge.  love the treatment--takes me right back to my grandmother''s home.</td>', 'nicely observed, but probably a bit too subtle for this challenge.  love the treatment--takes me right back to my grandmother''s home.', '2007-01-25 00:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279086, 450749, 23394, '<td valign="top">a little too much contrast for my taste.  maybe it''s that the tonal range is too subtle.</td>', 'a little too much contrast for my taste.  maybe it''s that the tonal range is too subtle.', '2007-01-25 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279087, 447677, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait, yes, but if there were a hint of emotion, i''d probably feel a bit more connection with the image.</td>', 'beautiful portrait, yes, but if there were a hint of emotion, i''d probably feel a bit more connection with the image.', '2007-01-25 00:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279089, 451835, 23394, '<td valign="top">very, very nice.  personally, i would have opted for a square crop, trimming off the right side.</td>', 'very, very nice.  personally, i would have opted for a square crop, trimming off the right side.', '2007-01-25 00:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279091, 451750, 48228, '<td valign="top">Good night shot here...</td>', 'Good night shot here...', '2007-01-25 00:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279092, 447630, 23394, '<td valign="top">a beautiful shot, yes, but a damn shame about all that stuff in the water.  it might be worth it to spend an hour or so, cleaning it all out.  the lighting and colors and composition is perfect, but the magic is lost by the reality of the water''s surface.  i guess it all depends on what you really want to depict...</td>', 'a beautiful shot, yes, but a damn shame about all that stuff in the water.  it might be worth it to spend an hour or so, cleaning it all out.  the lighting and colors and composition is perfect, but the magic is lost by the reality of the water''s surface.  i guess it all depends on what you really want to depict...', '2007-01-25 00:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279094, 451762, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject, but there''s something off in this photo.  i can''t tell if it''s the lighting or the focus.</td>', 'beautiful subject, but there''s something off in this photo.  i can''t tell if it''s the lighting or the focus.', '2007-01-25 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
