(3279180, 451118, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a bit underwhelming for THIS challenge - you might find VERY low scores with this because there are so many entries &amp; some folks might get irate over the flood of what MIGHT be considered less than "Best Of" calibre.  <br/> <br/>This has nice composition, but you did the image a great disservice by entering it in such a small format.  I''d suggest paying close attention to the rules next time &amp; note the max size you may submit &amp; perhaps aim to get closer to that size.  At this size, it is difficult to judge the image - it looks like it really COULD be great!<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Nice, but a bit underwhelming for THIS challenge - you might find VERY low scores with this because there are so many entries & some folks might get irate over the flood of what MIGHT be considered less than "Best Of" calibre.   This has nice composition, but you did the image a great disservice by entering it in such a small format.  I''d suggest paying close attention to the rules next time & note the max size you may submit & perhaps aim to get closer to that size.  At this size, it is difficult to judge the image - it looks like it really COULD be great! Good luck...', '2007-01-25 00:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279181, 451711, 53316, '<td valign="top">When I saw the thumbnail at first I thought this was a unicorn!!! This photo has a very magical quality about it, in the lighting, colors, and depth of focus - they all combine to create something amazing.</td>', 'When I saw the thumbnail at first I thought this was a unicorn!!! This photo has a very magical quality about it, in the lighting, colors, and depth of focus - they all combine to create something amazing.', '2007-01-25 00:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279192, 451447, 67841, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2007-01-25 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
