(3280374, 451302, 46314, '<td valign="top">I live the decreasing levels of blackness, as the strength of the silhouettes decrease .Adds massive depth to the photo. And this is one instance where a blown out, white sky really fits the image.</td>', 'I live the decreasing levels of blackness, as the strength of the silhouettes decrease .Adds massive depth to the photo. And this is one instance where a blown out, white sky really fits the image.', '2007-01-25 08:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
