(3280382, 451888, 46314, '<td valign="top">Seems to be suffering from compression/interpolation artifacts. Not a good quallity capture. Horizon also seems titled, but hard to tell because the details are quite murky. Otherwise it could have made for a nice silhouette at sunrise.</td>', 'Seems to be suffering from compression/interpolation artifacts. Not a good quallity capture. Horizon also seems titled, but hard to tell because the details are quite murky. Otherwise it could have made for a nice silhouette at sunrise.', '2007-01-25 08:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280386, 448910, 46314, '<td valign="top">Technicals are solid - exposure, focus, DOF - all good. But lacks any wow factor.</td>', 'Technicals are solid - exposure, focus, DOF - all good. But lacks any wow factor.', '2007-01-25 08:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280394, 448169, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Almost looks like a representation of yin and yang. Maybe needed to get a bit more overhead though, because the current persepective makes the subject in the foreground appear much larger than the one in the back. I just think it would have had more balance if they appeared to be the same size. Also, the highlights are a bit blown at the top, so that the top models legs bleed off into the background, which looks a bit odd. Still, overall it''s a nice image.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Almost looks like a representation of yin and yang. Maybe needed to get a bit more overhead though, because the current persepective makes the subject in the foreground appear much larger than the one in the back. I just think it would have had more balance if they appeared to be the same size. Also, the highlights are a bit blown at the top, so that the top models legs bleed off into the background, which looks a bit odd. Still, overall it''s a nice image.', '2007-01-25 08:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280395, 451207, 46314, '<td valign="top">Could have simplified the composition a lot more, for a much stronger image.</td>', 'Could have simplified the composition a lot more, for a much stronger image.', '2007-01-25 08:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280414, 451398, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice duotone. Maybe a bit more contrast? Either way, I like it.</td>', 'Nice duotone. Maybe a bit more contrast? Either way, I like it.', '2007-01-25 08:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
