(3280515, 447767, 31917, '<td valign="top">wow, so warm and rich.  great color and lighting. well weighted left to right. I want to walk into it!</td>', 'wow, so warm and rich.  great color and lighting. well weighted left to right. I want to walk into it!', '2007-01-25 09:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280520, 447565, 31917, '<td valign="top">gorgeous. classic feel. the subject contrasts the background and pops right off of it, but yet still feels like she belongs there.</td>', 'gorgeous. classic feel. the subject contrasts the background and pops right off of it, but yet still feels like she belongs there.', '2007-01-25 09:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280534, 448168, 31917, '<td valign="top">sweet.  love the metal tones.  just myself, i would like to see it without the new car and have the negative space on the right. less busy more balanced. still very nice.</td>', 'sweet.  love the metal tones.  just myself, i would like to see it without the new car and have the negative space on the right. less busy more balanced. still very nice.', '2007-01-25 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280542, 448446, 46314, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Larus shot. And if you''re not Larus, that''s a compliment. Nice work.</td>', 'Looks like a Larus shot. And if you''re not Larus, that''s a compliment. Nice work.', '2007-01-25 09:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280549, 451852, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the pixellated look on the details here, but damn - it sure is a striking image.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the pixellated look on the details here, but damn - it sure is a striking image.', '2007-01-25 09:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280555, 448231, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny, there was another bird shot with the same title. This one is a bit too minimalist for me. Just not enough to hold my attention.</td>', 'Funny, there was another bird shot with the same title. This one is a bit too minimalist for me. Just not enough to hold my attention.', '2007-01-25 09:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280558, 447851, 31917, '<td valign="top">Nice! cropping out the top inch lets my eyes focus on the beautifully highlighted hilltops.</td>', 'Nice! cropping out the top inch lets my eyes focus on the beautifully highlighted hilltops.', '2007-01-25 09:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280560, 451046, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.</td>', 'Nice lines.', '2007-01-25 09:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280564, 448812, 31917, '<td valign="top">good title. I like how the stem mimicks and paralells the crack in the wall or visa versa.</td>', 'good title. I like how the stem mimicks and paralells the crack in the wall or visa versa.', '2007-01-25 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280570, 449039, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Cool capture.</td>', 'Nice colours. Cool capture.', '2007-01-25 09:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280571, 448095, 31917, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp. frog butt.</td>', 'Nice, crisp. frog butt.', '2007-01-25 09:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280582, 448175, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Love the distorted perspective.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Love the distorted perspective.', '2007-01-25 09:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280587, 450594, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Quality of the image is a bit poor - lots of fringing/haloing.</td>', 'Nice capture. Quality of the image is a bit poor - lots of fringing/haloing.', '2007-01-25 09:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280603, 449035, 46314, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old photo - almost in the style of Cartier-Bresson. I like it. Very nice tonal range and detail.</td>', 'Looks like an old photo - almost in the style of Cartier-Bresson. I like it. Very nice tonal range and detail.', '2007-01-25 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280607, 451313, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''ve always been a fan of side-heavy compositions like this. And I really like the colours and DOF here.</td>', 'I''ve always been a fan of side-heavy compositions like this. And I really like the colours and DOF here.', '2007-01-25 09:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280642, 450638, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful staircase shot. I like the way the light shines on from the windows on each floor on the way down. The rhythm in the photo is excellent. From a distance, it looks like an evil eye. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful staircase shot. I like the way the light shines on from the windows on each floor on the way down. The rhythm in the photo is excellent. From a distance, it looks like an evil eye. Well done.', '2007-01-25 09:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280657, 451473, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Clever set up. The colours and glass distortion really make it bedazzling.</td>', 'Very nice image. Clever set up. The colours and glass distortion really make it bedazzling.', '2007-01-25 09:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280674, 448185, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly interesting shot. Looks like a holiday snapshot. If you''d emphasised something as a subject, there might have been more to hold our attention.</td>', 'Not a particularly interesting shot. Looks like a holiday snapshot. If you''d emphasised something as a subject, there might have been more to hold our attention.', '2007-01-25 10:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280687, 451221, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the subject doesn''t seem strong enough.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the subject doesn''t seem strong enough.', '2007-01-25 10:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280690, 448781, 58452, '<td valign="top">So many different levels of detail to create a 3D object out of a 2D image.  I love the many converging and complimentary lines moving across the frame.  While at first it appears a little monochromatic there is a beautiful range across what is there.<br/>I pick few favorites and give few 10''s.  This one is both to me.  Congrats, I expect this to win.</td>', 'So many different levels of detail to create a 3D object out of a 2D image.  I love the many converging and complimentary lines moving across the frame.  While at first it appears a little monochromatic there is a beautiful range across what is there.I pick few favorites and give few 10''s.  This one is both to me.  Congrats, I expect this to win.', '2007-01-25 10:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280711, 451702, 58452, '<td valign="top">Maybe my current battle makes me appreciate this image.  ;)  It has a clean, focused appeal.  Looks like a wonderful stock image. I like the story.</td>', 'Maybe my current battle makes me appreciate this image.  ;)  It has a clean, focused appeal.  Looks like a wonderful stock image. I like the story.', '2007-01-25 10:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280715, 450976, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Looks like a spaceship. Brilliant use of the mirror glass for that.</td>', 'I love this shot. Looks like a spaceship. Brilliant use of the mirror glass for that.', '2007-01-25 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280725, 448416, 46314, '<td valign="top">The DOF needed to be deeper - getting sharp focus at hyperfocal distance would have improved this image. Also, there doesn''t seem to be enough contrast - the lighting seems flat.</td>', 'The DOF needed to be deeper - getting sharp focus at hyperfocal distance would have improved this image. Also, there doesn''t seem to be enough contrast - the lighting seems flat.', '2007-01-25 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280728, 451132, 58452, '<td valign="top">Neat!  UFO clouds. Don''t often see lenticular clouds captured with such an interesting foreground.  Mono lake?  LIght''s a bit harsh on the foreground.  Maybe that''s why you went B&amp;W.  Excellent job in a difficult lighting situation.</td>', 'Neat!  UFO clouds. Don''t often see lenticular clouds captured with such an interesting foreground.  Mono lake?  LIght''s a bit harsh on the foreground.  Maybe that''s why you went B&W.  Excellent job in a difficult lighting situation.', '2007-01-25 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3280731, 447981, 58452, '<td valign="top">Looks like a stork casting call.  If they''re storks!  Love the composition.  The foreground to background balance makes this a very unique shot.  Beautiful colors and lines too.  Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a stork casting call.  If they''re storks!  Love the composition.  The foreground to background balance makes this a very unique shot.  Beautiful colors and lines too.  Very nice.', '2007-01-25 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280733, 451366, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and contrasts. It''s almost like she''s wearing a Mexican dress and going out to dance!</td>', 'Love the colors and contrasts. It''s almost like she''s wearing a Mexican dress and going out to dance!', '2007-01-25 10:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280734, 451816, 58452, '<td valign="top">I love the story this shot tells.   I just wish the background behind the bee wasn''t so distracting.  Otherwise this would be a 10 rather than an 8.  Great job stopping the action.</td>', 'I love the story this shot tells.   I just wish the background behind the bee wasn''t so distracting.  Otherwise this would be a 10 rather than an 8.  Great job stopping the action.', '2007-01-25 10:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280736, 447552, 58452, '<td valign="top">Great action shot with the saber in a bank.  If this is a model it''s a darn good reproduction.  I like the colors of the foliage behind the colors of the jet.</td>', 'Great action shot with the saber in a bank.  If this is a model it''s a darn good reproduction.  I like the colors of the foliage behind the colors of the jet.', '2007-01-25 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280737, 451911, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detalis from front to back with sharpness throughout.  Wish I could see this at full rez.  And considering the light you had to work with it''s amazing.</td>', 'Beautiful detalis from front to back with sharpness throughout.  Wish I could see this at full rez.  And considering the light you had to work with it''s amazing.', '2007-01-25 10:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280738, 447661, 58452, '<td valign="top">I love these little guys.  Wonderful composition and colors with a neat title.  Very nice.</td>', 'I love these little guys.  Wonderful composition and colors with a neat title.  Very nice.', '2007-01-25 10:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280739, 451138, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the design of this composition.  But with what looks like a sunset behind the houses, what is lighting them?  Extremely unique image to me anyway.  An 8 for me.</td>', 'I like the design of this composition.  But with what looks like a sunset behind the houses, what is lighting them?  Extremely unique image to me anyway.  An 8 for me.', '2007-01-25 10:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280742, 450040, 58452, '<td valign="top">I really like your post processing on this one.  I hope you enlighten us after the challenge is over.  While some might think it over the top, it has an edgy surreal feeling I really like.  A boat in the lower right corner to balance the shoreline/cityscape and clouds would have been cool too.  ;)  An 8 for me.</td>', 'I really like your post processing on this one.  I hope you enlighten us after the challenge is over.  While some might think it over the top, it has an edgy surreal feeling I really like.  A boat in the lower right corner to balance the shoreline/cityscape and clouds would have been cool too.  ;)  An 8 for me.', '2007-01-25 10:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280746, 450858, 58452, '<td valign="top">Why do I visualize her smoking a Virginia Slim?  I like this composition a lot, especially the position of the front legs.  The high contrast right angle triangle to the left of her rear most leg I could do without.  That''s my only nit pick.  And I do believe this would only work B&amp;W.</td>', 'Why do I visualize her smoking a Virginia Slim?  I like this composition a lot, especially the position of the front legs.  The high contrast right angle triangle to the left of her rear most leg I could do without.  That''s my only nit pick.  And I do believe this would only work B&W.', '2007-01-25 10:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280751, 447639, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pastels and lovely pose by the subject.  Like the first time I saw this I wished there was some way to deal with the object in the left foreground.  But the rest is so fine it hardly detracts.  Is this <br/>kuku?</td>', 'Beautiful pastels and lovely pose by the subject.  Like the first time I saw this I wished there was some way to deal with the object in the left foreground.  But the rest is so fine it hardly detracts.  Is this kuku?', '2007-01-25 10:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280752, 451849, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and exotic plant.  Wish the leaf or whatever just behind the plant weren''t there.  But this is just a nit pic.  It''s great!</td>', 'Love the colors and exotic plant.  Wish the leaf or whatever just behind the plant weren''t there.  But this is just a nit pic.  It''s great!', '2007-01-25 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280759, 451915, 46314, '<td valign="top">A very ominous feeling from this shot - that''s a good thing. Really draws you into the picture. Nice black and white contrast.</td>', 'A very ominous feeling from this shot - that''s a good thing. Really draws you into the picture. Nice black and white contrast.', '2007-01-25 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280762, 447759, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details with an excellent composition.</td>', 'Beautiful details with an excellent composition.', '2007-01-25 10:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280764, 449992, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice use of pattern in this image.</td>', 'Nice use of pattern in this image.', '2007-01-25 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280768, 450680, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lacks a specific subject. DOF and focus are not great.</td>', 'Lacks a specific subject. DOF and focus are not great.', '2007-01-25 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280773, 451152, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well exposed. Managed to get those bright sky colours and yet retain the fine detail of the bridge and the marina.</td>', 'Well exposed. Managed to get those bright sky colours and yet retain the fine detail of the bridge and the marina.', '2007-01-25 10:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280777, 447628, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful gray rock and foliage framing.  Nice shutter speed to transform the falls into a veil.  Beautiful image Zeke.</td>', 'Beautiful gray rock and foliage framing.  Nice shutter speed to transform the falls into a veil.  Beautiful image Zeke.', '2007-01-25 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280779, 451028, 58452, '<td valign="top">Something about the soft snow makes this familar scene look very surreal.  Must have been a long lens?  Very nice.</td>', 'Something about the soft snow makes this familar scene look very surreal.  Must have been a long lens?  Very nice.', '2007-01-25 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280786, 451871, 58452, '<td valign="top">Lovely IR.  I love the composition of the trees and the play of their shadows.  Wish the clouds could have been a bit larger and a little higher and farther left.  But just a nit pick.</td>', 'Lovely IR.  I love the composition of the trees and the play of their shadows.  Wish the clouds could have been a bit larger and a little higher and farther left.  But just a nit pick.', '2007-01-25 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280788, 448525, 46314, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning landscape. Looks like Iceland, so minus points for that: it seems to easy to get stunning landscapes there (just kidding, I''d only minus points if you were Australian...). Love the colours. DOF and focus is excellent. Nice tonal range too. Well done.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning landscape. Looks like Iceland, so minus points for that: it seems to easy to get stunning landscapes there (just kidding, I''d only minus points if you were Australian...). Love the colours. DOF and focus is excellent. Nice tonal range too. Well done.', '2007-01-25 10:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280789, 450829, 58452, '<td valign="top">I liked this series when I first saw it cheeseman, and I still do.  The pose is a little provocative but I love the expression and the lines created by the limbs, clothing, and hair.  I predict top ten!</td>', 'I liked this series when I first saw it cheeseman, and I still do.  The pose is a little provocative but I love the expression and the lines created by the limbs, clothing, and hair.  I predict top ten!', '2007-01-25 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280793, 449472, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Absolutely perfect perspective and angles. The subject is so strong in this image. Very well done. (Actually back to make this a favourite - really like how you did this.)</td>', 'Awesome shot. Absolutely perfect perspective and angles. The subject is so strong in this image. Very well done. (Actually back to make this a favourite - really like how you did this.)', '2007-01-25 10:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280794, 449299, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the expressive face.</td>', 'Nice capture of the expressive face.', '2007-01-25 10:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280799, 447851, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice countryside. Maybe could have included less of the sky to avoid that distracting blown out patch at the top.</td>', 'Nice countryside. Maybe could have included less of the sky to avoid that distracting blown out patch at the top.', '2007-01-25 10:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280800, 450814, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the smoothing effect on the water.  Third look, bumping it a point to an 8.</td>', 'Love the smoothing effect on the water.  Third look, bumping it a point to an 8.', '2007-01-25 10:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280801, 451740, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice pelicans</td>', 'nice pelicans', '2007-01-25 10:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280803, 448007, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not enough of interest in the photo.</td>', 'Not enough of interest in the photo.', '2007-01-25 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280804, 451747, 58452, '<td valign="top">I love how the lines of the rocks carry up into the lines of the clouds.  Would have been nicer with a little more color in the rock.</td>', 'I love how the lines of the rocks carry up into the lines of the clouds.  Would have been nicer with a little more color in the rock.', '2007-01-25 10:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280805, 451928, 68586, '<td valign="top">That''s terriers for you - too concerned with posing to have a cuddle  :-)<br/>lovely lighting.</td>', 'That''s terriers for you - too concerned with posing to have a cuddle  :-)lovely lighting.', '2007-01-25 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280806, 448539, 48890, '<td valign="top">Love the steam in this shot.  I wish you were closer to the subject, and that you didn''t have to crop out such a weird format. 6</td>', 'Love the steam in this shot.  I wish you were closer to the subject, and that you didn''t have to crop out such a weird format. 6', '2007-01-25 10:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280807, 451902, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the blue and green of the bluebells.  Wish you''d had a split density filter to help balance the dynamic range.</td>', 'Love the blue and green of the bluebells.  Wish you''d had a split density filter to help balance the dynamic range.', '2007-01-25 10:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280811, 448635, 48890, '<td valign="top">A great shot. 9</td>', 'A great shot. 9', '2007-01-25 10:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280813, 447735, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy effect.  Your faithful friend in doggie heaven.<br/>Be sure to print, frame, and hang this one.  It''s special.<br/>Third look, bumping it to a 8.</td>', 'Nice dreamy effect.  Your faithful friend in doggie heaven.Be sure to print, frame, and hang this one.  It''s special.Third look, bumping it to a 8.', '2007-01-25 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280817, 451724, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice shot, and nice framing of the man in one corner and the cannon in the other which leads the eye into the picture. His face is perhaps a little dark, and it would have been nice to include his feet.</td>', 'nice shot, and nice framing of the man in one corner and the cannon in the other which leads the eye into the picture. His face is perhaps a little dark, and it would have been nice to include his feet.', '2007-01-25 10:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280818, 447892, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and textures.  Maybe just a tad hot on the upper right part of the dune.</td>', 'Beautiful lines and textures.  Maybe just a tad hot on the upper right part of the dune.', '2007-01-25 10:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280819, 447619, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wow - how desolate is that ?<br/> <br/>Lovely balance of lighting and tones.</td>', 'Wow - how desolate is that ? Lovely balance of lighting and tones.', '2007-01-25 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280823, 451793, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the curves and the subtle variations of color.</td>', 'Love the curves and the subtle variations of color.', '2007-01-25 10:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280824, 447727, 48890, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterns at the top.  IMO you need something to tie the top and the bottom parts together. 7</td>', 'Interesting patterns at the top.  IMO you need something to tie the top and the bottom parts together. 7', '2007-01-25 10:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280825, 450961, 48890, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2007-01-25 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280826, 451566, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice shot, the figure adds depth to the picture beautifully.</td>', 'nice shot, the figure adds depth to the picture beautifully.', '2007-01-25 10:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280827, 448223, 58452, '<td valign="top">The PP seems a little much to me, but....  I find the composition very interesting.  I keep wanting to see what''s just out of frame left.</td>', 'The PP seems a little much to me, but....  I find the composition very interesting.  I keep wanting to see what''s just out of frame left.', '2007-01-25 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280831, 450033, 48890, '<td valign="top">A very unnatural posture of the person in this shot, and composed too tightly.  The sky is great, and so is the story. 6</td>', 'A very unnatural posture of the person in this shot, and composed too tightly.  The sky is great, and so is the story. 6', '2007-01-25 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280836, 448864, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Expression definitely connects with the viewer.</td>', 'Interesting image. Expression definitely connects with the viewer.', '2007-01-25 10:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280839, 449788, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the light in this image.  I believe you could crop from the top down and eliminate 2/3s of the dark tree foliage and make this a much stronger composition.</td>', 'Love the light in this image.  I believe you could crop from the top down and eliminate 2/3s of the dark tree foliage and make this a much stronger composition.', '2007-01-25 10:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280841, 451473, 68586, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.<br/> <br/>I like the bold colours, clean lines, use of the vase as a lens, etc etc.<br/> <br/>I''m not completely sure about the crop, but all in all a great shot. well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I like the bold colours, clean lines, use of the vase as a lens, etc etc. I''m not completely sure about the crop, but all in all a great shot. well done.', '2007-01-25 10:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280850, 448525, 68586, '<td valign="top">A wonderful picture, beautifully presented.</td>', 'A wonderful picture, beautifully presented.', '2007-01-25 10:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280852, 449938, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice lightning capture. A pity some of the foreground details intrude a bit on the composition.</td>', 'Nice lightning capture. A pity some of the foreground details intrude a bit on the composition.', '2007-01-25 10:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280860, 451309, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very clean product shot. Nice use of colour too. Lid detail is a bit blown out though.</td>', 'Very clean product shot. Nice use of colour too. Lid detail is a bit blown out though.', '2007-01-25 10:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280870, 449446, 48890, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing another shot of the same scene, but could not find it right now.  I think that I like this variant better; will have to come again after the challenge is finished. 9</td>', 'I remember seeing another shot of the same scene, but could not find it right now.  I think that I like this variant better; will have to come again after the challenge is finished. 9', '2007-01-25 11:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280879, 447624, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose and shot. Very well lit. It doesn''t really have a ''wow'' factor for me (excluding the obvious naked woman). What I mean is, there''s nothing that really draws me into the image, and makes me linger there for longer than a moment. Still, overall, it''s a good photo and I''m sure it will be a crowd pleaser.</td>', 'Interesting pose and shot. Very well lit. It doesn''t really have a ''wow'' factor for me (excluding the obvious naked woman). What I mean is, there''s nothing that really draws me into the image, and makes me linger there for longer than a moment. Still, overall, it''s a good photo and I''m sure it will be a crowd pleaser.', '2007-01-25 11:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280885, 450719, 42567, '<td valign="top">nice picture.  8</td>', 'nice picture.  8', '2007-01-25 11:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280886, 450708, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Those clouds seem to rear up and out at you. Nice incorporation of the ship silhouette into what would otherwise have been just another sunset.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Those clouds seem to rear up and out at you. Nice incorporation of the ship silhouette into what would otherwise have been just another sunset.', '2007-01-25 11:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280888, 451917, 28532, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!  Love the angle.  Flawless!</td>', 'This is amazing!  Love the angle.  Flawless!', '2007-01-25 11:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280889, 449182, 42567, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Clouds looks really good.  9</td>', 'very nice.  Clouds looks really good.  9', '2007-01-25 11:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
