(3281529, 451528, 31341, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the sand being thrown up, and the colors.  Only drawback is the oversharpening halo around the rider and ATV.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the sand being thrown up, and the colors.  Only drawback is the oversharpening halo around the rider and ATV.', '2007-01-25 14:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
