(3282126, 447883, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice scene.  Hardly notice the people there.  Really like the tree elements here, especially the blossom upper right corner.  Wonder about a variation in cropping/composition, mainly to eliminate the people on the left, which would obviously mean losing that tree trunk as well, however bringing the building edge to the left of frame might have given this a little extra, not sure - but maybe just ''another'' image, if that makes sense.</td>', '7 - Very nice scene.  Hardly notice the people there.  Really like the tree elements here, especially the blossom upper right corner.  Wonder about a variation in cropping/composition, mainly to eliminate the people on the left, which would obviously mean losing that tree trunk as well, however bringing the building edge to the left of frame might have given this a little extra, not sure - but maybe just ''another'' image, if that makes sense.', '2007-01-25 17:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
