(3282567, 447561, 23680, '<td valign="top">Jamaica perhaps?  This is one of those pictures that just takes my breath away.  The horse and rider and beautiful, the motion captured perfectly and it reminds me of one of my favorite places even if it isn''t in Jamaica :)</td>', 'Jamaica perhaps?  This is one of those pictures that just takes my breath away.  The horse and rider and beautiful, the motion captured perfectly and it reminds me of one of my favorite places even if it isn''t in Jamaica :)', '2007-01-25 19:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282569, 451867, 42567, '<td valign="top">ok, I know the processing is one of those HDR things, but I really would like to know how you get your clouds to look that great!  I''ve study your last picture but I''m clueless! 10!</td>', 'ok, I know the processing is one of those HDR things, but I really would like to know how you get your clouds to look that great!  I''ve study your last picture but I''m clueless! 10!', '2007-01-25 19:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282570, 449035, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is a very fine composition and so well-suited for the tone you chose.<br/>My only dig on this is the halo effect around the people and the upper right roof lines. Was this from dodge/burning done? If so, it''s best to do it in a new layer via copy, do the burning as if the people weren''t even there, then go to the eraser tool and erase back areas you didn''t want burned if they got too dark, then flatten layers.<br/>Still a great photograph regardless.</td>', 'This is a very fine composition and so well-suited for the tone you chose.My only dig on this is the halo effect around the people and the upper right roof lines. Was this from dodge/burning done? If so, it''s best to do it in a new layer via copy, do the burning as if the people weren''t even there, then go to the eraser tool and erase back areas you didn''t want burned if they got too dark, then flatten layers.Still a great photograph regardless.', '2007-01-25 19:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282575, 449001, 23680, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and understated.  A nice contrast from some of the oversaturated images we see lately.  Thank you</td>', 'Simple, elegant and understated.  A nice contrast from some of the oversaturated images we see lately.  Thank you', '2007-01-25 19:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
