(3282636, 451580, 61191, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot Elvi! Well I have seen this several times on your profile page but it''s still great: I love the atmoshpere, it''s such an emotional shot with an interesting story going on! Your composition is unusual but great for this kind of portrait. The lighting and the DOF works great. Hope this ends up high, good luck for the roll-over! :)</td>', 'Very cool shot Elvi! Well I have seen this several times on your profile page but it''s still great: I love the atmoshpere, it''s such an emotional shot with an interesting story going on! Your composition is unusual but great for this kind of portrait. The lighting and the DOF works great. Hope this ends up high, good luck for the roll-over! :)', '2007-01-25 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
