(3282743, 447508, 15497, '<td valign="top">You got something unique going on here, honesty. I believe you, and I believe your subject. And that''s what makes a great photo. I surely hope you do really well with this. 10 from me! GOOD LUCK!</td>', 'You got something unique going on here, honesty. I believe you, and I believe your subject. And that''s what makes a great photo. I surely hope you do really well with this. 10 from me! GOOD LUCK!', '2007-01-25 20:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
