(3282750, 451366, 15497, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Love the poppy colors, and this creatures rules! Good luck 6</td>', 'Cool shot! Love the poppy colors, and this creatures rules! Good luck 6', '2007-01-25 20:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282757, 451788, 20941, '<td valign="top">A Wonderful capture perfectly presented to enhance the mood/story here. Awesome!!!</td>', 'A Wonderful capture perfectly presented to enhance the mood/story here. Awesome!!!', '2007-01-25 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282763, 451398, 15497, '<td valign="top">Sorry mate, but I''m not buying it :) Let me explain a little why, the expression: It''s not an expression I''d expect to see in war. The composition is great, but he just doesn''t sell war to me, he sort of looks a little out of place, and not like he''s scared or angry. Faces tell the stories, and this story isn''t selling to me. I simply don''t believe in it. The BW touch doesn''t work either, because it''s too flat. Most war photos bw have artifacts, and pushed up contrast. And this just seem to simple. <br/> <br/>I''m giving you 5, good luck with your entry.</td>', 'Sorry mate, but I''m not buying it :) Let me explain a little why, the expression: It''s not an expression I''d expect to see in war. The composition is great, but he just doesn''t sell war to me, he sort of looks a little out of place, and not like he''s scared or angry. Faces tell the stories, and this story isn''t selling to me. I simply don''t believe in it. The BW touch doesn''t work either, because it''s too flat. Most war photos bw have artifacts, and pushed up contrast. And this just seem to simple.  I''m giving you 5, good luck with your entry.', '2007-01-25 20:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282765, 448926, 15497, '<td valign="top">I''d say DrAchoo based on the frame, but you never know. :-)<br/> <br/>I love the sharpness and the colors in this photo, I also love the space on the left side. I hope you do well with it. 8 from me!</td>', 'I''d say DrAchoo based on the frame, but you never know. :-) I love the sharpness and the colors in this photo, I also love the space on the left side. I hope you do well with it. 8 from me!', '2007-01-25 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282766, 447628, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little oversaturated. Nice capture of the waterfall though.</td>', 'A little oversaturated. Nice capture of the waterfall though.', '2007-01-25 20:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282769, 450017, 15497, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for the noise and really blown out parts, I might have given more than 4. Good luck!</td>', 'Had it not been for the noise and really blown out parts, I might have given more than 4. Good luck!', '2007-01-25 20:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282774, 447740, 72840, '<td valign="top">The photos composition and execution was done very well.  The way you layed everything out creates value.</td>', 'The photos composition and execution was done very well.  The way you layed everything out creates value.', '2007-01-25 20:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282775, 448604, 15497, '<td valign="top">You got a great face and a funny constume. Here is what I would recommend next time: play a little with Paint Shop Pro (free) or Photoshop, try to add more contrast and sharpness, as for the composition I would either give it more space on the sides, or move in closer to get more impact. A tad more contrast, sharpness and color would move this up a lot. Good luck 6</td>', 'You got a great face and a funny constume. Here is what I would recommend next time: play a little with Paint Shop Pro (free) or Photoshop, try to add more contrast and sharpness, as for the composition I would either give it more space on the sides, or move in closer to get more impact. A tad more contrast, sharpness and color would move this up a lot. Good luck 6', '2007-01-25 20:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282780, 450894, 15497, '<td valign="top">Minor technical flaws, halo effect on the edges of the buildings, I don''t like the composition, but I do like the blue tones you got in here. It''s a little crowded, I tend to vote up simple stuff, simply because that''s what I like. Less is more in my book. 6</td>', 'Minor technical flaws, halo effect on the edges of the buildings, I don''t like the composition, but I do like the blue tones you got in here. It''s a little crowded, I tend to vote up simple stuff, simply because that''s what I like. Less is more in my book. 6', '2007-01-25 20:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282783, 447677, 15497, '<td valign="top">Certainly a good pose and great composition. Eyes and rose gets all the attention, which is great. I do however feel that the blownout parts in her forehead are distracting, and the background doesn''t give this power, it''s too close and overlight. 7</td>', 'Certainly a good pose and great composition. Eyes and rose gets all the attention, which is great. I do however feel that the blownout parts in her forehead are distracting, and the background doesn''t give this power, it''s too close and overlight. 7', '2007-01-25 20:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
