(3283375, 447625, 66597, '<td valign="top">Not a bad action shot, but looks very washed out. Consider increasing saturation for a more dramatic effect.</td>', 'Not a bad action shot, but looks very washed out. Consider increasing saturation for a more dramatic effect.', '2007-01-25 22:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283384, 451081, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this capture, as the spider is interesting and the background a nice contrast. I think for a higher score in this contest, the spider would have to be sharper, though. What a funny face on his abdomen!</td>', 'I really like this capture, as the spider is interesting and the background a nice contrast. I think for a higher score in this contest, the spider would have to be sharper, though. What a funny face on his abdomen!', '2007-01-25 22:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283385, 451154, 66597, '<td valign="top">The lamppost bisects this photo in a way that does nothing to add to the composition IMO. However, I do like the tone of the roof against the sepia sky.</td>', 'The lamppost bisects this photo in a way that does nothing to add to the composition IMO. However, I do like the tone of the roof against the sepia sky.', '2007-01-25 22:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283386, 447903, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful butterly and backlighting. Some sharpening would really help pop this  - have you tried unsharp mask in Photoshop or similar? It really is a nice photo that would look even stronger, I think.</td>', 'Beautiful butterly and backlighting. Some sharpening would really help pop this  - have you tried unsharp mask in Photoshop or similar? It really is a nice photo that would look even stronger, I think.', '2007-01-25 22:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283391, 448695, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love how the hippo is peeking up at you. I think what may hurt you on this shot is the number of conflicting patterns (rock, hippo hide, water) that all pull in different directions. I also think there is too much contrast between the rock and the hippo, but not enough on the hippo himself (would like to see more detail in his hide). Still an interesting shot and right place at right time.</td>', 'Love how the hippo is peeking up at you. I think what may hurt you on this shot is the number of conflicting patterns (rock, hippo hide, water) that all pull in different directions. I also think there is too much contrast between the rock and the hippo, but not enough on the hippo himself (would like to see more detail in his hide). Still an interesting shot and right place at right time.', '2007-01-25 22:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283395, 451369, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked the solitude and mystery of woods, so this photo resonates with me. There''s something in the color and balance of composition that doesn''t quite feel right, though. I think it may be the large tree center left seems almost like it is blocking me from entering the photo. I also think it may be just a bit dark.</td>', 'I''ve always liked the solitude and mystery of woods, so this photo resonates with me. There''s something in the color and balance of composition that doesn''t quite feel right, though. I think it may be the large tree center left seems almost like it is blocking me from entering the photo. I also think it may be just a bit dark.', '2007-01-25 23:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283398, 448659, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a fun photo, great expression. Something your family will cherish!</td>', 'This is a fun photo, great expression. Something your family will cherish!', '2007-01-25 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283400, 451799, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jellyfish are difficult to photo (am assuming you took this through glass in an aquarium.) I think you will probably lose votes based on the fact that the jelly''s whole tail is not present, and tentacles could be a little sharper. Still a nice capture!</td>', 'Jellyfish are difficult to photo (am assuming you took this through glass in an aquarium.) I think you will probably lose votes based on the fact that the jelly''s whole tail is not present, and tentacles could be a little sharper. Still a nice capture!', '2007-01-25 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283406, 451151, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the use of selective desat in the hat, and think your composition is solid. The lighting looks a bit flat, though, and the focus too soft.</td>', 'I like the use of selective desat in the hat, and think your composition is solid. The lighting looks a bit flat, though, and the focus too soft.', '2007-01-25 23:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283407, 450668, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks underexposed and the horizon may be bit off. I suspect you had difficult lighting circumstances to work with here.</td>', 'Looks underexposed and the horizon may be bit off. I suspect you had difficult lighting circumstances to work with here.', '2007-01-25 23:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283408, 451683, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think it is almost impossible to capture bright clouds and sky in midday without totally underexposing adjacent scenery. You''ve done an adequate job here, but not bang-up, and it is very difficult to appreciate the scenery while distracted by the very bright clouds. Would love to see this scene taken in early morning or late evenin light.</td>', 'I think it is almost impossible to capture bright clouds and sky in midday without totally underexposing adjacent scenery. You''ve done an adequate job here, but not bang-up, and it is very difficult to appreciate the scenery while distracted by the very bright clouds. Would love to see this scene taken in early morning or late evenin light.', '2007-01-25 23:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283410, 447760, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture, particularly as it is midnight! Like the idea, wish the composition were a bit stronger with more negative space around front feet.</td>', 'Interesting capture, particularly as it is midnight! Like the idea, wish the composition were a bit stronger with more negative space around front feet.', '2007-01-25 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3283412, 451118, 66597, '<td valign="top">I voted this fairly low simply because I can''t see enough to get a real feel for teh photo. Suggest going all the way up to 640 pixel limit on longest side so that voters can really appreciate your art! This looks interesting and I''d like to see it larger size.</td>', 'I voted this fairly low simply because I can''t see enough to get a real feel for teh photo. Suggest going all the way up to 640 pixel limit on longest side so that voters can really appreciate your art! This looks interesting and I''d like to see it larger size.', '2007-01-25 23:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283417, 451888, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but I think this would have to provide more detail / sharpness for a higher score in this challenge. I do think the small lights add effectively to your theme.</td>', 'I like the colors, but I think this would have to provide more detail / sharpness for a higher score in this challenge. I do think the small lights add effectively to your theme.', '2007-01-25 23:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283418, 451282, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great capture, and very cute. Suggest a little work on saturation and color-balance to really bring these boys out, followed by some sharpening. Then, bring it out on their first dates :-)</td>', 'Great capture, and very cute. Suggest a little work on saturation and color-balance to really bring these boys out, followed by some sharpening. Then, bring it out on their first dates :-)', '2007-01-25 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283423, 451454, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think super close-ups on animal faces are very difficult. You did a nice job cropping the right amount of face, but the unnatural color cast in the background detracts.</td>', 'I think super close-ups on animal faces are very difficult. You did a nice job cropping the right amount of face, but the unnatural color cast in the background detracts.', '2007-01-25 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283430, 451952, 66597, '<td valign="top">Not a bad still life study. I don''t think the flat light flatters the pencils particularly, but on the other hand, I like the hard shadows, as I think they add drama. YOur placement bisecting the table shadow is interesting, am not sure of reason for this, however.</td>', 'Not a bad still life study. I don''t think the flat light flatters the pencils particularly, but on the other hand, I like the hard shadows, as I think they add drama. YOur placement bisecting the table shadow is interesting, am not sure of reason for this, however.', '2007-01-25 23:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283436, 451296, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and colors, but I think at least some portion would have to be tack-sharp for higher score in this challenge. Still, very decent composition, and nice ruffles on leaf edges.</td>', 'I love the idea and colors, but I think at least some portion would have to be tack-sharp for higher score in this challenge. Still, very decent composition, and nice ruffles on leaf edges.', '2007-01-25 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283439, 451045, 66597, '<td valign="top">I know how difficult these photos are, and you did a fine job of capturing the heron entering the photo (as opposed to exiting) with wings in pleasing position. Unfortunately, though, he''s not quite in focus.</td>', 'I know how difficult these photos are, and you did a fine job of capturing the heron entering the photo (as opposed to exiting) with wings in pleasing position. Unfortunately, though, he''s not quite in focus.', '2007-01-25 23:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283442, 451837, 66597, '<td valign="top">The lines and birds are nice. I think the lighting conditions may have hurt you, with the very deep shadows in the trees and bright white sky.</td>', 'The lines and birds are nice. I think the lighting conditions may have hurt you, with the very deep shadows in the trees and bright white sky.', '2007-01-25 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283446, 447851, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the sunbeam and lighting of the green hills.  For me it would be stronger if it were cropped down from the top just to the edge of where the sunbeam spilled out of the clouds and  cropped from the left to almost that same point.  That would eliminate the huge blown spot and a lot of the very dark negative space on the bottom left.  If the tree on the closest ridge could have had just a little more light this would have been a 10.  So it''s just a 9.  ;)  Congrats.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the sunbeam and lighting of the green hills.  For me it would be stronger if it were cropped down from the top just to the edge of where the sunbeam spilled out of the clouds and  cropped from the left to almost that same point.  That would eliminate the huge blown spot and a lot of the very dark negative space on the bottom left.  If the tree on the closest ridge could have had just a little more light this would have been a 10.  So it''s just a 9.  ;)  Congrats.', '2007-01-25 23:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283449, 450680, 66597, '<td valign="top">A pleasing photo with nice composition of ducks around the bench. The color temperature feels a little off - like the photo may need a slight cooling filter. I think this would be interesting to see with a red or orange bench to make that area pop more.</td>', 'A pleasing photo with nice composition of ducks around the bench. The color temperature feels a little off - like the photo may need a slight cooling filter. I think this would be interesting to see with a red or orange bench to make that area pop more.', '2007-01-25 23:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283455, 451869, 66597, '<td valign="top">The capture of the flamingo is nice, as is the water dripping from beak. Something looks a little off on the composition - maybe not quite straight.</td>', 'The capture of the flamingo is nice, as is the water dripping from beak. Something looks a little off on the composition - maybe not quite straight.', '2007-01-25 23:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283456, 451546, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great idea for unusual subject matter. I think the time of day may have impacted this photo by bringing out a lot of harsh shadows. Would like to see this early am or late evening, or in a cloudy situation so that letters and water could stand out better.</td>', 'Great idea for unusual subject matter. I think the time of day may have impacted this photo by bringing out a lot of harsh shadows. Would like to see this early am or late evening, or in a cloudy situation so that letters and water could stand out better.', '2007-01-25 23:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283469, 451079, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and starbursts</td>', 'Beautiful colors and starbursts', '2007-01-25 23:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283470, 449055, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lighting is extraordinary here. And a comet to boot!</td>', 'Lighting is extraordinary here. And a comet to boot!', '2007-01-25 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283479, 447568, 66597, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of this challenge. So much emotion in this photo, and so much effort. Great title, too.</td>', 'One of my favorites of this challenge. So much emotion in this photo, and so much effort. Great title, too.', '2007-01-25 23:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283484, 451302, 66597, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t have an Ansel Adams look, I don''t know what does :-) Beautiful sense of depth.</td>', 'If this doesn''t have an Ansel Adams look, I don''t know what does :-) Beautiful sense of depth.', '2007-01-25 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283487, 447878, 40683, '<td valign="top">What a compelling gaze and pose!</td>', 'What a compelling gaze and pose!', '2007-01-25 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283489, 448209, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m so jealous - I''m assuming this is antelope canyon? I''ve been wanting to visit for a long time! What a beautiful shot and great capture of very difficult lighting conditions. 8.</td>', 'Wow, I''m so jealous - I''m assuming this is antelope canyon? I''ve been wanting to visit for a long time! What a beautiful shot and great capture of very difficult lighting conditions. 8.', '2007-01-25 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283495, 451540, 40683, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, serene image.  I love the gradations in tones as the trees fade into the fog.</td>', 'A beautiful, serene image.  I love the gradations in tones as the trees fade into the fog.', '2007-01-25 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283502, 451129, 66597, '<td valign="top">What an awesome action shot! I don''t think I''ve ever seen a photo of a tiger pouncing outside of national geo. Great photo.</td>', 'What an awesome action shot! I don''t think I''ve ever seen a photo of a tiger pouncing outside of national geo. Great photo.', '2007-01-25 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283517, 447492, 40683, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! The colors and tones are just perfect...I''m so glad that you didn''t make them shout to be noticed.  The image soars with a subtle, soothing presence.</td>', 'Beautiful!!! The colors and tones are just perfect...I''m so glad that you didn''t make them shout to be noticed.  The image soars with a subtle, soothing presence.', '2007-01-25 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283524, 447855, 66597, '<td valign="top">That''s one sheriff I don''t want to mess with... Great expression.</td>', 'That''s one sheriff I don''t want to mess with... Great expression.', '2007-01-25 23:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283526, 447670, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the short DOF here and background colors. 7.</td>', 'I like the short DOF here and background colors. 7.', '2007-01-25 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283533, 451598, 1, '<td valign="top">This is my most favorite color combination (I remember wanting green walls and pink trim in my bedroom as a kid).  Great exposure/editing to really make the colors pop.  The framing is perfect as well.</td>', 'This is my most favorite color combination (I remember wanting green walls and pink trim in my bedroom as a kid).  Great exposure/editing to really make the colors pop.  The framing is perfect as well.', '2007-01-25 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283534, 449035, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the old-world feel of this.</td>', 'I really like the old-world feel of this.', '2007-01-25 23:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283543, 451651, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a very sharp photo of an owl (just curious, is an eagle owl and great horned owl the same thing, because I''m pretty sure this is a great horned owl?) The eye color doesn''t work for me, though. 6.</td>', 'This is a very sharp photo of an owl (just curious, is an eagle owl and great horned owl the same thing, because I''m pretty sure this is a great horned owl?) The eye color doesn''t work for me, though. 6.', '2007-01-25 23:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283549, 448822, 1, '<td valign="top">You''ve really captured the moment here... makes me smile thinking of the simple pleasures of life.</td>', 'You''ve really captured the moment here... makes me smile thinking of the simple pleasures of life.', '2007-01-25 23:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283561, 449975, 13897, '<td valign="top">This will ribon for sure. The best of the best!</td>', 'This will ribon for sure. The best of the best!', '2007-01-25 23:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283563, 447568, 1, '<td valign="top">Awesome, I loved this when I saw it before.</td>', 'Awesome, I loved this when I saw it before.', '2007-01-25 23:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283565, 448321, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment: This is beautiful.  Love the long exposure and the nice light.  Small Nits: I would have liked to see a bit more foreground though, and that might have given you a better split between water and sky.  Good luck</td>', 'Return for comment: This is beautiful.  Love the long exposure and the nice light.  Small Nits: I would have liked to see a bit more foreground though, and that might have given you a better split between water and sky.  Good luck', '2007-01-25 23:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283566, 449642, 51802, '<td valign="top">That is an amazing reflection!</td>', 'That is an amazing reflection!', '2007-01-25 23:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283574, 447735, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  Very impressionistic.  I love the PP.  Good comp too.  Bumping up to nine.</td>', 'Return for comment.  Very impressionistic.  I love the PP.  Good comp too.  Bumping up to nine.', '2007-01-25 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283578, 450434, 51802, '<td valign="top">Her turquoise dress does a great job of making her stand out and bringing even more interest to a wonderful shot!</td>', 'Her turquoise dress does a great job of making her stand out and bringing even more interest to a wonderful shot!', '2007-01-25 23:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283582, 449158, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  Excellent choice of BW, very nice composition overall.  I''d have been curious though if it might have worked better with the lizard facing into the scene (the other side)</td>', 'Return for comment.  Excellent choice of BW, very nice composition overall.  I''d have been curious though if it might have worked better with the lizard facing into the scene (the other side)', '2007-01-25 23:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283583, 447767, 51802, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is what makes this shot!  Well done!</td>', 'The lighting here is what makes this shot!  Well done!', '2007-01-25 23:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283584, 451797, 51802, '<td valign="top">I love the selective desat you have done here.</td>', 'I love the selective desat you have done here.', '2007-01-25 23:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283588, 449149, 51802, '<td valign="top">Very majestic!</td>', 'Very majestic!', '2007-01-25 23:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283589, 448812, 51802, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this.', '2007-01-25 23:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283593, 451940, 51802, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is one of the better lightning shots I have seen.</td>', 'Wow!  This is one of the better lightning shots I have seen.', '2007-01-25 23:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283606, 448175, 25397, '<td valign="top">The tilt works perfectly, well done</td>', 'The tilt works perfectly, well done', '2007-01-25 23:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283613, 447568, 51802, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a very powerful shot.  I can feel his determination.  This is definitely a photo to be proud of.</td>', 'Wow!  This is a very powerful shot.  I can feel his determination.  This is definitely a photo to be proud of.', '2007-01-25 23:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283617, 451796, 51802, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I am looking at, but I very much like it.</td>', 'I have no idea what I am looking at, but I very much like it.', '2007-01-25 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283641, 449599, 37961, '<td valign="top">I would have to agree. Your best from the year. Good choice!</td>', 'I would have to agree. Your best from the year. Good choice!', '2007-01-25 23:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283643, 451729, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot!  So many wedding shots seem so contrived, but this one is amazingly candid and truthful (even if it is posed). :-)</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot!  So many wedding shots seem so contrived, but this one is amazingly candid and truthful (even if it is posed). :-)', '2007-01-25 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283656, 451444, 24528, '<td valign="top">Congrats on Ribbon</td>', 'Congrats on Ribbon', '2007-01-26 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
