(3283695, 447860, 3214, '<td valign="top">First freakin'' class and terrific use of burning.  I''d be proud to have this in my portfolio.  And sell it, over and over again.  ;-)</td>', 'First freakin'' class and terrific use of burning.  I''d be proud to have this in my portfolio.  And sell it, over and over again.  ;-)', '2007-01-26 00:19:08.000000', NULL, 0),
