(3283906, 447773, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, Kelli.  I think the raw materials are there for an even better finished product;  with some more processing it would really improve.  I agree with the folks who are suggesting a little more sharpening and a little more contrast/saturation.  The fence doesn''t bother me, but if you have Photoshop or something with layer masks, it might be worthwhile blurring it out a bit.  If you''re not sure how that works, let me know and I''ll walk you through it. :)</td>', 'This is really nice, Kelli.  I think the raw materials are there for an even better finished product;  with some more processing it would really improve.  I agree with the folks who are suggesting a little more sharpening and a little more contrast/saturation.  The fence doesn''t bother me, but if you have Photoshop or something with layer masks, it might be worthwhile blurring it out a bit.  If you''re not sure how that works, let me know and I''ll walk you through it. :)', '2007-01-26 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
