(3284064, 449078, 67841, '<td valign="top">I loved the colors &amp; abstract form, finding them compelling &amp; evocative...<br/> <br/>This was a bold entry - it barks out confidence in one''s ability as an artist!</td>', 'I loved the colors & abstract form, finding them compelling & evocative... This was a bold entry - it barks out confidence in one''s ability as an artist!', '2007-01-26 01:05:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284071, 447677, 28742, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the eyes! Only issue I have with it overall is her close proximity to the background. Still, a beautiful portrait!</td>', 'Excellent job on the eyes! Only issue I have with it overall is her close proximity to the background. Still, a beautiful portrait!', '2007-01-26 01:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284072, 451797, 53278, '<td valign="top">WOW, great job on the selective desat!!!!!</td>', 'WOW, great job on the selective desat!!!!!', '2007-01-26 01:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284082, 451662, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new personal best!  Nice to see someone actually doing that with this challenge. :)  And wow, what a high placement!  And then look at that favorites count and how many comments and how highly THEY rated this! Just a fantastic result all around.<br/> <br/>This shot is just masterful;  the framing, light, your pose ... plus, I had to lean in close to tell it wasn''t a painting!<br/> <br/>Your artistry is simply stunning, Svetlana.  You really owe DPC a tutorial on how you got the painting effect.</td>', 'Congrats on your new personal best!  Nice to see someone actually doing that with this challenge. :)  And wow, what a high placement!  And then look at that favorites count and how many comments and how highly THEY rated this! Just a fantastic result all around. This shot is just masterful;  the framing, light, your pose ... plus, I had to lean in close to tell it wasn''t a painting! Your artistry is simply stunning, Svetlana.  You really owe DPC a tutorial on how you got the painting effect.', '2007-01-26 01:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284094, 447960, 53278, '<td valign="top">Seriously, i am surprised this did not do better!!!<br/>great colors, great composition, great DOF.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Seriously, i am surprised this did not do better!!!great colors, great composition, great DOF. ', '2007-01-26 01:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
