(3284119, 449457, 15711, '<td valign="top">What an f-ing rip off.  This is brilliant.  I guess people don''t like smoking brides.  I do.</td>', 'What an f-ing rip off.  This is brilliant.  I guess people don''t like smoking brides.  I do.', '2007-01-26 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284129, 447624, 28742, '<td valign="top">You gotta be kidding me, Judi - this was your best shot of 2006? I mean it''s nice &amp; all, but not even close to the best of what I have seen in your portfolio, nude or otherwise. She looks very tenuous and uncomfortable in that pose and her expression reflects that as well. You got me scratching my head...</td>', 'You gotta be kidding me, Judi - this was your best shot of 2006? I mean it''s nice & all, but not even close to the best of what I have seen in your portfolio, nude or otherwise. She looks very tenuous and uncomfortable in that pose and her expression reflects that as well. You got me scratching my head...', '2007-01-26 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284130, 449158, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, Enzo.  You didn''t nail your goal.  You''ll just have to settle for 0.5 higher. :)  Congrats on this awesome, awesome shot and very high placement! :)</td>', 'Sorry, Enzo.  You didn''t nail your goal.  You''ll just have to settle for 0.5 higher. :)  Congrats on this awesome, awesome shot and very high placement! :)', '2007-01-26 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
