(3284150, 447624, 53316, '<td valign="top">I agree with the fact that the pose looks a little stiff (although that''s probably not something I would have thought on my own). But I am inclined to like the pose.  Her beauty is not flaunted but instead displayed with grace, and a lot of times that just increases the beauty for me. (I hope the oxymoron of graceful stiffness makes sense. It''s like her body may be a tad stiff but the way she chooses to show herself to the world is graceful.)<br/> <br/>edit: And I also agree that the shadow is somewhat odd BUT I think it''s much better this way than it would have been if she had been "floating" on a perfectly white background with no shadow at all.  (Edit edit: oh, someone already said that! So I agree with that comment!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 01:16:02.</i></td>', 'I agree with the fact that the pose looks a little stiff (although that''s probably not something I would have thought on my own). But I am inclined to like the pose.  Her beauty is not flaunted but instead displayed with grace, and a lot of times that just increases the beauty for me. (I hope the oxymoron of graceful stiffness makes sense. It''s like her body may be a tad stiff but the way she chooses to show herself to the world is graceful.) edit: And I also agree that the shadow is somewhat odd BUT I think it''s much better this way than it would have been if she had been "floating" on a perfectly white background with no shadow at all.  (Edit edit: oh, someone already said that! So I agree with that comment!)', '2007-01-26 01:14:07.000000', '2007-01-26 01:16:02.000000', 0),
(3284161, 451516, 28742, '<td valign="top">Place: <b>666 </b>out of 705<br/> <br/>Uh oh - is that part of the Devil''s triangle? ;-)<br/></td>', 'Place: 666 out of 705 Uh oh - is that part of the Devil''s triangle? ;-)', '2007-01-26 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284162, 451444, 22046, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Well deserved win. Ann</td>', 'Congratulations. Well deserved win. Ann', '2007-01-26 01:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284175, 451844, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, Christian, I know EXACTLY how you feel.  My wife''s family has a place in Vermont that her great-grandfather built almost 100 years ago.  We go up there every summer;  in fact, she goes for 3 weeks with the girls.<br/> <br/>As a photo, this is just singing with suppressed energy:  the cocked arm ready to cast, the dog ready to jump, and the clouds ready to unload.  Very nice!</td>', 'Oh, Christian, I know EXACTLY how you feel.  My wife''s family has a place in Vermont that her great-grandfather built almost 100 years ago.  We go up there every summer;  in fact, she goes for 3 weeks with the girls. As a photo, this is just singing with suppressed energy:  the cocked arm ready to cast, the dog ready to jump, and the clouds ready to unload.  Very nice!', '2007-01-26 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284178, 450086, 15305, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this picture, it is great!!  I''m looking forward enjoying more of your work.</td>', 'Congratulations on this picture, it is great!!  I''m looking forward enjoying more of your work.', '2007-01-26 01:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284180, 448858, 66384, '<td valign="top">Catherine, I love this pose, and the expression. He is really enjoying that sun. Wonderful capture. And congrats on your new personal best!</td>', 'Catherine, I love this pose, and the expression. He is really enjoying that sun. Wonderful capture. And congrats on your new personal best!', '2007-01-26 01:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
