(3284196, 451190, 60862, '<td valign="top">5.8?!?  Yet another team suck entry I just can''t believe scored where it did.  This is BEAUTIFUL.<br/> <br/>My one internal question is how I feel about the bit of arch on the right.  With it, the image tells me there''s more to the scene just over there to the right, so it engages me.  With it cropped out, the framing just feels so sweet.  Both good results. :)</td>', '5.8?!?  Yet another team suck entry I just can''t believe scored where it did.  This is BEAUTIFUL. My one internal question is how I feel about the bit of arch on the right.  With it, the image tells me there''s more to the scene just over there to the right, so it engages me.  With it cropped out, the framing just feels so sweet.  Both good results. :)', '2007-01-26 01:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284205, 448822, 19708, '<td valign="top">Perhaps one of the most under-rated images in this challenge.<br/>I can''t say enough about the genuine feeling that emits from this.</td>', 'Perhaps one of the most under-rated images in this challenge.I can''t say enough about the genuine feeling that emits from this.', '2007-01-26 01:19:47.000000', NULL, 0),
