(3284208, 451444, 28742, '<td valign="top">Sad to see this didn''t make your high scoring row in your profile. Just sad. Breakin my heart. Waaahhhh. ...just razzin'' ya Manny! Your bar is so high it''s hard to imagine what it takes for you to outdo yourself. Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Sad to see this didn''t make your high scoring row in your profile. Just sad. Breakin my heart. Waaahhhh. ...just razzin'' ya Manny! Your bar is so high it''s hard to imagine what it takes for you to outdo yourself. Congrats on the blue!', '2007-01-26 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
