(3284212, 447851, 15305, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your placing and your new personal best!!! This is a great shot and deserved even higher.</td>', 'Congratulations on your placing and your new personal best!!! This is a great shot and deserved even higher.', '2007-01-26 01:20:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284216, 447683, 1717, '<td valign="top">When I hear that wind blow,<br/>all across the Wicklow mountains.<br/>Sure it''s you, I''ll hear a calling.<br/>Johnny boy, oh Johnny boy.<br/> <br/>Now that Gary Moore song is stuck in my head. :)  Thanks for giving me such a beautiful image to go with the lyrics!</td>', 'When I hear that wind blow,all across the Wicklow mountains.Sure it''s you, I''ll hear a calling.Johnny boy, oh Johnny boy. Now that Gary Moore song is stuck in my head. :)  Thanks for giving me such a beautiful image to go with the lyrics!', '2007-01-26 01:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284225, 447620, 60862, '<td valign="top">Darn tootin'' you should be happy, Kelly! :)  Congrats on a fine pic.  I''m just confused - it''s so ... happy. I was looking for an emotionally wrenching image of someone screaming, and here you go and show your versatility by creating a lovely shot of a cute animal! ;)</td>', 'Darn tootin'' you should be happy, Kelly! :)  Congrats on a fine pic.  I''m just confused - it''s so ... happy. I was looking for an emotionally wrenching image of someone screaming, and here you go and show your versatility by creating a lovely shot of a cute animal! ;)', '2007-01-26 01:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284227, 451242, 19708, '<td valign="top">I was so hoping to see this in the top 10.<br/>This really is about as good of a child portrait as it gets.</td>', 'I was so hoping to see this in the top 10.This really is about as good of a child portrait as it gets.', '2007-01-26 01:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
