(3284232, 449457, 38127, '<td valign="top">Ya know... there are in the box thinkers and out of the box thinkers.  <br/>There are brilliant photos..and not so brilliant photos.. <br/>but this one right here????   Brilliant!!!  Based on the majority of comments you rec''d as well.. I''d say the people who get it are as magical and rare as this photo is.  <br/> <br/>Timeless work P.  Rox .. to quote Az.. Rocks!!!  <br/>and the fact that your brain gave this portrait life.. is why you remain one in a million to me.. one of my photography heros. <br/> <br/>** not a bad score given the amount that entered..but still a gross injustice in my opinion **</td>', 'Ya know... there are in the box thinkers and out of the box thinkers.  There are brilliant photos..and not so brilliant photos.. but this one right here????   Brilliant!!!  Based on the majority of comments you rec''d as well.. I''d say the people who get it are as magical and rare as this photo is.   Timeless work P.  Rox .. to quote Az.. Rocks!!!  and the fact that your brain gave this portrait life.. is why you remain one in a million to me.. one of my photography heros.  ** not a bad score given the amount that entered..but still a gross injustice in my opinion **', '2007-01-26 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 0),
