(3284242, 450814, 1717, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot, Mark!  i sure am happy we''re on the same team.  i''d hate to have to compete against you! (not that my work is even capable of competing.)  congrats on the ribbon. :-)</td>', 'gorgeous shot, Mark!  i sure am happy we''re on the same team.  i''d hate to have to compete against you! (not that my work is even capable of competing.)  congrats on the ribbon. :-)', '2007-01-26 01:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284244, 449975, 22537, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say a quick thanks to all you folks who took the time to comment on this image. It was pointed out a couple of times that the subject has a halo around her. Well.....you are right and I''m surprised that I had not caught that as I''m usually looking for that flaw when I submit to stock sites. Oh well,it is what it is and thanks for pointing that out.  On the good side, the shot got me the "Best of lens" ranking which I guess is my own little victory.</td>', 'Just wanted to say a quick thanks to all you folks who took the time to comment on this image. It was pointed out a couple of times that the subject has a halo around her. Well.....you are right and I''m surprised that I had not caught that as I''m usually looking for that flaw when I submit to stock sites. Oh well,it is what it is and thanks for pointing that out.  On the good side, the shot got me the "Best of lens" ranking which I guess is my own little victory.', '2007-01-26 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
