(3284630, 447624, 40679, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> You gotta be kidding me, Judi - this was your best shot of 2006? I mean it''s nice &amp; all, but not even close to the best of what I have seen in your portfolio, nude or otherwise. She looks very tenuous and uncomfortable in that pose and her expression reflects that as well. You got me scratching my head... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hmm I agree with Art. I think you''ve done such beautiful work, and ofcourse I don''t know why you chose this one, but I do know you can do a lot better :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: You gotta be kidding me, Judi - this was your best shot of 2006? I mean it''s nice & all, but not even close to the best of what I have seen in your portfolio, nude or otherwise. She looks very tenuous and uncomfortable in that pose and her expression reflects that as well. You got me scratching my head...   Hmm I agree with Art. I think you''ve done such beautiful work, and ofcourse I don''t know why you chose this one, but I do know you can do a lot better :)', '2007-01-26 02:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
