(3284760, 448864, 38127, '<td valign="top">You know Jen, I dont think any other model would have worked in this photo.. for so many reasons. <br/>Its among one of the most powerful images i''ve seen to date here on DPC.. and reading your statement about it just made it all that much more magical. <br/>I know why it moves me.. but to know you have been equally moved for your own reasons tickles me.  I think we should all have those photos that move us.. so often we are commenting on how much someone elses work has affected us that we fail to stop and realize or pay tribute to our own work / art. <br/>So congratulations for paying tribute to a beautiful, powerful piece of art.. that is you and was created by you.</td>', 'You know Jen, I dont think any other model would have worked in this photo.. for so many reasons. Its among one of the most powerful images i''ve seen to date here on DPC.. and reading your statement about it just made it all that much more magical. I know why it moves me.. but to know you have been equally moved for your own reasons tickles me.  I think we should all have those photos that move us.. so often we are commenting on how much someone elses work has affected us that we fail to stop and realize or pay tribute to our own work / art. So congratulations for paying tribute to a beautiful, powerful piece of art.. that is you and was created by you.', '2007-01-26 02:55:50.000000', NULL, 0),
