(3284804, 448121, 62637, '<td valign="top">This is a glorious shot, Sandy.  How would it have done in B&amp;W?  It has strong contrast and a lack of vibrant colour, leading me to think it would benefit from a B&amp;W treatment.  Nevertheless, the composition is there (as always) and I congratulate you on another wonderful (if underrated) mountain landscape.  Best of luck in 2007!</td>', 'This is a glorious shot, Sandy.  How would it have done in B&W?  It has strong contrast and a lack of vibrant colour, leading me to think it would benefit from a B&W treatment.  Nevertheless, the composition is there (as always) and I congratulate you on another wonderful (if underrated) mountain landscape.  Best of luck in 2007!', '2007-01-26 03:13:33.000000', NULL, 0),
