(3284845, 449001, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition!  The colors are fantastic too.  <br/>The concept reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55558" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">peroty</a>''s recent <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=449212" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">photo</a> with birds and a wire.  I think I really like the concept because... hm. I like birds (I wish I could fly) but I see a lot of shots with just a bird flying, and a sky for background. Having the wire in there gives some really great context and makes for a more unique image.</td>', 'Awesome composition!  The colors are fantastic too.  The concept reminds me of  peroty''s recent photo with birds and a wire.  I think I really like the concept because... hm. I like birds (I wish I could fly) but I see a lot of shots with just a bird flying, and a sky for background. Having the wire in there gives some really great context and makes for a more unique image.', '2007-01-26 03:30:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284854, 449830, 53316, '<td valign="top">I agree about the circles.  But it is a very small thing for me. The way it is, I still LOVE the image.  Especially the colors; autumn is my favorite season and the colors here really bring it to life for me (even if those don''t grow in autumn, the colors are just perfect!).</td>', 'I agree about the circles.  But it is a very small thing for me. The way it is, I still LOVE the image.  Especially the colors; autumn is my favorite season and the colors here really bring it to life for me (even if those don''t grow in autumn, the colors are just perfect!).', '2007-01-26 03:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284857, 450290, 53316, '<td valign="top">Besides the tilt I just ADORE this.  The lack of subject really seems inviting to me - like I want to walk down that path to see what''s at the end.  The greens are really great, and I love the blurred-but-still-in-focus feel (it gives the image a magical sort of quality).</td>', 'Besides the tilt I just ADORE this.  The lack of subject really seems inviting to me - like I want to walk down that path to see what''s at the end.  The greens are really great, and I love the blurred-but-still-in-focus feel (it gives the image a magical sort of quality).', '2007-01-26 03:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284869, 451691, 30422, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who voted and commented for making this a personal best in every aspect number of comments, score and favorites.  <br/> <br/>Also to note it was -10° C not F but cold still.<br/> <br/>Also to everyone who mistook me for Larus.  I accept the compliment, but to your defence we went out there together to take the pictures.  And they were taken at the same time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 03:42:39.</i></td>', 'Thank you to everyone who voted and commented for making this a personal best in every aspect number of comments, score and favorites.   Also to note it was -10° C not F but cold still. Also to everyone who mistook me for Larus.  I accept the compliment, but to your defence we went out there together to take the pictures.  And they were taken at the same time.', '2007-01-26 03:38:03.000000', '2007-01-26 03:42:39.000000', 0),
(3284871, 448416, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the diagonals! The horizon looks tilted but doesn''t, both at the same time.  I think it''s a neat visual effect.</td>', 'I love the diagonals! The horizon looks tilted but doesn''t, both at the same time.  I think it''s a neat visual effect.', '2007-01-26 03:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3284877, 449001, 53316, '<td valign="top">You know, I could TOTALLY see this on a greeting card.  Maybe it isn''t technically "perfect" so I''d probably clone out the bird that''s flying (the top one) and the bird it''s in front of, and just have the bird flying at the bottom... but yeah. Seems to me very sellable.</td>', 'You know, I could TOTALLY see this on a greeting card.  Maybe it isn''t technically "perfect" so I''d probably clone out the bird that''s flying (the top one) and the bird it''s in front of, and just have the bird flying at the bottom... but yeah. Seems to me very sellable.', '2007-01-26 03:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
