(3285251, 451366, 23394, '<td valign="top">if you held back from entering one of your trademark shots for fear of recognition backlash, you shouldn''t have.  if you really feel this is your best work of last year, that''s fine, as long as you don''t mind others feeling differently...</td>', 'if you held back from entering one of your trademark shots for fear of recognition backlash, you shouldn''t have.  if you really feel this is your best work of last year, that''s fine, as long as you don''t mind others feeling differently...', '2007-01-26 06:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
