(3285290, 451876, 34192, '<td valign="top">I was going to give you a 6, which would have lowered your score, so I''m glad I didn''t.  As I said, I love the composition - excellent sharpness, POV, DOF.  The processing just threw me off.</td>', 'I was going to give you a 6, which would have lowered your score, so I''m glad I didn''t.  As I said, I love the composition - excellent sharpness, POV, DOF.  The processing just threw me off.', '2007-01-26 06:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285292, 450774, 36006, '<td valign="top">AGAIN....<br/> <br/>....especially in still photography, there is only one chance to send the message of emotion within the frame.<br/> <br/>A smile is not <b>ALWAYS</b> the answer. Happiness is not the only emotion. Photography should not be just about smiles and teeth.<br/>Those of you not liking her expression actually were affected by the emotion factor, and did not realize it. <br/> <br/><b>NO</b>, if I wanted the water to look milky, then I would of done so. I wanted crispness to the water.<br/> <br/>A catchlight with a true close up maybe, but this model is too far for that. To have a catch light at the distance I had her, I would of needed somewhere around a 10kw as her key.<br/> <br/>Yes, I have converted it to a sepia tone, and didn''t know which one to enter in this challenge. Prolly would of done about the same placement.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 06:52:47.</i></td>', 'AGAIN.... ....especially in still photography, there is only one chance to send the message of emotion within the frame. A smile is not ALWAYS the answer. Happiness is not the only emotion. Photography should not be just about smiles and teeth.Those of you not liking her expression actually were affected by the emotion factor, and did not realize it.  NO, if I wanted the water to look milky, then I would of done so. I wanted crispness to the water. A catchlight with a true close up maybe, but this model is too far for that. To have a catch light at the distance I had her, I would of needed somewhere around a 10kw as her key. Yes, I have converted it to a sepia tone, and didn''t know which one to enter in this challenge. Prolly would of done about the same placement.', '2007-01-26 06:41:59.000000', '2007-01-26 06:52:47.000000', 0),
(3285296, 451534, 41554, '<td valign="top">Welcome back! We missed you!!!!</td>', 'Welcome back! We missed you!!!!', '2007-01-26 06:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285304, 449145, 61191, '<td valign="top">JP this was yours? Really great shot! Thought this would end up 1-20. But hey: 12 faves is great! :)</td>', 'JP this was yours? Really great shot! Thought this would end up 1-20. But hey: 12 faves is great! :)', '2007-01-26 06:46:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285307, 451534, 24715, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! I would have liked it blue though!</td>', 'Congratulations! I would have liked it blue though!', '2007-01-26 06:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285308, 451719, 61191, '<td valign="top">Damn, missed this one during voting - would have been a 10 from me. Great perspective, excellent colors and processing. Underrated for me.</td>', 'Damn, missed this one during voting - would have been a 10 from me. Great perspective, excellent colors and processing. Underrated for me.', '2007-01-26 06:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285309, 451719, 39850, '<td valign="top">nononononono... still a good image (angle, illusion, etc), just.. - "cabelas"</td>', 'nononononono... still a good image (angle, illusion, etc), just.. - "cabelas"', '2007-01-26 06:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285312, 448679, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Very nice and very good capture.  Mainly the framing held it back in my opinion.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Very nice and very good capture.  Mainly the framing held it back in my opinion.', '2007-01-26 06:51:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285314, 451852, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing. However, when I saw this I immediately thought it wouldn''t go over well with other voters since it had the same characteristics of an oversharpened image. Aside from that this is a very nice portrait. I like the composition the best. The color I like the least. Perhaps a b/w version would work better?</td>', 'Interesting processing. However, when I saw this I immediately thought it wouldn''t go over well with other voters since it had the same characteristics of an oversharpened image. Aside from that this is a very nice portrait. I like the composition the best. The color I like the least. Perhaps a b/w version would work better?', '2007-01-26 06:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285321, 451829, 46782, '<td valign="top">Great work nice top 10 finish (I had you for a ribbon!)</td>', 'Great work nice top 10 finish (I had you for a ribbon!)', '2007-01-26 06:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285325, 449446, 41337, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 as I loved it originally. Such a lousy placing for this image.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 as I loved it originally. Such a lousy placing for this image.', '2007-01-26 06:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285326, 449642, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Very nice, liked the ''blue''.  Difficult, but was a combination of the lack of detail discernible in the textures (which I realize was likely intentional) and the composition, just needed a little less perfect symmetry (maybe) - ''somewhere'', for this image, in my opinion - if that makes sense.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Very nice, liked the ''blue''.  Difficult, but was a combination of the lack of detail discernible in the textures (which I realize was likely intentional) and the composition, just needed a little less perfect symmetry (maybe) - ''somewhere'', for this image, in my opinion - if that makes sense.', '2007-01-26 06:54:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285329, 450932, 24913, '<td valign="top">OMG! I can''t believe this shot only got a 5.39 score. I gave it a 10, and it was my favorite. I think there were only 2 others that I gave 10''s  to. Well, if it means anything, it is a really nice shot, and the cropping and dof ect is perfect. Nice work!</td>', 'OMG! I can''t believe this shot only got a 5.39 score. I gave it a 10, and it was my favorite. I think there were only 2 others that I gave 10''s  to. Well, if it means anything, it is a really nice shot, and the cropping and dof ect is perfect. Nice work!', '2007-01-26 06:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285331, 447616, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Very nice silhouette and unusual pose.  Like that the hair was ''just'' discernible.  As mentioned by another, I wondered about the "four thingys" but resolved they were stirrups or some sort of ''equipment'', and were minor.  Upper right gradient softened would have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Very nice silhouette and unusual pose.  Like that the hair was ''just'' discernible.  As mentioned by another, I wondered about the "four thingys" but resolved they were stirrups or some sort of ''equipment'', and were minor.  Upper right gradient softened would have made this even better in my opinion.', '2007-01-26 06:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285334, 448737, 46782, '<td valign="top">I had this for a ribbon! AN OUTRAGE! Great work non-the-less.</td>', 'I had this for a ribbon! AN OUTRAGE! Great work non-the-less.', '2007-01-26 06:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285342, 449446, 41746, '<td valign="top">What?! Why is it hard to see the quality of this image. I can´t believe the score or place. This is an ERROR. Always one of my favorites.</td>', 'What?! Why is it hard to see the quality of this image. I can´t believe the score or place. This is an ERROR. Always one of my favorites.', '2007-01-26 07:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285344, 448209, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Very nice -  well photographed, including control of the depth and colors.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Very nice -  well photographed, including control of the depth and colors.', '2007-01-26 07:01:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3285348, 447519, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Really liked the unusual capture of both underwater and rich sky.  Reflection is nice too.  Just looked like it needed a fraction nudge up on the right, but could be a perspective thing.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Really liked the unusual capture of both underwater and rich sky.  Reflection is nice too.  Just looked like it needed a fraction nudge up on the right, but could be a perspective thing.', '2007-01-26 07:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
