(3285366, 451560, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Excellent cloud capture.  Very difficult with such shots, but was the grain here and there that mainly held it back for me.  Fairly minor, but the frame took away from the image slightly, in my opinion.  Your original is also very good as is.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Excellent cloud capture.  Very difficult with such shots, but was the grain here and there that mainly held it back for me.  Fairly minor, but the frame took away from the image slightly, in my opinion.  Your original is also very good as is.', '2007-01-26 07:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
