(3285518, 451190, 66384, '<td valign="top">You deserved a much higher score IMO. I gave this shot a 10 (and I was very stingy with the 10s in this challenge, since there were so many excellent shots. (Didn''t want my aver-score-given to wind up in the 9 range. How stupid would that look?)<br/> <br/>I love the mood, the muted colors, the composition. It has the feel of a classical painting. The frame enhances it nicely too, although I try not to include my feeling about the frame in my scoring of the image.</td>', 'You deserved a much higher score IMO. I gave this shot a 10 (and I was very stingy with the 10s in this challenge, since there were so many excellent shots. (Didn''t want my aver-score-given to wind up in the 9 range. How stupid would that look?) I love the mood, the muted colors, the composition. It has the feel of a classical painting. The frame enhances it nicely too, although I try not to include my feeling about the frame in my scoring of the image.', '2007-01-26 07:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
