(3285642, 451560, 61155, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 as well and I am actually suprised to see that it did not do even better than it did. I thought the crop was just a bit tight and now seeing the original, I wish you would have left it full frame. Nice processing, especially in the colors. The noise (grain) doesn''t bother me a bit.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 as well and I am actually suprised to see that it did not do even better than it did. I thought the crop was just a bit tight and now seeing the original, I wish you would have left it full frame. Nice processing, especially in the colors. The noise (grain) doesn''t bother me a bit.', '2007-01-26 08:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
