(3285650, 451242, 39850, '<td valign="top">This is really a very nice image.  One of the best portraits I''ve seen on DPC.  The moment/expression captured is perfect.  Like the light through the hair.  The only thing is the scarf, but the rest of the image dominates strongly enough that it loses any attention - in my opinion.</td>', 'This is really a very nice image.  One of the best portraits I''ve seen on DPC.  The moment/expression captured is perfect.  Like the light through the hair.  The only thing is the scarf, but the rest of the image dominates strongly enough that it loses any attention - in my opinion.', '2007-01-26 08:11:03.000000', NULL, 0),
