(3285676, 447500, 15305, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you for the comments! I also was hoping for a higher score (6.7) but I''m aware of all the great pictures in this challenge, and that voting was specially rough.<br/> <br/>To <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15497" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Terje</a>, thanks for your comment!! It is worth more than any ribbon I could get.<br/> <br/>To <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48560" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">crayon</a>, please do use your polarizer, the difference is sometimes outstanding.<br/> <br/>To everyone that asked for Tabacon, it was remodeled and now is bigger and better than ever!! If you come to CR, make sure to visit it.<br/> <br/>For everyone wondering what Tabacon is, it is a resort made around the hot water springs coming from the volcano, the hot water springs are widely used because of the health benefits provided by their mineral content and of course, it´s temperature.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 09:47:24.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all of you for the comments! I also was hoping for a higher score (6.7) but I''m aware of all the great pictures in this challenge, and that voting was specially rough. To  Terje, thanks for your comment!! It is worth more than any ribbon I could get. To  crayon, please do use your polarizer, the difference is sometimes outstanding. To everyone that asked for Tabacon, it was remodeled and now is bigger and better than ever!! If you come to CR, make sure to visit it. For everyone wondering what Tabacon is, it is a resort made around the hot water springs coming from the volcano, the hot water springs are widely used because of the health benefits provided by their mineral content and of course, it´s temperature.', '2007-01-26 08:16:00.000000', '2007-01-26 09:47:24.000000', 0),
(3285684, 450933, 15305, '<td valign="top">I thougt it would place higher. It was one of my 10''s. Congratulations on such a great shot!!</td>', 'I thougt it would place higher. It was one of my 10''s. Congratulations on such a great shot!!', '2007-01-26 08:17:42.000000', NULL, 0),
