(3286173, 449980, 24454, '<td valign="top">Andrew!!  This is so GORGEOUS!  I have to tell you: one afternoon, my sister and I were looking at some of the "Best Of" photos over the phone, talking about which ones we liked and which ones we were blown away by.   This one got her attention and she told me, "Go find Misty Rays. . .It''s the BEST!!!"   :)   She was SO RIGHT!!!<br/> <br/>Glad it finished strong -- but in my opinion, it should have finished even stronger!  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Andrew!!  This is so GORGEOUS!  I have to tell you: one afternoon, my sister and I were looking at some of the "Best Of" photos over the phone, talking about which ones we liked and which ones we were blown away by.   This one got her attention and she told me, "Go find Misty Rays. . .It''s the BEST!!!"   :)   She was SO RIGHT!!! Glad it finished strong -- but in my opinion, it should have finished even stronger!   ', '2007-01-26 10:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
