(3286299, 451028, 12253, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture, David!  You picked the perfect day to shoot.  Congratulations on a fine score and finish.  I''d be curious to see how you changed this for the print.  My only nit with the color is that the face looks a tad bit towards the greenish side of yellow in the highlights.  (And my monitor is supposedly calibrated using my Huey.)  I''ve never made it to Yosemite, but between this and other shots I''ve seen, I have to make it there--and perhaps in several different seasons!</td>', 'Incredible capture, David!  You picked the perfect day to shoot.  Congratulations on a fine score and finish.  I''d be curious to see how you changed this for the print.  My only nit with the color is that the face looks a tad bit towards the greenish side of yellow in the highlights.  (And my monitor is supposedly calibrated using my Huey.)  I''ve never made it to Yosemite, but between this and other shots I''ve seen, I have to make it there--and perhaps in several different seasons!', '2007-01-26 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 0),
