(3286700, 451651, 57392, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=458959" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/57392/thumb/458959.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/57392/thumb/458959.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/57392/thumb/458959.jpg"/></a>[img]Thanks to every one that voted,this is a per/best score so i was delighted. <br/>Two people give me a 2 score , I just dont get this,Ill just have to try harder, Thanks again. Morty<br/>Here is the original as a few voters were interested in the non desat version.This ones for skiprow.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-26 12:08:48.</i></td>', '[img]Thanks to every one that voted,this is a per/best score so i was delighted. Two people give me a 2 score , I just dont get this,Ill just have to try harder, Thanks again. MortyHere is the original as a few voters were interested in the non desat version.This ones for skiprow.', '2007-01-26 11:57:24.000000', '2007-01-26 12:08:48.000000', 0),
