(3286706, 447625, 6458, '<td valign="top">Then I would highly suggest getting your monitor checked. If you are seeing 99% of the images as "too dark", perhaps it is not the images, perhaps it is your monitor? <br/> <br/>New monitors cost less than a weeks worth of groceries these days -- perhaps that would be a wise investment.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Then I would highly suggest getting your monitor checked. If you are seeing 99% of the images as "too dark", perhaps it is not the images, perhaps it is your monitor?  New monitors cost less than a weeks worth of groceries these days -- perhaps that would be a wise investment. ', '2007-01-26 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
