(3286862, 447749, 65319, '<td valign="top">The moment of the bride preparing last minute touches is beautiful and will enhance the bride''s memories of her special day.  All the ladies are lovely and the natural setting is too.  I''m wondering if the capture would have been more poignant of an angle where you are standing more to the right and closer to the bride with all the bridesmaids facing you and with the sun behind you?  The sun''s angle is to the right of you which appears to cast slight shadows across your models.  Otherwise, a lovely moment captured for a timeless bride''s memory.</td>', 'The moment of the bride preparing last minute touches is beautiful and will enhance the bride''s memories of her special day.  All the ladies are lovely and the natural setting is too.  I''m wondering if the capture would have been more poignant of an angle where you are standing more to the right and closer to the bride with all the bridesmaids facing you and with the sun behind you?  The sun''s angle is to the right of you which appears to cast slight shadows across your models.  Otherwise, a lovely moment captured for a timeless bride''s memory.', '2007-01-26 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
