(3287031, 449078, 54843, '<td valign="top">WOW - you got screwed by the voters!  I personally like this. I get what you were trying to do and I think you got exactly what you wanted.  Congrats on that.  It''s too bad that people can''t see past the normal technicals of photography and see the art/intention of the photog.  What is even more ridiculous is that the only techniacal issue would be focus and it is more than obvious this was done on purpose.<br/> <br/>Somtimes I just don''t get DPC voters!<br/> <br/>Great work.</td>', 'WOW - you got screwed by the voters!  I personally like this. I get what you were trying to do and I think you got exactly what you wanted.  Congrats on that.  It''s too bad that people can''t see past the normal technicals of photography and see the art/intention of the photog.  What is even more ridiculous is that the only techniacal issue would be focus and it is more than obvious this was done on purpose. Somtimes I just don''t get DPC voters! Great work.', '2007-01-26 13:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
