(3288116, 449446, 32997, '<td valign="top">you know I only gave out three 10''s, and this was one of them...and I stop and wonder and think...now this forces me to consider the value of this whole voting process on this site...it makes me tired to see people exploring the same things over and over simply to win nothing (a virtual ribbon), and then for so many people to simply breeze past such thought provoking work...so maybe I simply need a mental adjustment, a check up on my humility meter...<br/>but one thing I refuse to do, is to be lulled into missing the exciting things I find on this site...and I am glad you are here, and sharing your work, because without shots like this...well I would simply move on...</td>', 'you know I only gave out three 10''s, and this was one of them...and I stop and wonder and think...now this forces me to consider the value of this whole voting process on this site...it makes me tired to see people exploring the same things over and over simply to win nothing (a virtual ribbon), and then for so many people to simply breeze past such thought provoking work...so maybe I simply need a mental adjustment, a check up on my humility meter...but one thing I refuse to do, is to be lulled into missing the exciting things I find on this site...and I am glad you are here, and sharing your work, because without shots like this...well I would simply move on...', '2007-01-26 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
