(3288191, 451793, 32997, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have known this was yours...:)<br/>I must say it stopped me though...a shot <i>just</i> of an animal means nothing to me...but you don''t do that, you always seem to spot some sort of design, or find a unique compostion that draws me in..so in hindsight I should have figured it out...you know I have never really shot animals at a zoo, and I figure if I ever need to see them, then I can always zip over to your portfolio...</td>', 'I wouldn''t have known this was yours...:)I must say it stopped me though...a shot just of an animal means nothing to me...but you don''t do that, you always seem to spot some sort of design, or find a unique compostion that draws me in..so in hindsight I should have figured it out...you know I have never really shot animals at a zoo, and I figure if I ever need to see them, then I can always zip over to your portfolio...', '2007-01-26 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
