(3288679, 449691, 19708, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how I really can''t put my finger on just exactly what it is about this shot I like so much. I was right about my hunch that the voters wouldn''t find enough wow in this to get it up the scale where I thought it should be, but top 1/3 in such a challenge wasn''t too bad of a finish, and you just about nailed a perfect bell curve in the vote spread.<br/>Well done and congrats!</td>', 'It''s funny how I really can''t put my finger on just exactly what it is about this shot I like so much. I was right about my hunch that the voters wouldn''t find enough wow in this to get it up the scale where I thought it should be, but top 1/3 in such a challenge wasn''t too bad of a finish, and you just about nailed a perfect bell curve in the vote spread.Well done and congrats!', '2007-01-26 20:21:52.000000', NULL, 0),
