(3288859, 448148, 19708, '<td valign="top">A gracious thanks to all that voted and those that felt moved enough to comment and make it a favorite.<br/> <br/>Here is the color version:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=350951" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/350951.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/350951.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/350951.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Each image, though the same, are very different.<br/>I have a strong belief that if you want to transmit emotion out of an image,<br/>strip the colors, as they tend to over-complicate things in our brain.</td>', 'A gracious thanks to all that voted and those that felt moved enough to comment and make it a favorite. Here is the color version:  Each image, though the same, are very different.I have a strong belief that if you want to transmit emotion out of an image,strip the colors, as they tend to over-complicate things in our brain.', '2007-01-26 21:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
