(3289420, 448668, 19708, '<td valign="top">I love the part about the batteries - I''ve been there a few times too...<br/> <br/>I really don''t have to tell you that this is a superb photograph - the voters already did that by it ending up in 25th place, in a HUGE challenge - that is a statement all on it''s own. If a stunning example of a photograph being all about composition AND lighting, well this is, without a doubt, one that should be a benchmark.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a great finish David. You choice was perfect.</td>', 'I love the part about the batteries - I''ve been there a few times too... I really don''t have to tell you that this is a superb photograph - the voters already did that by it ending up in 25th place, in a HUGE challenge - that is a statement all on it''s own. If a stunning example of a photograph being all about composition AND lighting, well this is, without a doubt, one that should be a benchmark. Congrats on a great finish David. You choice was perfect.', '2007-01-27 00:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
