(3291607, 451111, 14986, '<td valign="top">Yep...now that I have my new monitor I agree...the eyes are overdone.  Although, honestly I didn''t do a whole lot to them.  A bit of contrast and saturation, but both on the low end.<br/> <br/>It is so frustrating to determine what monitor settings will be giving the most accurate portrayal of the photo, and it makes such a huge difference in the quality of the shot.</td>', 'Yep...now that I have my new monitor I agree...the eyes are overdone.  Although, honestly I didn''t do a whole lot to them.  A bit of contrast and saturation, but both on the low end. It is so frustrating to determine what monitor settings will be giving the most accurate portrayal of the photo, and it makes such a huge difference in the quality of the shot.', '2007-01-27 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 0),
