(3291815, 447855, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bucket:</b></div><hr/><i> you should have gotten a lot closer and tested his stare down..just think of the series of shots you could have had...being chased and beaten, seeing the inmates flee, the cops rushing in...a  few bloody self-portraits...<br/>and ribbons, lots of ribbons! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Good idea for a series.  I was concerned that if I had gone any closer, his stare would''ve broken my lens, pierced my brain, and lobotomized me for sure!  At least with a lobotomy I wouldn''t care about spending the rest of my life in his prison. :-D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-27 18:02:09.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by bucket: you should have gotten a lot closer and tested his stare down..just think of the series of shots you could have had...being chased and beaten, seeing the inmates flee, the cops rushing in...a  few bloody self-portraits...and ribbons, lots of ribbons!  Good idea for a series.  I was concerned that if I had gone any closer, his stare would''ve broken my lens, pierced my brain, and lobotomized me for sure!  At least with a lobotomy I wouldn''t care about spending the rest of my life in his prison. :-D', '2007-01-27 18:00:35.000000', '2007-01-27 18:02:09.000000', 0),
