(3292586, 450434, 12253, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this isn''t in the top 10.  I read through the comments for clues of something that dragged it down, but there aren''t any.  Maybe it''s the 720 pixel limit; this is quite the shot and needs room to breathe!  In any case, it''s definitely one of the best I''ve seen in 2006. <br/> <br/>Happy shooting in 2007--perhaps we''ll find ourselves with an opportunity to shoot together sometime.</td>', 'I can''t believe this isn''t in the top 10.  I read through the comments for clues of something that dragged it down, but there aren''t any.  Maybe it''s the 720 pixel limit; this is quite the shot and needs room to breathe!  In any case, it''s definitely one of the best I''ve seen in 2006.  Happy shooting in 2007--perhaps we''ll find ourselves with an opportunity to shoot together sometime.', '2007-01-28 00:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
