(3295101, 451569, 46336, '<td valign="top">Davy - fantastic, dramatic shot : the colours are superb. I''m assuming this HDR was done from a single exposure. I think DPC voters are getting over HDR, otherwise this would have done better. I would love to see more detail in the foreground (which I''m sure you have in your prime version).</td>', 'Davy - fantastic, dramatic shot : the colours are superb. I''m assuming this HDR was done from a single exposure. I think DPC voters are getting over HDR, otherwise this would have done better. I would love to see more detail in the foreground (which I''m sure you have in your prime version).', '2007-01-28 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
