(3475464, 449260, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on the first place this won in the sculpture park photo contest. I can see why it won; it is indeed a lovely shot. The light, focus, composition, and sky are excellent. It must have been disappointing to receive such an average score from the DPC voters. I think the "Best of ..." challenges are always rated on a very high curve. And the voters don''t have any topic to help in the evaluation.</td>', 'Congratulation on the first place this won in the sculpture park photo contest. I can see why it won; it is indeed a lovely shot. The light, focus, composition, and sky are excellent. It must have been disappointing to receive such an average score from the DPC voters. I think the "Best of ..." challenges are always rated on a very high curve. And the voters don''t have any topic to help in the evaluation.', '2007-03-20 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
