(3516986, 447727, 48227, '<td valign="top">THis is fantastic photo, 446 , you must be kidding me, sooooooo<br/>UNDERRATED. Your portfolio is amazing, I can''t belive I didn''t<br/>see your work earlier. AMAZINGGGG!!!</td>', 'THis is fantastic photo, 446 , you must be kidding me, soooooooUNDERRATED. Your portfolio is amazing, I can''t belive I didn''tsee your work earlier. AMAZINGGGG!!!', '2007-04-04 01:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3522238, 447565, 51386, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this one. Regardless of other comments, I find the processing and the forced look of her pose quite effective. Seems like the kind of thing that goes unnoticed when nobody''s paying attention. I dont know if it''s the crop, but something keeps leading my eye out of the picture. It may be the white cloth in the bg..<br/> <br/>By the way, I like your lighting techniques on portraiture.</td>', 'I love the feel of this one. Regardless of other comments, I find the processing and the forced look of her pose quite effective. Seems like the kind of thing that goes unnoticed when nobody''s paying attention. I dont know if it''s the crop, but something keeps leading my eye out of the picture. It may be the white cloth in the bg.. By the way, I like your lighting techniques on portraiture.', '2007-04-05 12:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3522789, 451940, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the royal blue and purplish tones.  This is an amazing and frightening capture.  Gorgeous!</td>', 'I love the royal blue and purplish tones.  This is an amazing and frightening capture.  Gorgeous!', '2007-04-05 16:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3526886, 451028, 39144, '<td valign="top">Man, what an awesome photo. I love how you not only captured an interesting landmark, but also managed to get it with a during what I call an "emotional" moment, when the photo becomes soooo much more than just a documentation of both the locationa and the current lighting. It now captures the mood of the moment as well. Awesome work!</td>', 'Man, what an awesome photo. I love how you not only captured an interesting landmark, but also managed to get it with a during what I call an "emotional" moment, when the photo becomes soooo much more than just a documentation of both the locationa and the current lighting. It now captures the mood of the moment as well. Awesome work!', '2007-04-07 02:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3527961, 447638, 74804, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful reds! Great perspective, a bit too much saturation, but its still gorgeous!</td>', 'absolutely beautiful reds! Great perspective, a bit too much saturation, but its still gorgeous!', '2007-04-07 16:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
