(3610389, 451744, 49652, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!', '2007-05-03 12:30:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3613532, 451959, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is so dam cute, and a wonderful image to cheer me up.....</td>', 'This is so dam cute, and a wonderful image to cheer me up.....', '2007-05-04 03:20:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3614120, 449078, 8367, '<td valign="top">A joy to view.</td>', 'A joy to view.', '2007-05-04 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3616811, 451843, 27514, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this shot ray! I like how the colors of the background and then the browns of the barn balance each other and then that green from the grass is just so appealing. you have a very nice sense of color! I also enjoy the use of the leading line of the road that just leads you to that barn. I think the only actual critique I can offer is the focus seems a tad off, but I think it may be the lens. I just got a new lens to replace that and was surprised how not sharp that lens is. it''s a good lens, just not tack sharp like some others are.<br/> <br/>overall great shot though, wish I would have voted in this challenge.</td>', 'I really enjoy this shot ray! I like how the colors of the background and then the browns of the barn balance each other and then that green from the grass is just so appealing. you have a very nice sense of color! I also enjoy the use of the leading line of the road that just leads you to that barn. I think the only actual critique I can offer is the focus seems a tad off, but I think it may be the lens. I just got a new lens to replace that and was surprised how not sharp that lens is. it''s a good lens, just not tack sharp like some others are. overall great shot though, wish I would have voted in this challenge.', '2007-05-05 00:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3617240, 447638, 77965, '<td valign="top">one thing, the LH is too nearer the frame line. composionally almost centered. slightly good work at photoshop. but why  deep red line on the left . why?again there is enough space up or down to reduce and raise the impact of the whole scene. better cut from the foreground. make two L-shaped cardboard cutouts and view the pic.moving them up or down,or sideways and make the best of composition of your good photograph.</td>', 'one thing, the LH is too nearer the frame line. composionally almost centered. slightly good work at photoshop. but why  deep red line on the left . why?again there is enough space up or down to reduce and raise the impact of the whole scene. better cut from the foreground. make two L-shaped cardboard cutouts and view the pic.moving them up or down,or sideways and make the best of composition of your good photograph.', '2007-05-05 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3618686, 448022, 19982, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this is sitting at 42nd place.  I loved it and gave it a 10 and I''d give it a higher score if I could.  Well done!</td>', 'I can''t believe this is sitting at 42nd place.  I loved it and gave it a 10 and I''d give it a higher score if I could.  Well done!', '2007-05-05 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3625389, 451871, 77968, '<td valign="top">the technique of channel mixing at this level is my absolute favorite effect. this is still one of my all time favorite IR shots. super contrasts of false color. great job! -john</td>', 'the technique of channel mixing at this level is my absolute favorite effect. this is still one of my all time favorite IR shots. super contrasts of false color. great job! -john', '2007-05-07 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
