(3641044, 447677, 19708, '<td valign="top">Skip mentioned not being connected more due to a lack of emotion, yet the longer I sit and study this, the connection strengthens, wondering what''s going on behind those beautiful eyes. I would have never paid any attention to the close proximity to the background had I not read it below, and even then, still don''t really see it, as her gaze and those golden locks of hair keeps my attention.<br/> <br/>Guess I''m saying I can''t find fault in this wonderful portrait Judy.<br/>Adding to my favorites.</td>', 'Skip mentioned not being connected more due to a lack of emotion, yet the longer I sit and study this, the connection strengthens, wondering what''s going on behind those beautiful eyes. I would have never paid any attention to the close proximity to the background had I not read it below, and even then, still don''t really see it, as her gaze and those golden locks of hair keeps my attention. Guess I''m saying I can''t find fault in this wonderful portrait Judy.Adding to my favorites.', '2007-05-12 01:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3641511, 450651, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2007-05-12 08:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
