(3650868, 451467, 32133, '<td valign="top">THis is a beautiful pix.  The expression and pose are lovely and innocent.  The background works perfectly.  A wonderful capture.  <br/> <br/>If I was being nit pickey, I would say it could be a bit sharper. <br/> <br/>I''d be proud of this shot!</td>', 'THis is a beautiful pix.  The expression and pose are lovely and innocent.  The background works perfectly.  A wonderful capture.   If I was being nit pickey, I would say it could be a bit sharper.  I''d be proud of this shot!', '2007-05-15 09:26:43.000000', NULL, 0),
