(4120310, 451843, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Some beautiful country in your area.  This is a stunning photo.  The color and the lines (leading road, horizontal hillside) work very well to create impact.<br/> <br/>I''m hoping for some fall color myself as I''m planning an outing with a friend of mine (former DPCer ''nova'') in the Shenandoah''s a couple weeks from now.<br/> <br/>Now, if I could only find some foggy hills, a weathered barn... :P</td>', 'Wow!  Some beautiful country in your area.  This is a stunning photo.  The color and the lines (leading road, horizontal hillside) work very well to create impact. I''m hoping for some fall color myself as I''m planning an outing with a friend of mine (former DPCer ''nova'') in the Shenandoah''s a couple weeks from now. Now, if I could only find some foggy hills, a weathered barn... :P', '2007-09-27 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
