(4236363, 447517, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I get dizzy just looking at shots with people this close to the edge :)   I think it''s very well done...with the idea of the silhouette.  It appeared all black to me until I went back to really look...and I don''t think that''s a big deal.  I love how you have the bright colors, and yet the subject is really the silhouette.  I also like his stance / pose.  Nicely seen and photographed.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I get dizzy just looking at shots with people this close to the edge :)   I think it''s very well done...with the idea of the silhouette.  It appeared all black to me until I went back to really look...and I don''t think that''s a big deal.  I love how you have the bright colors, and yet the subject is really the silhouette.  I also like his stance / pose.  Nicely seen and photographed.', '2007-11-10 01:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
