(4380286, 449158, 42013, '<td valign="top">Enzo, I had to go back and look at this one from 06. Comparing with your current ribbon winner the contrast is amazing. This one, while very good, has distinct processing with heavy darks, shocking clouds, and an overall look that screams ''processed''. In comparison, your newest edition has all of the drama but with the slightest touch of processing...just enough to really make the picture WOW! In particular, your sand on the ribbon winner is amazing. Your newest one is like this one ''all grown up''. Keep up the great work! mark<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-10 01:31:26.</i></td>', 'Enzo, I had to go back and look at this one from 06. Comparing with your current ribbon winner the contrast is amazing. This one, while very good, has distinct processing with heavy darks, shocking clouds, and an overall look that screams ''processed''. In comparison, your newest edition has all of the drama but with the slightest touch of processing...just enough to really make the picture WOW! In particular, your sand on the ribbon winner is amazing. Your newest one is like this one ''all grown up''. Keep up the great work! mark', '2008-01-10 01:17:49.000000', '2008-01-10 01:31:26.000000', 0),
(4393965, 447639, 72268, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2008-01-15 14:29:57.000000', NULL, 0),
