(4818510, 451963, 7743, '<td valign="top">Macro can be difficult,especially when shooting close to wide open.  The DOF is so shallow that any slight movement (by the photographer or the subject) can throw the focus off.<br/> <br/>Using a tripod will help as well as shooting when there is no breeze whatsoever (in the case of flowers).<br/> <br/>The focus here doesn''t seem to be accurate as no part of the flower seems to be in crisp focus.</td>', 'Macro can be difficult,especially when shooting close to wide open.  The DOF is so shallow that any slight movement (by the photographer or the subject) can throw the focus off. Using a tripod will help as well as shooting when there is no breeze whatsoever (in the case of flowers). The focus here doesn''t seem to be accurate as no part of the flower seems to be in crisp focus.', '2008-07-11 02:33:24.000000', NULL, 0),
